(746339, 80724, 20774, '<td valign="top">Very neet image! really love it! Maybe Because i''m a ultimate player myself! If your into ultimate please say something! Good luck on the photo 10 for the foto and for the ideia!</td>', 'Very neet image! really love it! Maybe Because i''m a ultimate player myself! If your into ultimate please say something! Good luck on the photo 10 for the foto and for the ideia!', '2004-06-02 01:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(746341, 80815, 12448, '<td valign="top">I''ll be the first, maybe second to say this and I"m sure not the last but it''s supposed to be WITHOUT players, you are going to probably get a lot of lower scores because of that.  Nice capture, good expressions but the overall shot doesn''t really do anything for me and the fact you included people also loses points.  A 4</td>', 'I''ll be the first, maybe second to say this and I"m sure not the last but it''s supposed to be WITHOUT players, you are going to probably get a lot of lower scores because of that.  Nice capture, good expressions but the overall shot doesn''t really do anything for me and the fact you included people also loses points.  A 4', '2004-06-02 01:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(746343, 80831, 20210, '<td valign="top">a more shallow depth of field would have helped this shot a lot, and a better exposure on the ball.  great timing on it, though!</td>', 'a more shallow depth of field would have helped this shot a lot, and a better exposure on the ball.  great timing on it, though!', '2004-06-02 01:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
