(746361, 80822, 20210, '<td valign="top">The title is rather redundant.  And I wish the rest of the shot, other than the moving ball, was crisper.  Can''t fault you for the great timing though!</td>', 'The title is rather redundant.  And I wish the rest of the shot, other than the moving ball, was crisper.  Can''t fault you for the great timing though!', '2004-06-02 01:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
