(746370, 80852, 3599, '<td valign="top">Holy cow!  The SHAPE Spartans.  I was stationed at SHAPE from 1998-2000.  They had a pretty good football then too.  Small world.  Anyway, not a bad photo here.  The jacket is slightly overexposd towarsd the top.  The detail in the jacket and patch are great.  Good work and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Holy cow!  The SHAPE Spartans.  I was stationed at SHAPE from 1998-2000.  They had a pretty good football then too.  Small world.  Anyway, not a bad photo here.  The jacket is slightly overexposd towarsd the top.  The detail in the jacket and patch are great.  Good work and good luck in the challenge.', '2004-06-02 01:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(746371, 80279, 20210, '<td valign="top">eek, can''t tell what this is at all.  dark, even on my mac.  Sorry about that.  I fell victim to the "too dark" problem in a previous challenge.  I know the kind of comments you''ll be receiving.  Keep at it, don''t let us discourage you! :)</td>', 'eek, can''t tell what this is at all.  dark, even on my mac.  Sorry about that.  I fell victim to the "too dark" problem in a previous challenge.  I know the kind of comments you''ll be receiving.  Keep at it, don''t let us discourage you! :)', '2004-06-02 01:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(746372, 79525, 16301, '<td valign="top">How is this related to the challenge? I see no connection...The title doesn''t help me understand the photo too. Good luck in the other challenges though...</td>', 'How is this related to the challenge? I see no connection...The title doesn''t help me understand the photo too. Good luck in the other challenges though...', '2004-06-02 01:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
