(746435, 79777, 10614, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture.  Nice capture with Buckingham Fountain in background.  Also, that diamond building of center is my favorite building in the whole world.  YOu have got to love Chicago!!!</td>', 'Beautiful picture.  Nice capture with Buckingham Fountain in background.  Also, that diamond building of center is my favorite building in the whole world.  YOu have got to love Chicago!!!', '2004-06-02 01:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(746437, 79450, 6008, '<td valign="top">Love the dark tone and texture of the shot. The old glove and the choice of black and white gives it some age and nice emotive value. Nicely captured.</td>', 'Love the dark tone and texture of the shot. The old glove and the choice of black and white gives it some age and nice emotive value. Nicely captured.', '2004-06-02 01:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(746439, 80516, 12962, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I don;t know what happened ... my comment for another photo appeared here. This is my comment:  Colors are wonderful, earthy and the silver compliments the shimmer of the water.  The composition and arrangement of the canoes are very satisfying ... reflecting  a feeling of a job well done ... which is how one feels after having canoed the whole day.</td>', 'Sorry, I don;t know what happened ... my comment for another photo appeared here. This is my comment:  Colors are wonderful, earthy and the silver compliments the shimmer of the water.  The composition and arrangement of the canoes are very satisfying ... reflecting  a feeling of a job well done ... which is how one feels after having canoed the whole day.', '2004-06-02 01:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(746442, 80815, 7322, '<td valign="top">Um...this shows the players. It''s a good shot though. The person in the blue shirt is a distraction. Definitely does not meet the challenge.</td>', 'Um...this shows the players. It''s a good shot though. The person in the blue shirt is a distraction. Definitely does not meet the challenge.', '2004-06-02 02:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(746443, 79488, 6008, '<td valign="top">The vendor with his nicely bright shirt breaks up the repeated pattern of the crowd. The curve of the seating is good too. The lights are a little distracting and gives the image an almost misty red cast over the left side. It''s a good shot but doesnt hold much wow with me.</td>', 'The vendor with his nicely bright shirt breaks up the repeated pattern of the crowd. The curve of the seating is good too. The lights are a little distracting and gives the image an almost misty red cast over the left side. It''s a good shot but doesnt hold much wow with me.', '2004-06-02 02:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(746444, 80833, 12962, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is awesome.  Not just the rained out capture but the fact that there is basically nobody in your frame taken in a city of ... 10 million people!  That in itself is a huge accomplishment in my book.</td>', 'Wow, this is awesome.  Not just the rained out capture but the fact that there is basically nobody in your frame taken in a city of ... 10 million people!  That in itself is a huge accomplishment in my book.', '2004-06-02 02:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(746447, 80614, 6008, '<td valign="top">The old balls and hats certainly give the image an aged mood, especially with the choice of black and white. The toning itself seems a little flat and could do with additional contrast. Additionally, although the lighting is good, the background is far too close to the items and the creases and textures are a little too prominent.</td>', 'The old balls and hats certainly give the image an aged mood, especially with the choice of black and white. The toning itself seems a little flat and could do with additional contrast. Additionally, although the lighting is good, the background is far too close to the items and the creases and textures are a little too prominent.', '2004-06-02 02:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(746449, 80665, 20774, '<td valign="top">Its a great ideia but theres too much noise on the pic! It seems like the picture is a little out of focus, don''t really know if you wanted to but the glove out of focus too! but guess not! Good Try anyways!</td>', 'Its a great ideia but theres too much noise on the pic! It seems like the picture is a little out of focus, don''t really know if you wanted to but the glove out of focus too! but guess not! Good Try anyways!', '2004-06-02 02:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(746450, 79875, 12962, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  It''s a simple picture but it represents so much.  Well seen, well captured and well thought of.</td>', 'Beautiful.  It''s a simple picture but it represents so much.  Well seen, well captured and well thought of.', '2004-06-02 02:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(746451, 80842, 16479, '<td valign="top">could have been better if the goal is facing the viewer....imo....still a good variation from the others. 7</td>', 'could have been better if the goal is facing the viewer....imo....still a good variation from the others. 7', '2004-06-02 02:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(746452, 80896, 20774, '<td valign="top">This is a really great shot! love the relfex on the water! good job</td>', 'This is a really great shot! love the relfex on the water! good job', '2004-06-02 02:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(746453, 80020, 12962, '<td valign="top">Awesome action depicted here.  I love the dirt ... I don''t like the inclusion of the riders though because they''re not supposed to be in the picture as the challenge says:  Creatively capture the notion of any team sport without photographing the players themselves. <br/></td>', 'Awesome action depicted here.  I love the dirt ... I don''t like the inclusion of the riders though because they''re not supposed to be in the picture as the challenge says:  Creatively capture the notion of any team sport without photographing the players themselves. ', '2004-06-02 02:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(746456, 80531, 6008, '<td valign="top">The smoke and lights are good, but the mascot is a little too small and so the scoreboard seems to be the main focus, which isnt all that interesting.</td>', 'The smoke and lights are good, but the mascot is a little too small and so the scoreboard seems to be the main focus, which isnt all that interesting.', '2004-06-02 02:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(746457, 79956, 12962, '<td valign="top">Oh, cool.  I love the expression you''ve caught here ... so much curiousity, anticipation, interest, concentration ... and love for the game.  One of my favorites so far.  (The reflection on the wall is exquisite.)  A ten, of course.</td>', 'Oh, cool.  I love the expression you''ve caught here ... so much curiousity, anticipation, interest, concentration ... and love for the game.  One of my favorites so far.  (The reflection on the wall is exquisite.)  A ten, of course.', '2004-06-02 02:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(746458, 80598, 10614, '<td valign="top">Great take on the challenge.  I am glad you chose black &amp; white.  I believe all of the different colors  would be distracting.</td>', 'Great take on the challenge.  I am glad you chose black & white.  I believe all of the different colors  would be distracting.', '2004-06-02 02:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(746462, 80878, 6008, '<td valign="top">The dof and perspective is good although I''d personally be tempted to crop out some of the right to get rid of the white at the bottom right and the vent in to the top right. The focus also seems to be on the lock and not the shoes, which I''m guessing are suppose to be the focal point.</td>', 'The dof and perspective is good although I''d personally be tempted to crop out some of the right to get rid of the white at the bottom right and the vent in to the top right. The focus also seems to be on the lock and not the shoes, which I''m guessing are suppose to be the focal point.', '2004-06-02 02:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(746464, 80261, 12962, '<td valign="top">This is the best (so far) illustration of the challenge IMHO.  The sepia treatment works ... gives it a nostalgic feeling like a 50s or 60s post card.  Should be in the top three if not the top.</td>', 'This is the best (so far) illustration of the challenge IMHO.  The sepia treatment works ... gives it a nostalgic feeling like a 50s or 60s post card.  Should be in the top three if not the top.', '2004-06-02 02:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(746468, 80210, 6008, '<td valign="top">The idea is certainly a good one but the image fails for a number of reasons for me. Firstly, the composition isnt all that great with the negative space in the bottom right and the ball cropped on the left. There is also a border of shadow/curb at the top - if the image was staged then the background should be taken into account and moved to a continuous patch of grass. The grass itself is quite dull-looking and some saturation boost in an editing program would have helped some.</td>', 'The idea is certainly a good one but the image fails for a number of reasons for me. Firstly, the composition isnt all that great with the negative space in the bottom right and the ball cropped on the left. There is also a border of shadow/curb at the top - if the image was staged then the background should be taken into account and moved to a continuous patch of grass. The grass itself is quite dull-looking and some saturation boost in an editing program would have helped some.', '2004-06-02 02:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(746469, 80862, 12962, '<td valign="top">Puts a smile on the readers'' face ... suggests a home town feeling that always tugs on the heart.  Very well planned!</td>', 'Puts a smile on the readers'' face ... suggests a home town feeling that always tugs on the heart.  Very well planned!', '2004-06-02 02:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(746472, 80763, 6008, '<td valign="top">Hrm, not sure what to say about this. The light seems far too even as if it was harsh mid afternoon sun, which isnt always a bad thing but it makes the image feel a little flat. The amount of masts in the background give it a somewhat chaotic feeling, plus some of those masts, including the focus yacht have been cropped out of the image. Stepping back, if possible, and getting the boat in context and at a different time of day, or else getting closer and shooting an element of the boat may have been a slight improvement.</td>', 'Hrm, not sure what to say about this. The light seems far too even as if it was harsh mid afternoon sun, which isnt always a bad thing but it makes the image feel a little flat. The amount of masts in the background give it a somewhat chaotic feeling, plus some of those masts, including the focus yacht have been cropped out of the image. Stepping back, if possible, and getting the boat in context and at a different time of day, or else getting closer and shooting an element of the boat may have been a slight improvement.', '2004-06-02 02:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(746475, 80685, 19066, '<td valign="top">team sport?  where?</td>', 'team sport?  where?', '2004-06-02 02:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(746477, 80719, 21478, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, and title to match.</td>', 'Nice composition, and title to match.', '2004-06-02 02:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
