(746480, 80109, 21478, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Good composition with the field off center. The colors (maybe its my screen) seem a bit off though.</td>', 'Nice shot. Good composition with the field off center. The colors (maybe its my screen) seem a bit off though.', '2004-06-02 02:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
