(746482, 79956, 6008, '<td valign="top">The first thing I notice is that the focus is off - it seems to be on the wires, or even the reflection of her face, and not on her real face. I also wonder the context of the shot - the title suggests it is after the game, but what is she looking at? Did the team win or lose? The colors are good and the reflection is a nice touch, but unfortunately it''s been cropped out some.</td>', 'The first thing I notice is that the focus is off - it seems to be on the wires, or even the reflection of her face, and not on her real face. I also wonder the context of the shot - the title suggests it is after the game, but what is she looking at? Did the team win or lose? The colors are good and the reflection is a nice touch, but unfortunately it''s been cropped out some.', '2004-06-02 02:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(746483, 80515, 21478, '<td valign="top">Wow! well destroyed! A little to dark for me though.</td>', 'Wow! well destroyed! A little to dark for me though.', '2004-06-02 02:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(746484, 79580, 12962, '<td valign="top">Very good idea ... and surely illustrates the spirit of the challenge.  As for technical consideration, focus to me looks soft, maybe it would have more impact if the focus was right on.</td>', 'Very good idea ... and surely illustrates the spirit of the challenge.  As for technical consideration, focus to me looks soft, maybe it would have more impact if the focus was right on.', '2004-06-02 02:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(746485, 80665, 21478, '<td valign="top">great shot with sense of good motion. Nice work. The colors also add a "historic" feel to it.</td>', 'great shot with sense of good motion. Nice work. The colors also add a "historic" feel to it.', '2004-06-02 02:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(746487, 80588, 21478, '<td valign="top">I don''t really get the link to the team sport (soccer I take it)... but nice colors.</td>', 'I don''t really get the link to the team sport (soccer I take it)... but nice colors.', '2004-06-02 02:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(746489, 80819, 12962, '<td valign="top">Awesome.  Gives a feeling of being robbed of anticipation, of arriving to the field and there is no game ... the desaturation reinforces this feeling ...</td>', 'Awesome.  Gives a feeling of being robbed of anticipation, of arriving to the field and there is no game ... the desaturation reinforces this feeling ...', '2004-06-02 02:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(746490, 80239, 6008, '<td valign="top">Good detail and sharpness, and the color is nicely vibrant too. Without the title to support it then the image would certainly bring interest as the viewer tries to work out what exactly they are seeing. After a while it is obvious, but taking in the various bits of the image and filling in the blanks left by the crop is part of the enjoyment. Nicely captured.</td>', 'Good detail and sharpness, and the color is nicely vibrant too. Without the title to support it then the image would certainly bring interest as the viewer tries to work out what exactly they are seeing. After a while it is obvious, but taking in the various bits of the image and filling in the blanks left by the crop is part of the enjoyment. Nicely captured.', '2004-06-02 02:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(746491, 80896, 21478, '<td valign="top">Seems a little plain, and the white spots on the ground detract from what I am guessing was your attempt at a smooth reflective surface. Good concept - just difficult to execute.</td>', 'Seems a little plain, and the white spots on the ground detract from what I am guessing was your attempt at a smooth reflective surface. Good concept - just difficult to execute.', '2004-06-02 02:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
