(746539, 79495, 6008, '<td valign="top">A very abstract shot. Hrm, I wonder what it would look like to have the black bar go from top left corner to bottom right corner spliting the image in half diagonally. As it is now, it almost looks like a bad tilt. The texture of the ball looks good, looks like it has had a lot of use.</td>', 'A very abstract shot. Hrm, I wonder what it would look like to have the black bar go from top left corner to bottom right corner spliting the image in half diagonally. As it is now, it almost looks like a bad tilt. The texture of the ball looks good, looks like it has had a lot of use.', '2004-06-02 02:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(746540, 80167, 6008, '<td valign="top">Uh oh, you got a player''s foot in! Just kidding. It''s a good action shot with the movement on the whatever you call it and the spray of dirt from the ground. Composition is good too.</td>', 'Uh oh, you got a player''s foot in! Just kidding. It''s a good action shot with the movement on the whatever you call it and the spray of dirt from the ground. Composition is good too.', '2004-06-02 02:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
