(746543, 80758, 6804, '<td valign="top">This is just awesome!  It''s one of my favorites in the challenge. I hope the voters don''t give you a hard time because you can see legs (but not players).  I like the panorama look of this. It creates an unbalanced feeling because I want to see the rest of the picture. That feeling is exactly where I find the artistic strength in this.  I really like it!</td>', 'This is just awesome!  It''s one of my favorites in the challenge. I hope the voters don''t give you a hard time because you can see legs (but not players).  I like the panorama look of this. It creates an unbalanced feeling because I want to see the rest of the picture. That feeling is exactly where I find the artistic strength in this.  I really like it!', '2004-06-02 02:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(746547, 80657, 6008, '<td valign="top">I like the use of negative space and the composition is good. The color of the sky is excellent and contrasts nicely with the white backboard. Just a tad oversharpened as you can see the fine white halo around the edges. Nicely captured.</td>', 'I like the use of negative space and the composition is good. The color of the sky is excellent and contrasts nicely with the white backboard. Just a tad oversharpened as you can see the fine white halo around the edges. Nicely captured.', '2004-06-02 02:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
