(746565, 80754, 6008, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing this is a minature version and the ball is standing still and the ''flying'' pin is posed there, but it''s a good shot! I like the reflections on the ball, although they seem ''odd'' for a bowling ball, especially with the blue reflection on the pin. Marble?I like it!</td>', 'I''m guessing this is a minature version and the ball is standing still and the ''flying'' pin is posed there, but it''s a good shot! I like the reflections on the ball, although they seem ''odd'' for a bowling ball, especially with the blue reflection on the pin. Marble?I like it!', '2004-06-02 02:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
