(746589, 80680, 9809, '<td valign="top">The players hands are in the photo -- thus this photo includes players -- does not meet the challenge. Oh, and the picture is way small.</td>', 'The players hands are in the photo -- thus this photo includes players -- does not meet the challenge. Oh, and the picture is way small.', '2004-06-02 03:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(746591, 79799, 9809, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.... meets the challenge... doesn''t meet the challenge... that''s the debate in my head. On the one hand, these ARE the players in this game, if it is viewed as a team event, thus it doesn''t meet the challenge. On the other hand, this is a mechanical game where the real players manipulate the controls, which drive these players -- HOWEVER, the real players that manipulate these players are individuals -- 2 people pitted against each other -- clearly not a team sport. Hey, I talked myself into a "does not meet the challenge." Do you see why I think this?</td>', 'Hmmm.... meets the challenge... doesn''t meet the challenge... that''s the debate in my head. On the one hand, these ARE the players in this game, if it is viewed as a team event, thus it doesn''t meet the challenge. On the other hand, this is a mechanical game where the real players manipulate the controls, which drive these players -- HOWEVER, the real players that manipulate these players are individuals -- 2 people pitted against each other -- clearly not a team sport. Hey, I talked myself into a "does not meet the challenge." Do you see why I think this?', '2004-06-02 03:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(746594, 80485, 20774, '<td valign="top">Nice picture you got here! love the colors!! Great Job</td>', 'Nice picture you got here! love the colors!! Great Job', '2004-06-02 03:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(746595, 80854, 9809, '<td valign="top">Golf is rarely a team sport, right? I mean, it''s individual against individual. I clearly get this image of golf without the players though. The DOF is great to keep you focused on what is important: The ball, hole, and pin.</td>', 'Golf is rarely a team sport, right? I mean, it''s individual against individual. I clearly get this image of golf without the players though. The DOF is great to keep you focused on what is important: The ball, hole, and pin.', '2004-06-02 03:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(746596, 80490, 18958, '<td valign="top">Ball stick to bat !</td>', 'Ball stick to bat !', '2004-06-02 03:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(746599, 79799, 509, '<td valign="top">I thought about doing this at the last minute, wasn''t happy with my results though. I like how you accomplished this.   I think with a black backdrop (posterboard would work), the background could be made a little less prevalent.  Also, maybe including the puck on the players stick would give a better sense of action.  Finally, (this coming from a Penguins fan), the Flyer''s uniform contrasts greatly with the title = )  (Go Tampa!)   btw, nice work.</td>', 'I thought about doing this at the last minute, wasn''t happy with my results though. I like how you accomplished this.   I think with a black backdrop (posterboard would work), the background could be made a little less prevalent.  Also, maybe including the puck on the players stick would give a better sense of action.  Finally, (this coming from a Penguins fan), the Flyer''s uniform contrasts greatly with the title = )  (Go Tampa!)   btw, nice work.', '2004-06-02 03:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
