(747369, 80815, 16106, '<td valign="top">you are a bit too stopped down, the primary object is blurry and the extreme distance is distractingly sharp. I think a faster narrower DOF would have frozen and enphisised the action..  If you had slid a few feet to the left and gotten that time board and person in the chair out of the frame it would have helped alot.</td>', 'you are a bit too stopped down, the primary object is blurry and the extreme distance is distractingly sharp. I think a faster narrower DOF would have frozen and enphisised the action..  If you had slid a few feet to the left and gotten that time board and person in the chair out of the frame it would have helped alot.', '2004-06-02 15:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
