(748246, 80261, 10339, '<td valign="top">Wow! I really like the tones that you have captured here. Looks like you are in the pitcher''s area of the locker room.  The upper left seems a little over-exposed.</td>', 'Wow! I really like the tones that you have captured here. Looks like you are in the pitcher''s area of the locker room.  The upper left seems a little over-exposed.', '2004-06-03 02:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
