(748539, 80384, 18525, '<td valign="top">Just a little to much clutter for my liking. It became overkill.<br/>If you kept one base 1 glove (the one one the left), the old bat ,and the Yankees cap you would have had a stronger composition.<br/>Sometimes less is more<br/>Lighting seems to have made everything bland so B&amp;W might have been an option here.<br/>However it does fit the theme<br/>6 from me</td>', 'Just a little to much clutter for my liking. It became overkill.If you kept one base 1 glove (the one one the left), the old bat ,and the Yankees cap you would have had a stronger composition.Sometimes less is moreLighting seems to have made everything bland so B&W might have been an option here.However it does fit the theme6 from me', '2004-06-03 11:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(748547, 80682, 18525, '<td valign="top">This picture is okay however .If I were to follow this theme I would have placed the orange differently with some eaten and just skin aqnd perhaps not on a plate in the grass but with  plate/containor on  a players bench with the field as a backdrop with the net or goal posts or bleachers as backdrop.<br/> <br/>Orange slices are often served up as halftime refreshments but this composition<br/>just says fruit. <br/>5 from me.<br/>I think you had an excellent idea you just needed to expand on it some.</td>', 'This picture is okay however .If I were to follow this theme I would have placed the orange differently with some eaten and just skin aqnd perhaps not on a plate in the grass but with  plate/containor on  a players bench with the field as a backdrop with the net or goal posts or bleachers as backdrop. Orange slices are often served up as halftime refreshments but this compositionjust says fruit. 5 from me.I think you had an excellent idea you just needed to expand on it some.', '2004-06-03 12:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(748549, 80530, 18525, '<td valign="top">As a still life it is ... boring It looks like This picture from concept to completion<br/>meaning from set up to upload to DPchallenge took all of 5 minutes.<br/>So I scored you a 5<br/>How could you have done this better?<br/>1 suggestion ,find a good old worn wood or brick background with a nail and hang your skates on it . Make the composition good by proper placement and Ta Da you would have had a much better photo.IMO<br/>Placement of this  equipment just removes it so much from its element.</td>', 'As a still life it is ... boring It looks like This picture from concept to completionmeaning from set up to upload to DPchallenge took all of 5 minutes.So I scored you a 5How could you have done this better?1 suggestion ,find a good old worn wood or brick background with a nail and hang your skates on it . Make the composition good by proper placement and Ta Da you would have had a much better photo.IMOPlacement of this  equipment just removes it so much from its element.', '2004-06-03 12:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
