(748578, 80443, 9763, '<td valign="top">I would crop off a little on the left and bring the numbers toward the bottom of the photograph.  It''s a bit grey, perhaps it wasn''t a sunny day.  I feel the photo is missing some ''life'' to it.  Even without players, I think more color or a more exciting subject might help.  Good luck</td>', 'I would crop off a little on the left and bring the numbers toward the bottom of the photograph.  It''s a bit grey, perhaps it wasn''t a sunny day.  I feel the photo is missing some ''life'' to it.  Even without players, I think more color or a more exciting subject might help.  Good luck', '2004-06-03 12:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(748579, 80131, 9763, '<td valign="top">Excellent action shot!  I love the blue sky and composition.  I think the lighting could be better on the ball, but that would be hard to control, wouldn''t it?!</td>', 'Excellent action shot!  I love the blue sky and composition.  I think the lighting could be better on the ball, but that would be hard to control, wouldn''t it?!', '2004-06-03 12:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(748580, 80676, 9763, '<td valign="top">I think the crop is too tight on top and the ceiling is a little distracting.  I think the colors are fine, but the lighting is off (particularly on the ball).  The photo is also off on the horizon line.  You can see the rectangle behind the ball is not straight across.  I would change the angle you shot from to help strenghten this photo I think.</td>', 'I think the crop is too tight on top and the ceiling is a little distracting.  I think the colors are fine, but the lighting is off (particularly on the ball).  The photo is also off on the horizon line.  You can see the rectangle behind the ball is not straight across.  I would change the angle you shot from to help strenghten this photo I think.', '2004-06-03 12:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(748581, 80862, 9763, '<td valign="top">I like the color, and the viewers in height order is a nice touch!  The bag is a bit bright though.  The composition is nice :)</td>', 'I like the color, and the viewers in height order is a nice touch!  The bag is a bit bright though.  The composition is nice :)', '2004-06-03 12:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(748583, 80872, 9763, '<td valign="top">A tiny bit tilted and the mountain homes or buildings aren''t truly silhouetted (either show them better or take them out with silhoutting completely is my thought.  I like the sunset (or sunrise).</td>', 'A tiny bit tilted and the mountain homes or buildings aren''t truly silhouetted (either show them better or take them out with silhoutting completely is my thought.  I like the sunset (or sunrise).', '2004-06-03 12:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
