(748662, 79956, 22392, '<td valign="top">smashing colours, that caught my eye immediately. The look on her face is beautiful and ik like the composition with a lot of room voor the grass. colours are very much in balance that way.</td>', 'smashing colours, that caught my eye immediately. The look on her face is beautiful and ik like the composition with a lot of room voor the grass. colours are very much in balance that way.', '2004-06-03 13:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(748665, 80442, 16106, '<td valign="top">Good shot of a really ugly thing. I for one would have prefered a shot of the strong reaction of the kids rather than anything with that thing in it. good saturation, DOF, good technicals.</td>', 'Good shot of a really ugly thing. I for one would have prefered a shot of the strong reaction of the kids rather than anything with that thing in it. good saturation, DOF, good technicals.', '2004-06-03 13:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(748666, 80463, 16106, '<td valign="top">good idea but a bit too far back when posted at 640 pix. I can''t see any single reaction, makes for less drama, could it have worked with fewer people closer in?</td>', 'good idea but a bit too far back when posted at 640 pix. I can''t see any single reaction, makes for less drama, could it have worked with fewer people closer in?', '2004-06-03 13:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(748668, 80725, 17166, '<td valign="top">I like the idea.  I think this would work better taken from a different perspective so that something like the stands, scoreboard, or infield were more clearly visible.  Although you can see the shadow of the stands, the most apparent features are the light and the fence, which don''t really say "baseball"</td>', 'I like the idea.  I think this would work better taken from a different perspective so that something like the stands, scoreboard, or infield were more clearly visible.  Although you can see the shadow of the stands, the most apparent features are the light and the fence, which don''t really say "baseball"', '2004-06-03 13:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(748669, 80490, 16106, '<td valign="top">I know it is personal but I would have liked this shot better with a wooden bat, the brightly colored aluminum bat dominates the image without contributing much. Great idea, well executed, top ten</td>', 'I know it is personal but I would have liked this shot better with a wooden bat, the brightly colored aluminum bat dominates the image without contributing much. Great idea, well executed, top ten', '2004-06-03 13:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(748670, 80103, 22392, '<td valign="top">Such a nice but simple idea. Imho the best intepretation of the challenge.</td>', 'Such a nice but simple idea. Imho the best intepretation of the challenge.', '2004-06-03 13:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(748671, 80279, 16106, '<td valign="top">I see nothing here. Looks like it could have been entered in "team spots without layers". I hope you entered going for the brown ribbon because it looks like a lock.</td>', 'I see nothing here. Looks like it could have been entered in "team spots without layers". I hope you entered going for the brown ribbon because it looks like a lock.', '2004-06-03 13:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(748672, 80875, 22392, '<td valign="top">poor quality. uninteresting composition.</td>', 'poor quality. uninteresting composition.', '2004-06-03 13:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(748673, 79525, 22392, '<td valign="top">where''s the sport?</td>', 'where''s the sport?', '2004-06-03 13:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(748675, 79875, 22392, '<td valign="top">nice idea, but boring, pale, picture.</td>', 'nice idea, but boring, pale, picture.', '2004-06-03 13:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(748676, 79956, 15920, '<td valign="top">Good luck with this.  On an international site, you might not have too many people who know what MCG is, or "Footy" for that matter.  I like the picture, it is well composed, the model is cute, and the reflections add to the overall impact.  I might relax the highlights a bit though.</td>', 'Good luck with this.  On an international site, you might not have too many people who know what MCG is, or "Footy" for that matter.  I like the picture, it is well composed, the model is cute, and the reflections add to the overall impact.  I might relax the highlights a bit though.', '2004-06-03 13:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(748677, 79590, 17166, '<td valign="top">Go Ducks!  Probably not fair to add a couple points just ''cause I''m a U of O alum :)  As for comments on the photo itself, looks like it''s leaning to the left a little.  Might be easier to get a good exposure on a cloudy day, too.</td>', 'Go Ducks!  Probably not fair to add a couple points just ''cause I''m a U of O alum :)  As for comments on the photo itself, looks like it''s leaning to the left a little.  Might be easier to get a good exposure on a cloudy day, too.', '2004-06-03 13:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(748682, 80530, 7322, '<td valign="top">This flat white wall and uphostered chaird is a poor choice of background for this subject. If you can''t place your subject in context than it would be better to have a very simple background. This is kind of a mundane arrangement. It doesn''t make a lot of sense. Why place one skate on the arm of the chair instead of resting it near its partner. The lighting is very straightforward and dull. Sepia does not improve this poor image. I wish I could say something more positive. Keep trying.</td>', 'This flat white wall and uphostered chaird is a poor choice of background for this subject. If you can''t place your subject in context than it would be better to have a very simple background. This is kind of a mundane arrangement. It doesn''t make a lot of sense. Why place one skate on the arm of the chair instead of resting it near its partner. The lighting is very straightforward and dull. Sepia does not improve this poor image. I wish I could say something more positive. Keep trying.', '2004-06-03 13:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(748684, 80322, 7322, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand the purpose of including the feet of an action figure in this photo. Keep trying.</td>', 'I don''t understand the purpose of including the feet of an action figure in this photo. Keep trying.', '2004-06-03 13:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(748688, 79445, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a very mundane arrangement of a mundane subject. The most interesting thing about this photo is that the black and white chair echoes the black and white ball. the bottle of water ruins this effect and just looks like clutter.</td>', 'This is a very mundane arrangement of a mundane subject. The most interesting thing about this photo is that the black and white chair echoes the black and white ball. the bottle of water ruins this effect and just looks like clutter.', '2004-06-03 13:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(748691, 80692, 16106, '<td valign="top">I don''t see the tie to the challenge ( could be USA myopia ) but the shot is lovely with fine contrast composition and colors.</td>', 'I don''t see the tie to the challenge ( could be USA myopia ) but the shot is lovely with fine contrast composition and colors.', '2004-06-03 13:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(748692, 80239, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, color and like the crop here.</td>', 'Nice shot, color and like the crop here.', '2004-06-03 13:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(748694, 80896, 327, '<td valign="top">Like this one!</td>', 'Like this one!', '2004-06-03 13:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(748695, 80875, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a very cluttered arrangement. The logo and the color tie the objects together but nothing else is harmonious in this composition. The lighting is very flat. There is very little sense of space or depth. The eye doesn''t know where to rest. Keep trying.</td>', 'This is a very cluttered arrangement. The logo and the color tie the objects together but nothing else is harmonious in this composition. The lighting is very flat. There is very little sense of space or depth. The eye doesn''t know where to rest. Keep trying.', '2004-06-03 13:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(748696, 80894, 20210, '<td valign="top">clever idea, clean photograph, great capture of the mood of the waterboy.  The sky is very boring, and makes the lighting uninteresting.</td>', 'clever idea, clean photograph, great capture of the mood of the waterboy.  The sky is very boring, and makes the lighting uninteresting.', '2004-06-03 13:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(748697, 80511, 7322, '<td valign="top">The drawings have some graphic appeal but not enough to make this an interesting subject for a still-life.</td>', 'The drawings have some graphic appeal but not enough to make this an interesting subject for a still-life.', '2004-06-03 13:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(748698, 79804, 16106, '<td valign="top">Beautifully lit and rather a sweet shot.</td>', 'Beautifully lit and rather a sweet shot.', '2004-06-03 13:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(748699, 80820, 7322, '<td valign="top">There is very little separation between the subject and the background making for a very busy composition. The subject has some appeal but this arrangement is rather mundane.</td>', 'There is very little separation between the subject and the background making for a very busy composition. The subject has some appeal but this arrangement is rather mundane.', '2004-06-03 13:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(748700, 80210, 7322, '<td valign="top">This looks rather overexposed. There is almost no detail. There are too many hot spots (the bright flares of lights on the balls). The composition seems rather haphazard. I have no idea what game this represents.</td>', 'This looks rather overexposed. There is almost no detail. There are too many hot spots (the bright flares of lights on the balls). The composition seems rather haphazard. I have no idea what game this represents.', '2004-06-03 13:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(748702, 80524, 7322, '<td valign="top">This might have been a good shot but I can''t tell because it is way too small. Please take advantage of the 640 pixel maximum so that we can see your photo in detail.</td>', 'This might have been a good shot but I can''t tell because it is way too small. Please take advantage of the 640 pixel maximum so that we can see your photo in detail.', '2004-06-03 13:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(748705, 80784, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is very busy and the lighting is very flat (sun directly overhead washes out detail). It would have been better to find a spot where you could focus on one kayak and eliminate the distracting background. The eye goes right to the middle kayak because of its placement but there isn''t much of interest to see in the all that whiteness. From there the eye wanders but there still isn''t that much going on but a lot of harsh shadow and mundane objects (such as the green plastic container at the right edge and the whte kayak support with what looks like a falling down kayakl but it is hard to tell).</td>', 'This is very busy and the lighting is very flat (sun directly overhead washes out detail). It would have been better to find a spot where you could focus on one kayak and eliminate the distracting background. The eye goes right to the middle kayak because of its placement but there isn''t much of interest to see in the all that whiteness. From there the eye wanders but there still isn''t that much going on but a lot of harsh shadow and mundane objects (such as the green plastic container at the right edge and the whte kayak support with what looks like a falling down kayakl but it is hard to tell).', '2004-06-03 14:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(748707, 80516, 16488, '<td valign="top">Beautiful pic.  Nicely cropped.  Good color depth.  But as canoeing cannot fit the team sport aspect of the challenge, I cannot give you highest marks.  I do believe this would make a nice print, though.</td>', 'Beautiful pic.  Nicely cropped.  Good color depth.  But as canoeing cannot fit the team sport aspect of the challenge, I cannot give you highest marks.  I do believe this would make a nice print, though.', '2004-06-03 14:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(748708, 80279, 7322, '<td valign="top">I can''t see what this is. It is very blurred and very dark.</td>', 'I can''t see what this is. It is very blurred and very dark.', '2004-06-03 14:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(748710, 80803, 15207, '<td valign="top">This looks slightly grainy - I''m wondering if it was intentional or not. It''s a great idea for this challenge though. I know a bridge freak and I know how important that game can be to people. Good luck!</td>', 'This looks slightly grainy - I''m wondering if it was intentional or not. It''s a great idea for this challenge though. I know a bridge freak and I know how important that game can be to people. Good luck!', '2004-06-03 14:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(748714, 80869, 7322, '<td valign="top">More care and thought needs to go into a still-life. The background is very ugly and says nothing about the subject. Placing the subject in context (a baseball field, a child''s bed to show preparation for a game, etc) or in front of a simple background (unpatterned neutral cloth or background paper)<br/>would be much more effective. Your focus is sharp and the lighting is good if rather flat and mundane.</td>', 'More care and thought needs to go into a still-life. The background is very ugly and says nothing about the subject. Placing the subject in context (a baseball field, a child''s bed to show preparation for a game, etc) or in front of a simple background (unpatterned neutral cloth or background paper)would be much more effective. Your focus is sharp and the lighting is good if rather flat and mundane.', '2004-06-03 14:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(748715, 80208, 15207, '<td valign="top">This looks very pixelated - and slightly out of focus (just slightly). The colour saturation looks almost like you''re using a really low MP camera or a cell phone camera - but it may have been when you resized the image. Sometimes those resizing programs can do too much compression. Depending on your budget, you may want to upgrade. Good idea for this challenge though and I can tell you took some time to think about composition. Would have been even better if taken at sunset or sunrise - the lighting is a tiny bit harsh.</td>', 'This looks very pixelated - and slightly out of focus (just slightly). The colour saturation looks almost like you''re using a really low MP camera or a cell phone camera - but it may have been when you resized the image. Sometimes those resizing programs can do too much compression. Depending on your budget, you may want to upgrade. Good idea for this challenge though and I can tell you took some time to think about composition. Would have been even better if taken at sunset or sunrise - the lighting is a tiny bit harsh.', '2004-06-03 14:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(748718, 80876, 15207, '<td valign="top">Awesome idea for this challenge. Love the brilliant colours and sharpness.</td>', 'Awesome idea for this challenge. Love the brilliant colours and sharpness.', '2004-06-03 14:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(748719, 80461, 7322, '<td valign="top">This would have made more sense shot outdoors on a clothes line. The wrinkly sheet hurts the image.</td>', 'This would have made more sense shot outdoors on a clothes line. The wrinkly sheet hurts the image.', '2004-06-03 14:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(748721, 80855, 15207, '<td valign="top">Really great idea. Wonderful rich colours. I can tell you thought a lot about composition. My only suggestion would have been to maybe turn the plates so they look diagonal (just for the composition). But overall great pic.</td>', 'Really great idea. Wonderful rich colours. I can tell you thought a lot about composition. My only suggestion would have been to maybe turn the plates so they look diagonal (just for the composition). But overall great pic.', '2004-06-03 14:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(748722, 80818, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is an extremely mundane subject. The glare and reflections on the glass don''t help (you really need to use a polarizing filter to shoot a subject that is behind glass -- sometimes shooting at an angle can help reduce the glare and reflections).</td>', 'This is an extremely mundane subject. The glare and reflections on the glass don''t help (you really need to use a polarizing filter to shoot a subject that is behind glass -- sometimes shooting at an angle can help reduce the glare and reflections).', '2004-06-03 14:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(748723, 80692, 15207, '<td valign="top">Really nice photo. I like that the metal isn''t too shiny and you obviously thought a lot about lighting. It''s a good composition. The only real comment I have though is that I don''t understand it. It may be a sport I''m not familiar with. I''m giving it a 6.</td>', 'Really nice photo. I like that the metal isn''t too shiny and you obviously thought a lot about lighting. It''s a good composition. The only real comment I have though is that I don''t understand it. It may be a sport I''m not familiar with. I''m giving it a 6.', '2004-06-03 14:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(748724, 80758, 15207, '<td valign="top">This looks really grainy and pixelated. I''m not sure if this is from the program you used to resize the image or if you''re using a low megapixel camera. The concept is really cool though and the composition is beautiful.</td>', 'This looks really grainy and pixelated. I''m not sure if this is from the program you used to resize the image or if you''re using a low megapixel camera. The concept is really cool though and the composition is beautiful.', '2004-06-03 14:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(748726, 80724, 15207, '<td valign="top">This is a good idea for this challenge. The image looks slightly pixelated, like it has a lto of noise artifcacts. I''m not sure what te red is to the left. Would maybe have liked to see the frisbee coming at me from an angle.</td>', 'This is a good idea for this challenge. The image looks slightly pixelated, like it has a lto of noise artifcacts. I''m not sure what te red is to the left. Would maybe have liked to see the frisbee coming at me from an angle.', '2004-06-03 14:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(748727, 80281, 22392, '<td valign="top">nice colours!</td>', 'nice colours!', '2004-06-03 14:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(748728, 80851, 15207, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite so far.What a great idea for this challenge. I love the way you captured it - the DOF, etc. I also really love the rich colors. THis one gives you something to really look at that''s interesting and unique. Good luck - 10</td>', 'This is my favorite so far.What a great idea for this challenge. I love the way you captured it - the DOF, etc. I also really love the rich colors. THis one gives you something to really look at that''s interesting and unique. Good luck - 10', '2004-06-03 14:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(748729, 79495, 7322, '<td valign="top">The lighting is too flat to make the texture particularly interesting. The black stripe detracts from the unity of the rest of the composition. While it is part of the basketball, it doesn''t say anything about the pattern or texture of the ball that this macro seems to be trying to make a statement about.</td>', 'The lighting is too flat to make the texture particularly interesting. The black stripe detracts from the unity of the rest of the composition. While it is part of the basketball, it doesn''t say anything about the pattern or texture of the ball that this macro seems to be trying to make a statement about.', '2004-06-03 14:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(748731, 80727, 7322, '<td valign="top">Not a sport. Doesn''t meet the challenge. Moderately interesting outside the challenge.</td>', 'Not a sport. Doesn''t meet the challenge. Moderately interesting outside the challenge.', '2004-06-03 14:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(748734, 80763, 16488, '<td valign="top">A nice idea for this challenge.  Perhaps a more limited depth of field would make the numerous masts recede and therefor enhance your subject.  Still, a step above snapshot.</td>', 'A nice idea for this challenge.  Perhaps a more limited depth of field would make the numerous masts recede and therefor enhance your subject.  Still, a step above snapshot.', '2004-06-03 14:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(748736, 80461, 15207, '<td valign="top">This is a great idea for this challenge. I''m wondering if it woudl be even better if you took the shirts outside and let them blow in teh wind. For indoor shots (and I''m not one to talk since I have no extra equipment for indoor lighting) - you may want to try using a light source that is less harsh, maybe a reflector. The black numbers seemed to have picked up a bit of harsh light. Good luck with this one. It''s a very good idea and good composition.</td>', 'This is a great idea for this challenge. I''m wondering if it woudl be even better if you took the shirts outside and let them blow in teh wind. For indoor shots (and I''m not one to talk since I have no extra equipment for indoor lighting) - you may want to try using a light source that is less harsh, maybe a reflector. The black numbers seemed to have picked up a bit of harsh light. Good luck with this one. It''s a very good idea and good composition.', '2004-06-03 14:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(748738, 80776, 22392, '<td valign="top">i don''t get how it fits in the challenge</td>', 'i don''t get how it fits in the challenge', '2004-06-03 14:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(748739, 80875, 15207, '<td valign="top">I can tell you put some thought into the composition on this one. However, the image seems a bit flat to me. I''m not sure if it''s the lighting source or maybe it''s too compressed (either when you resized it or your camera has low megapixels). The colours are obviously rich in real life, but fall a bit flat in this image (at least on my screen).</td>', 'I can tell you put some thought into the composition on this one. However, the image seems a bit flat to me. I''m not sure if it''s the lighting source or maybe it''s too compressed (either when you resized it or your camera has low megapixels). The colours are obviously rich in real life, but fall a bit flat in this image (at least on my screen).', '2004-06-03 14:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(748740, 80840, 15207, '<td valign="top">Great idea. I like that you took initiative with this challenge. I like the british country club look to the buildling behind.</td>', 'Great idea. I like that you took initiative with this challenge. I like the british country club look to the buildling behind.', '2004-06-03 14:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(748741, 80240, 7322, '<td valign="top">This arrangement doesn''t do much to make this an interesting subject or an appealing photo. The background is simple and the image is sharp. You might want to keep in mind the classic triangle when arranging a still-life. This is almost there but not quite. If the shadows had formed more of a diagonal perhaps.</td>', 'This arrangement doesn''t do much to make this an interesting subject or an appealing photo. The background is simple and the image is sharp. You might want to keep in mind the classic triangle when arranging a still-life. This is almost there but not quite. If the shadows had formed more of a diagonal perhaps.', '2004-06-03 14:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(748742, 80815, 15207, '<td valign="top">I think it was supposed to be team sports without people. But I reallylike this shot anyway. It''s one of the more interesting ones in the bunch. I would have normally given a 10 or a 9, but since it''s a stretch for this challenge, I''m going to give it an 8. You may find your marks drop a lot more than that for this reason. Howevr, it''s a really excellent shot and you should be proud.</td>', 'I think it was supposed to be team sports without people. But I reallylike this shot anyway. It''s one of the more interesting ones in the bunch. I would have normally given a 10 or a 9, but since it''s a stretch for this challenge, I''m going to give it an 8. You may find your marks drop a lot more than that for this reason. Howevr, it''s a really excellent shot and you should be proud.', '2004-06-03 14:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(748747, 80882, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty mundane subject. This composition isn''t do much to make it more interesting. Perhaps if the background had been blurred the subject would appear more bold. It does form dthe classic triangle but placed in the center of the frame it''s not working as hard as it should be.</td>', 'This is a pretty mundane subject. This composition isn''t do much to make it more interesting. Perhaps if the background had been blurred the subject would appear more bold. It does form dthe classic triangle but placed in the center of the frame it''s not working as hard as it should be.', '2004-06-03 14:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(748756, 80776, 7322, '<td valign="top">I''ll take your word for it that this is a sport but this is a rather dull scene. A ski lift in the spring with no passengers? The mid-day light is very flat.</td>', 'I''ll take your word for it that this is a sport but this is a rather dull scene. A ski lift in the spring with no passengers? The mid-day light is very flat.', '2004-06-03 14:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(748757, 80815, 20832, '<td valign="top">Excellent photograph but you showed the players...</td>', 'Excellent photograph but you showed the players...', '2004-06-03 14:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(748761, 79515, 7322, '<td valign="top">Those white uniform shoes make a very boring subject. Isn''t there a colorful hat or jacket that goes with a band uniform that you could have shown instead? The trombone is a much more interesting subject but it is obscured by the shoes. dddddd</td>', 'Those white uniform shoes make a very boring subject. Isn''t there a colorful hat or jacket that goes with a band uniform that you could have shown instead? The trombone is a much more interesting subject but it is obscured by the shoes. dddddd', '2004-06-03 14:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(748763, 80681, 17505, '<td valign="top">I love it. I like that it''s black and white. I also love the placement and curves. Very nice job.</td>', 'I love it. I like that it''s black and white. I also love the placement and curves. Very nice job.', '2004-06-03 14:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(748770, 80261, 17505, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of sepia tones.  I like the composition, the curves at the top and bottom really give it a nice feel. Nice Shot!</td>', 'Interesting use of sepia tones.  I like the composition, the curves at the top and bottom really give it a nice feel. Nice Shot!', '2004-06-03 14:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(748774, 80588, 22392, '<td valign="top">nice idea. i would have liked a deeper DOF, but i understand you couldn''t because of the challenge. But it would have improved the picture.</td>', 'nice idea. i would have liked a deeper DOF, but i understand you couldn''t because of the challenge. But it would have improved the picture.', '2004-06-03 14:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(748781, 80621, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a mundane subject that is difficult to make interesting. This is a nice try; the background is simple but the lighting is rather flat and harsh. d</td>', 'This is a mundane subject that is difficult to make interesting. This is a nice try; the background is simple but the lighting is rather flat and harsh. d', '2004-06-03 14:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(748786, 80873, 18525, '<td valign="top">I like the photo I and gave you an 8</td>', 'I like the photo I and gave you an 8', '2004-06-03 14:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(748787, 80485, 18525, '<td valign="top">Great photo 8</td>', 'Great photo 8', '2004-06-03 14:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(748790, 80739, 18525, '<td valign="top">Best ball in grass out of the many ball in grass shots in this challenge.</td>', 'Best ball in grass out of the many ball in grass shots in this challenge.', '2004-06-03 14:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(748791, 80414, 7322, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t really say anything about sports. Your title is confusing. I think you mean football players used to wear armour, in reference to medieval games, but the wording actually suggest that football players wear armour *now* but this is what they used to wear. At any rate, nice try but I don''t think this meets the challenge. As a still-life the subject is interesting but the composition adn the flat overhead lighting don''t show it in an appealing way. The gauntlets look a bit out of focus.</td>', 'This doesn''t really say anything about sports. Your title is confusing. I think you mean football players used to wear armour, in reference to medieval games, but the wording actually suggest that football players wear armour *now* but this is what they used to wear. At any rate, nice try but I don''t think this meets the challenge. As a still-life the subject is interesting but the composition adn the flat overhead lighting don''t show it in an appealing way. The gauntlets look a bit out of focus.', '2004-06-03 14:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(748793, 80680, 7322, '<td valign="top">This might be a good photo but it is too hard to tell from this tiny image. Please use the 640 pixel limit you are allowed so that we can see the details of your photos in the future. d</td>', 'This might be a good photo but it is too hard to tell from this tiny image. Please use the 640 pixel limit you are allowed so that we can see the details of your photos in the future. d', '2004-06-03 14:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(748796, 80596, 21241, '<td valign="top">nice colors</td>', 'nice colors', '2004-06-03 14:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(748797, 79525, 327, '<td valign="top">Cute idea I think. Just a bit too much magenta.</td>', 'Cute idea I think. Just a bit too much magenta.', '2004-06-03 14:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(748799, 80020, 7322, '<td valign="top">Cool shot but I can see the competitors. How does this show team sports without the players? It fails to meet the challenge.</td>', 'Cool shot but I can see the competitors. How does this show team sports without the players? It fails to meet the challenge.', '2004-06-03 14:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(748800, 80261, 327, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. I like the curve of the room and the tones. Maybe a tighter crop to remove the ceiling?</td>', 'Very nice shot. I like the curve of the room and the tones. Maybe a tighter crop to remove the ceiling?', '2004-06-03 14:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(748808, 80758, 21241, '<td valign="top">out of focus...could be motion blur</td>', 'out of focus...could be motion blur', '2004-06-03 14:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(748809, 80384, 16089, '<td valign="top">Your photo is a little too cluttered and the lighting is not the best.  You did a good job on your focus.</td>', 'Your photo is a little too cluttered and the lighting is not the best.  You did a good job on your focus.', '2004-06-03 14:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(748811, 80692, 7322, '<td valign="top">What team sport is played with dice? And what does the spring represent? Am I missing something?  I don''t recognize the non-US flag. My daughter thinks its Australia. Could it have to do with yaghting? Forgive me for my ignorance on this. Flags aren''t something I pay much attention to. <br/> <br/>As a still-life it has problems. The downward tilt leaves the impression that the obects are in danger of sliding out of the frame. The chrome background is distracting.</td>', 'What team sport is played with dice? And what does the spring represent? Am I missing something?  I don''t recognize the non-US flag. My daughter thinks its Australia. Could it have to do with yaghting? Forgive me for my ignorance on this. Flags aren''t something I pay much attention to.  As a still-life it has problems. The downward tilt leaves the impression that the obects are in danger of sliding out of the frame. The chrome background is distracting.', '2004-06-03 15:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(748814, 80857, 21241, '<td valign="top">nice DOF</td>', 'nice DOF', '2004-06-03 15:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(748818, 79515, 15207, '<td valign="top">really rich greens. I''m wondering if the shoes should have been placed maybe to the left bottom corner a bit and the trumpet more to the right. There''s something just slightly off with teh balance. However, a really good idea for this challenge. Good luck.</td>', 'really rich greens. I''m wondering if the shoes should have been placed maybe to the left bottom corner a bit and the trumpet more to the right. There''s something just slightly off with teh balance. However, a really good idea for this challenge. Good luck.', '2004-06-03 15:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(748820, 79410, 15207, '<td valign="top">Love that you took this when the sunlight was so warm. I love the idea of this shot - I maybe would have cropped out the darker part of the fence where the tap is located and just fovused on the rest of the scene. However, good job.</td>', 'Love that you took this when the sunlight was so warm. I love the idea of this shot - I maybe would have cropped out the darker part of the fence where the tap is located and just fovused on the rest of the scene. However, good job.', '2004-06-03 15:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(748822, 80598, 7322, '<td valign="top">This subject doesn''t have universal appeal.  Emily and her family might find it a subject they would want to go back to more than once but for the casual viewer it is fairly mundane. The other problem is several sports are represented here. You need a more unified theme.  Perhaps if you had showcased a single trophy with an item of paraphanalia from the sport and used dramatic lighting and a simple background you might have a good still-life with broader appeal.</td>', 'This subject doesn''t have universal appeal.  Emily and her family might find it a subject they would want to go back to more than once but for the casual viewer it is fairly mundane. The other problem is several sports are represented here. You need a more unified theme.  Perhaps if you had showcased a single trophy with an item of paraphanalia from the sport and used dramatic lighting and a simple background you might have a good still-life with broader appeal.', '2004-06-03 15:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(748823, 80717, 15207, '<td valign="top">This is a really good idea and is well composed. However, it is extraordinarily pixelated and looks really compressed. Is this from a cell phone camera? It seems in focus, but just lacks the resolution. You may want to consider using a different program to resize your work or increase the resolution on your camera. If it was really sharp and not pixelated, I would have given it a 7. However, I''m giving it a 5 because of the poor quality.</td>', 'This is a really good idea and is well composed. However, it is extraordinarily pixelated and looks really compressed. Is this from a cell phone camera? It seems in focus, but just lacks the resolution. You may want to consider using a different program to resize your work or increase the resolution on your camera. If it was really sharp and not pixelated, I would have given it a 7. However, I''m giving it a 5 because of the poor quality.', '2004-06-03 15:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(748824, 80725, 15207, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! just gorgeous. 10</td>', 'Beautiful! just gorgeous. 10', '2004-06-03 15:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(748825, 80870, 15207, '<td valign="top">Love that you took the time to construct something with composition in mind. Love the colours and the fact that you used effective lighting to illuminate things. Good luck - 7</td>', 'Love that you took the time to construct something with composition in mind. Love the colours and the fact that you used effective lighting to illuminate things. Good luck - 7', '2004-06-03 15:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(748826, 80320, 15207, '<td valign="top">Great idea for this challenge. Love the sepia tones. Maybe would have liked to see the front part of the basket in focus, but I know sometimes these thigns don''t work out. -8</td>', 'Great idea for this challenge. Love the sepia tones. Maybe would have liked to see the front part of the basket in focus, but I know sometimes these thigns don''t work out. -8', '2004-06-03 15:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(748827, 80621, 15207, '<td valign="top">This seems to have a bit of noise or compression artifacts that are a tiny bit distracting. However, good use of lighting. I like it on the white background. -7</td>', 'This seems to have a bit of noise or compression artifacts that are a tiny bit distracting. However, good use of lighting. I like it on the white background. -7', '2004-06-03 15:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(748829, 80873, 15207, '<td valign="top">Really really wonderful photograph with all the right things needed - contrast, deep and interesting sky colours, sunlight effectively illuminating the shot along with maybe a dim exterior light, good composition, just perfect. 10</td>', 'Really really wonderful photograph with all the right things needed - contrast, deep and interesting sky colours, sunlight effectively illuminating the shot along with maybe a dim exterior light, good composition, just perfect. 10', '2004-06-03 15:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(748832, 79488, 15207, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea for this challenge. It''s too bad it''s a bit washed out to the right hand side; however, I almost think it adds a bit tothe image once I really look at it. Good luck -9</td>', 'Excellent idea for this challenge. It''s too bad it''s a bit washed out to the right hand side; however, I almost think it adds a bit tothe image once I really look at it. Good luck -9', '2004-06-03 15:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(748835, 80442, 21755, '<td valign="top">this is so</td>', 'this is so', '2004-06-03 15:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(748836, 79450, 15207, '<td valign="top">Love the old-time feel of this. Well composed, sharp image. Really great to use worn equipment. Love the black and white. May have looked good in sepia also.</td>', 'Love the old-time feel of this. Well composed, sharp image. Really great to use worn equipment. Love the black and white. May have looked good in sepia also.', '2004-06-03 15:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(748838, 80261, 16089, '<td valign="top">The big white thing in the left corner, what is that?  I consider it a bit distracting. <br/>This photo looks really good in sepia.</td>', 'The big white thing in the left corner, what is that?  I consider it a bit distracting. This photo looks really good in sepia.', '2004-06-03 15:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(748840, 80877, 15207, '<td valign="top">Great shot. love the black and white. Love the angle. I realize you can''t spot edit - or prevent where birds are going to pooh, but the poop is a little distracting along the back boards. good luck though. I''m sure you''re going ot do really well. Love the negative space tothe right hand side.</td>', 'Great shot. love the black and white. Love the angle. I realize you can''t spot edit - or prevent where birds are going to pooh, but the poop is a little distracting along the back boards. good luck though. I''m sure you''re going ot do really well. Love the negative space tothe right hand side.', '2004-06-03 15:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(748842, 79495, 15207, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, I think the photo is well shot and well composed, but it just isn''t interesting (at least to me, and it''s just my taste). I almost think it would have been a bit better if the ball wasn''t faded or used - where the colours were more vibrant. This works as an abstract, but I''d love to see richer colours. Good luck though - 6</td>', 'Unfortunately, I think the photo is well shot and well composed, but it just isn''t interesting (at least to me, and it''s just my taste). I almost think it would have been a bit better if the ball wasn''t faded or used - where the colours were more vibrant. This works as an abstract, but I''d love to see richer colours. Good luck though - 6', '2004-06-03 15:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(748843, 79804, 15207, '<td valign="top">Very cool. Would have liked to see the ball to either the right or left side - maybe rule of thirds (and I know it''s frustrating to hear that after the centred challenge - I know people on this site tend to go on about rule of thirds too much) - but this would have been just even more interesting as an actual photograph if the ball was balanced against negative space - to the right or left. Love that you tookt he time to light it properly and like it a lot against the black. - 7</td>', 'Very cool. Would have liked to see the ball to either the right or left side - maybe rule of thirds (and I know it''s frustrating to hear that after the centred challenge - I know people on this site tend to go on about rule of thirds too much) - but this would have been just even more interesting as an actual photograph if the ball was balanced against negative space - to the right or left. Love that you tookt he time to light it properly and like it a lot against the black. - 7', '2004-06-03 15:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(748845, 80842, 15207, '<td valign="top">Love the angle on this one. Really interesting shot. love teh palm trees in behind - 7</td>', 'Love the angle on this one. Really interesting shot. love teh palm trees in behind - 7', '2004-06-03 15:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(748846, 80516, 21755, '<td valign="top">is it a team sport?</td>', 'is it a team sport?', '2004-06-03 15:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(748847, 80871, 7322, '<td valign="top">I''m not seeing any blades here. I really can''t tell what the subject is from this photo. Perhaps a hockey skate turned upside down? It just isn''t clear enough what the subject is. All I see is plastic, rivets, and some upside-down letters with a very bright light flare at the edge of the frame. It doesn''t work as an abstract for me because there isn''t any real wow factor in this shape or the negative space it creates.</td>', 'I''m not seeing any blades here. I really can''t tell what the subject is from this photo. Perhaps a hockey skate turned upside down? It just isn''t clear enough what the subject is. All I see is plastic, rivets, and some upside-down letters with a very bright light flare at the edge of the frame. It doesn''t work as an abstract for me because there isn''t any real wow factor in this shape or the negative space it creates.', '2004-06-03 15:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(748848, 80739, 15207, '<td valign="top">Really love the rich greens in the grass. I love that you took the time to think about proper lighting to bring out the richness of the colours. Like the composition a lot. Love the red stitching. -7</td>', 'Really love the rich greens in the grass. I love that you took the time to think about proper lighting to bring out the richness of the colours. Like the composition a lot. Love the red stitching. -7', '2004-06-03 15:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(748851, 80598, 15207, '<td valign="top">This one falls a bit flat with me, unfortunately. I''m trying to figure out why. Maybe if it was composed slightly different - with some of the trophies piled up to the right or lef t- maybe using the rule of thirds a bit and allowing the use of a bit more negative space on top or to the right or left. The trophies seem very shiny and I''m wondering the light source you were using. Maybe there''s no way to get around it. Maybe a reflector and lighting away from the subject would have helped a bit. Like it in black and white though.</td>', 'This one falls a bit flat with me, unfortunately. I''m trying to figure out why. Maybe if it was composed slightly different - with some of the trophies piled up to the right or lef t- maybe using the rule of thirds a bit and allowing the use of a bit more negative space on top or to the right or left. The trophies seem very shiny and I''m wondering the light source you were using. Maybe there''s no way to get around it. Maybe a reflector and lighting away from the subject would have helped a bit. Like it in black and white though.', '2004-06-03 15:13:05.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(748852, 80665, 21755, '<td valign="top">i wish something was focused<br/>but still it''s lovely</td>', 'i wish something was focusedbut still it''s lovely', '2004-06-03 15:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(748853, 80814, 15207, '<td valign="top">Really like this shot. Love that you used the rule of thirds effectively. Really love the rich colours. Very sharp image. Good luck - 7</td>', 'Really like this shot. Love that you used the rule of thirds effectively. Really love the rich colours. Very sharp image. Good luck - 7', '2004-06-03 15:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(748856, 80814, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is not a favorite subject for me and this view fails to show it in a new or interesting way. The mundane car in the background and the ceiling detract quite a bit.</td>', 'This is not a favorite subject for me and this view fails to show it in a new or interesting way. The mundane car in the background and the ceiling detract quite a bit.', '2004-06-03 15:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(748858, 80658, 15207, '<td valign="top">Really like the rich colours in this one. Great composition and really good use of lighting. THe bottom left of the ball seems a bit over-blown, but that''s okay. It''s so sharp on the right hand side of that ball that your eye is drawn where you intended us to look. Good luck - 7</td>', 'Really like the rich colours in this one. Great composition and really good use of lighting. THe bottom left of the ball seems a bit over-blown, but that''s okay. It''s so sharp on the right hand side of that ball that your eye is drawn where you intended us to look. Good luck - 7', '2004-06-03 15:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(748862, 80170, 19785, '<td valign="top">ha ha</td>', 'ha ha', '2004-06-03 15:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(748866, 80898, 15207, '<td valign="top">This one falls a little flat with me, unfortunatley. The colours are rich, but it''s shot at an angle where your eye isn''t drawn to anything in particular. I''m wondering what to look at first. Maybe a different idea (in the future) woudl be to get up really close to something - like a ball or a club or something, and then shoot the same thing but with something in front - just to add interest. Another idea - maybe shoot from an angle from the rounded thing in the center. Think of negative space when you compose shots and sometimes (but not always) a rule of thirds works. Try putting something striking in front of the viewer''s eyes - think about where their eye will move when they look at the image (doesn''t always work for everything, but in this case it may have done the trick).</td>', 'This one falls a little flat with me, unfortunatley. The colours are rich, but it''s shot at an angle where your eye isn''t drawn to anything in particular. I''m wondering what to look at first. Maybe a different idea (in the future) woudl be to get up really close to something - like a ball or a club or something, and then shoot the same thing but with something in front - just to add interest. Another idea - maybe shoot from an angle from the rounded thing in the center. Think of negative space when you compose shots and sometimes (but not always) a rule of thirds works. Try putting something striking in front of the viewer''s eyes - think about where their eye will move when they look at the image (doesn''t always work for everything, but in this case it may have done the trick).', '2004-06-03 15:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(748868, 80528, 15207, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this. I like that the negative space has something actually interesting going on. Great faded ball. Reminds me of htings in my own backyard. Good luck.</td>', 'I like the composition of this. I like that the negative space has something actually interesting going on. Great faded ball. Reminds me of htings in my own backyard. Good luck.', '2004-06-03 15:16:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(748869, 80878, 15207, '<td valign="top">Really wonderful use of DOF. Love the locker idea. This is one of the best ideas I''ve seen for this challenge and it''s well excecuted. Good lcuk - 10</td>', 'Really wonderful use of DOF. Love the locker idea. This is one of the best ideas I''ve seen for this challenge and it''s well excecuted. Good lcuk - 10', '2004-06-03 15:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(748870, 79433, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a very busy looking macro because of the grass poking through the racquet netting. The overhead lighting is very flat, washing out a lot of the detail and color. The hot spot running along the edge of the racquet detracts. The red, white and blue scheme would have worked better without the green grass. You should have eliminated the other racquet that appears at the corner of the frame. It does not add to the idea but is distracting to the eye.</td>', 'This is a very busy looking macro because of the grass poking through the racquet netting. The overhead lighting is very flat, washing out a lot of the detail and color. The hot spot running along the edge of the racquet detracts. The red, white and blue scheme would have worked better without the green grass. You should have eliminated the other racquet that appears at the corner of the frame. It does not add to the idea but is distracting to the eye.', '2004-06-03 15:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(748871, 80715, 15207, '<td valign="top">LIke the composition, but something is a bit strange in this. I''m wodering if it''s compressed just a bit too much - or if maybe the lighting is too stark. Maybe would have been even better if lit by early sunrise or late sunset. However, a really good idea and well composed. good luck 7-</td>', 'LIke the composition, but something is a bit strange in this. I''m wodering if it''s compressed just a bit too much - or if maybe the lighting is too stark. Maybe would have been even better if lit by early sunrise or late sunset. However, a really good idea and well composed. good luck 7-', '2004-06-03 15:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(748872, 80762, 19785, '<td valign="top">different boarder color</td>', 'different boarder color', '2004-06-03 15:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(748873, 80754, 15207, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love this. I hope you do well - 9</td>', 'I absolutely love this. I hope you do well - 9', '2004-06-03 15:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(748874, 80727, 15207, '<td valign="top">I really likethis. Good luck - 7</td>', 'I really likethis. Good luck - 7', '2004-06-03 15:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(748876, 80485, 15207, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love this one. I love the green monochromatic scheme and the lighting is supurb. Would maybe improve just a fraction with something like a club or a ball in front, lokoing out over the scene - but maybe not. -9</td>', 'I absolutely love this one. I love the green monochromatic scheme and the lighting is supurb. Would maybe improve just a fraction with something like a club or a ball in front, lokoing out over the scene - but maybe not. -9', '2004-06-03 15:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(748878, 80676, 15207, '<td valign="top">Really good idea for this challenge. There seems to be quite a few compression artifacts or JPEG compression that is slightly distracting - esp. around the ball. I''m also wondering if maybe the lighting source is just a fraction too harsh because it''s reflecting funny in teh metal. Maybe a reflector would have helped, but I''m not sure. GOod luck though.</td>', 'Really good idea for this challenge. There seems to be quite a few compression artifacts or JPEG compression that is slightly distracting - esp. around the ball. I''m also wondering if maybe the lighting source is just a fraction too harsh because it''s reflecting funny in teh metal. Maybe a reflector would have helped, but I''m not sure. GOod luck though.', '2004-06-03 15:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(748879, 79799, 7322, '<td valign="top">Not a particularly interesting subject. Perhaps if the background were simpler. The hanging planter reduces this to a snap-shot. I"m not sure if the clear acrylic is part of the game but it is also rather disstracting. d</td>', 'Not a particularly interesting subject. Perhaps if the background were simpler. The hanging planter reduces this to a snap-shot. I"m not sure if the clear acrylic is part of the game but it is also rather disstracting. d', '2004-06-03 15:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(748880, 80831, 15207, '<td valign="top">This is a good idea, but seems very pixelated. The greens are not very rich at all - the orange shoudl be a bit more saturated as well. The ball is okay as far as colour. I''m wondering if it''s maybe when you use a program to resize the image. Your camera may take a great shot, with rich saturation, and then your software program buggers things up. Maybe in the future try a different program when you go to resize. However, I like this. Maybe a tiny bit more to the right hand side to allow a bit more negative space.</td>', 'This is a good idea, but seems very pixelated. The greens are not very rich at all - the orange shoudl be a bit more saturated as well. The ball is okay as far as colour. I''m wondering if it''s maybe when you use a program to resize the image. Your camera may take a great shot, with rich saturation, and then your software program buggers things up. Maybe in the future try a different program when you go to resize. However, I like this. Maybe a tiny bit more to the right hand side to allow a bit more negative space.', '2004-06-03 15:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(748881, 80483, 19785, '<td valign="top">get the other post</td>', 'get the other post', '2004-06-03 15:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(748882, 80838, 15207, '<td valign="top">Good idea for this challenge. There is a bit of a moire (repeating patterns or something distracting) in the shadow. I''m not sure how you''d correct it. In this case, I like that you used really harsh sunlight to make an effective composition with the shadows. Too bad you can''t spot edit to make the shadow a little different. But great idea- my comments are minor -  and I''m giving it a 9.</td>', 'Good idea for this challenge. There is a bit of a moire (repeating patterns or something distracting) in the shadow. I''m not sure how you''d correct it. In this case, I like that you used really harsh sunlight to make an effective composition with the shadows. Too bad you can''t spot edit to make the shadow a little different. But great idea- my comments are minor -  and I''m giving it a 9.', '2004-06-03 15:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(748884, 80830, 15207, '<td valign="top">This one falls a bit flat to me. I''m wondering if it''s that it lacks rich colours. The clouds in behind seem an unreal colour/shade, but maybe accurate. I don''t know if maybe you''r using a software program that desaturates your colours too much. I can tel there''s a bit of JPEG comrpession in this photo. I''m wondering if it would be that much better if you shot something with richer colours.</td>', 'This one falls a bit flat to me. I''m wondering if it''s that it lacks rich colours. The clouds in behind seem an unreal colour/shade, but maybe accurate. I don''t know if maybe you''r using a software program that desaturates your colours too much. I can tel there''s a bit of JPEG comrpession in this photo. I''m wondering if it would be that much better if you shot something with richer colours.', '2004-06-03 15:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(748885, 79956, 15207, '<td valign="top">Really like this one. The reflection/harsh light is a tiny bit distracting, but love the rich colours otherwise. Good luck!</td>', 'Really like this one. The reflection/harsh light is a tiny bit distracting, but love the rich colours otherwise. Good luck!', '2004-06-03 15:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(748886, 80825, 15207, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite of the baseball shots. Great idea, really wonderful angle. Finally-- someone who thought about negative space, composition, saturation, etc. 10</td>', 'This is my favorite of the baseball shots. Great idea, really wonderful angle. Finally-- someone who thought about negative space, composition, saturation, etc. 10', '2004-06-03 15:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(748887, 80442, 10124, '<td valign="top">Great colors and good focus. Excellent shot.</td>', 'Great colors and good focus. Excellent shot.', '2004-06-03 15:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(748888, 80638, 15207, '<td valign="top">I''m wondering if it woud have been that much better if you shot it with the pole of the cage a bit to the left or the right. However, good idea for this challenge. 6</td>', 'I''m wondering if it woud have been that much better if you shot it with the pole of the cage a bit to the left or the right. However, good idea for this challenge. 6', '2004-06-03 15:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(748891, 80673, 10124, '<td valign="top">has a nice vintage feel to it.</td>', 'has a nice vintage feel to it.', '2004-06-03 15:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(748892, 80205, 10124, '<td valign="top">nice detail</td>', 'nice detail', '2004-06-03 15:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(748893, 80680, 15207, '<td valign="top">Really good idea for this challenge. In teh future you may want to icnrease the actual size of your photo because people in DPC tend to vote lower on small images. Try to use up the maximum 640 x480 - as much as possible. I think the sunlight in this one is a tiny bit too harsh and may have been a bit better in the early morning or late evening - the composition of the hands is good, but the pantleg with no shoe is maybe not necessary - try thinking about your use of negative space. GOod luck!</td>', 'Really good idea for this challenge. In teh future you may want to icnrease the actual size of your photo because people in DPC tend to vote lower on small images. Try to use up the maximum 640 x480 - as much as possible. I think the sunlight in this one is a tiny bit too harsh and may have been a bit better in the early morning or late evening - the composition of the hands is good, but the pantleg with no shoe is maybe not necessary - try thinking about your use of negative space. GOod luck!', '2004-06-03 15:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(748894, 80842, 10124, '<td valign="top">nice composition</td>', 'nice composition', '2004-06-03 15:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(748895, 80893, 15207, '<td valign="top">Love this one. Love the composition, the angle, that my eye is drawn in and can move around. Good use of colour and saturation&gt; may have been that much better if shot in very early morning or late evening - but not necessary. 8</td>', 'Love this one. Love the composition, the angle, that my eye is drawn in and can move around. Good use of colour and saturation> may have been that much better if shot in very early morning or late evening - but not necessary. 8', '2004-06-03 15:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(748897, 80614, 15207, '<td valign="top">Really great shot. My only suggestion woudl be to increase the use of negative space slightly - maybe to the top. Also, it seems very grainy. The lighting is supurb and works well in black and white. Good luck -7</td>', 'Really great shot. My only suggestion woudl be to increase the use of negative space slightly - maybe to the top. Also, it seems very grainy. The lighting is supurb and works well in black and white. Good luck -7', '2004-06-03 15:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(748898, 80762, 15207, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot and finally someone who is able to capture rich and saturated colours. Like the square image. Good composition.</td>', 'Fantastic shot and finally someone who is able to capture rich and saturated colours. Like the square image. Good composition.', '2004-06-03 15:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(748899, 80614, 10124, '<td valign="top">a little too dark in the shadows. can''t see enough detail.</td>', 'a little too dark in the shadows. can''t see enough detail.', '2004-06-03 15:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(748901, 79450, 10124, '<td valign="top">good contrast</td>', 'good contrast', '2004-06-03 15:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(748903, 79410, 10124, '<td valign="top">some nice colors</td>', 'some nice colors', '2004-06-03 15:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
