(748906, 80838, 10124, '<td valign="top">i like this one a lot, but i think i''d like it more if that dark shadow wasn''t cutting through the pic because you''ve got some interesting things going on with those splatters.</td>', 'i like this one a lot, but i think i''d like it more if that dark shadow wasn''t cutting through the pic because you''ve got some interesting things going on with those splatters.', '2004-06-03 15:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(748910, 80515, 10124, '<td valign="top">great colors and lighting. original, too.</td>', 'great colors and lighting. original, too.', '2004-06-03 15:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(748911, 80755, 15207, '<td valign="top">Great colours. Unfortunately, I don''t feel that drawn into this image. It is obviously well composed, but doens''t feel very compelling. I know this was a very difficult challenge to execute. I really liek that you took the time to light your subject effectively - 6</td>', 'Great colours. Unfortunately, I don''t feel that drawn into this image. It is obviously well composed, but doens''t feel very compelling. I know this was a very difficult challenge to execute. I really liek that you took the time to light your subject effectively - 6', '2004-06-03 15:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(748912, 80521, 15207, '<td valign="top">All I have to say is... awesome. The hand seems a bit red - maybe the person has a sunburn - but it may be that the colours are slightly off on your camera.</td>', 'All I have to say is... awesome. The hand seems a bit red - maybe the person has a sunburn - but it may be that the colours are slightly off on your camera.', '2004-06-03 15:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(748913, 80572, 15207, '<td valign="top">Really awesome! Great that you were able to get into an empty stadium. I love the rich colours - your cmaera does a great job of picking up the saturation. Also, very sharp. I relaly like the over-blown lights set to the left side instead of straight in the center - very good balance and composition - 10</td>', 'Really awesome! Great that you were able to get into an empty stadium. I love the rich colours - your cmaera does a great job of picking up the saturation. Also, very sharp. I relaly like the over-blown lights set to the left side instead of straight in the center - very good balance and composition - 10', '2004-06-03 15:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(748914, 80530, 15207, '<td valign="top">I think I would have liked this better if the equipment was sitting on some ice. I like the sepia tones, but the couch and the blank white wall doesn''t really do anything for the composition. Maybe if the equpiment was cropped a bit closer it woud have imprved things just slightly.</td>', 'I think I would have liked this better if the equipment was sitting on some ice. I like the sepia tones, but the couch and the blank white wall doesn''t really do anything for the composition. Maybe if the equpiment was cropped a bit closer it woud have imprved things just slightly.', '2004-06-03 15:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(748915, 79518, 15207, '<td valign="top">Great colours. Love that you took the time to light htis properly. However, I almost think you need something to realy stand out - just one ball - maybe if one of the libert logos was smack dab in the bottom left corner and that particular ball was higher than the others. Something needs to draw the eye in and then allow for eye movement - maybe even a bit of negative space.</td>', 'Great colours. Love that you took the time to light htis properly. However, I almost think you need something to realy stand out - just one ball - maybe if one of the libert logos was smack dab in the bottom left corner and that particular ball was higher than the others. Something needs to draw the eye in and then allow for eye movement - maybe even a bit of negative space.', '2004-06-03 15:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(748917, 80496, 15207, '<td valign="top">I lik ethe colours and the lighting. I also like that you took the time to think about composition. I like that the basket is to the left.</td>', 'I lik ethe colours and the lighting. I also like that you took the time to think about composition. I like that the basket is to the left.', '2004-06-03 15:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(748919, 80210, 15207, '<td valign="top">These balls may have photographed better in early morning light or early evening light. It''s very distracting with the harsh sunlight. The green of the grass doesn''t look that rich.</td>', 'These balls may have photographed better in early morning light or early evening light. It''s very distracting with the harsh sunlight. The green of the grass doesn''t look that rich.', '2004-06-03 15:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(748921, 79445, 15207, '<td valign="top">Great idea. Maybe owul dhave liked to see it shot from just behind the chair with a different depth of field (narrower).</td>', 'Great idea. Maybe owul dhave liked to see it shot from just behind the chair with a different depth of field (narrower).', '2004-06-03 15:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(748922, 80682, 15207, '<td valign="top">Awesome idea for this challenge. Very inventive. Very good use of composition. Maybe would have worked better if shot in different light - this lighting seems to be slightly harsh... but I''m not sure. Good luck.</td>', 'Awesome idea for this challenge. Very inventive. Very good use of composition. Maybe would have worked better if shot in different light - this lighting seems to be slightly harsh... but I''m not sure. Good luck.', '2004-06-03 15:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(748923, 80895, 15207, '<td valign="top">Very inventive thought for this challenge. I like that you took the time to think about balance and negative space, as well as effective lighting. Would it have been better if, instead of shooting from over head, you shot from right around the ground-level, maybe looking at the ball out onto the plate? But overall very good. Good luck</td>', 'Very inventive thought for this challenge. I like that you took the time to think about balance and negative space, as well as effective lighting. Would it have been better if, instead of shooting from over head, you shot from right around the ground-level, maybe looking at the ball out onto the plate? But overall very good. Good luck', '2004-06-03 15:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(748924, 80854, 15207, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Good angle. Great composition. Wonderful colours -8</td>', 'Great shot. Good angle. Great composition. Wonderful colours -8', '2004-06-03 15:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(748927, 80170, 15207, '<td valign="top">Really intersting shot. I''m wondering if it would have been even better if it was shot with a little bit more to the right or the left. However, overall very effective. I hope you do well.</td>', 'Really intersting shot. I''m wondering if it would have been even better if it was shot with a little bit more to the right or the left. However, overall very effective. I hope you do well.', '2004-06-03 15:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(748928, 80240, 15207, '<td valign="top">Interesting arrangement, but maybe would have been more effective if shot looking (almost like a macro) right into one of the rackets. The composition seems just to be a bit centered. Maybe think of the use of negative space to enahnce your images. The lighting seems to have dulled the colour saturation a little bit also and I can see some noise artifacts/compression artifacts in around the blue handle that are slightly distracting.</td>', 'Interesting arrangement, but maybe would have been more effective if shot looking (almost like a macro) right into one of the rackets. The composition seems just to be a bit centered. Maybe think of the use of negative space to enahnce your images. The lighting seems to have dulled the colour saturation a little bit also and I can see some noise artifacts/compression artifacts in around the blue handle that are slightly distracting.', '2004-06-03 15:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(748930, 80511, 15207, '<td valign="top">Really like this idea. Maybe woudl have liked to see an angle where the camera is right there set on the chalk board. Not sure if it woudl hav eworked or not, but maybe more intersting - with a very narrow DOF. Good idea and excecution though. Good luck&gt;</td>', 'Really like this idea. Maybe woudl have liked to see an angle where the camera is right there set on the chalk board. Not sure if it woudl hav eworked or not, but maybe more intersting - with a very narrow DOF. Good idea and excecution though. Good luck>', '2004-06-03 15:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(748931, 80281, 15207, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely beautiful. It''s perfect in every way. 10.</td>', 'This is absolutely beautiful. It''s perfect in every way. 10.', '2004-06-03 15:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(748932, 80844, 15207, '<td valign="top">Great idea, but the compression and noise is very extreme and that''s very distracting. Also, the lighting seems a bit off.</td>', 'Great idea, but the compression and noise is very extreme and that''s very distracting. Also, the lighting seems a bit off.', '2004-06-03 15:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(748934, 80872, 15207, '<td valign="top">Really wonderful night scene. Would maybe have looked cool if the pole wasn''t so centered, but not sure. Good idea nad good execution.</td>', 'Really wonderful night scene. Would maybe have looked cool if the pole wasn''t so centered, but not sure. Good idea nad good execution.', '2004-06-03 15:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(748936, 80186, 15207, '<td valign="top">Good composition - love the shoes all over the dock. The lighting seems a bit off - there seems to be some harsh blue tones coming in that may have been projected from the sun. I''m not sure the time of day you shot, but maybe shooting at a different time of day would have helped slightly - or using a polarizer. Great shot though - 8</td>', 'Good composition - love the shoes all over the dock. The lighting seems a bit off - there seems to be some harsh blue tones coming in that may have been projected from the sun. I''m not sure the time of day you shot, but maybe shooting at a different time of day would have helped slightly - or using a polarizer. Great shot though - 8', '2004-06-03 15:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(748938, 80847, 15207, '<td valign="top">Really good idea - but would like to see somethign that draws and moves my eye - maybe something in front - like looking out from a chair in the opposing stands.</td>', 'Really good idea - but would like to see somethign that draws and moves my eye - maybe something in front - like looking out from a chair in the opposing stands.', '2004-06-03 15:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(748939, 80882, 15207, '<td valign="top">I can tell you thought a lot about the composition with this one. The image is very balanced. The one thing to consider in teh future is negative space thoguh - it plays as important of a role in composition as the actual subject. Sometimes a really active subject like this can look even better if it''s offset by a lot of negative space to the right or left side - this would also incorporate the rule of thirds. While the rule of thirds doesn''t work for every image, it would probably improve this one.</td>', 'I can tell you thought a lot about the composition with this one. The image is very balanced. The one thing to consider in teh future is negative space thoguh - it plays as important of a role in composition as the actual subject. Sometimes a really active subject like this can look even better if it''s offset by a lot of negative space to the right or left side - this would also incorporate the rule of thirds. While the rule of thirds doesn''t work for every image, it would probably improve this one.', '2004-06-03 15:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(748941, 80414, 15207, '<td valign="top">The lighting in this seems a bit too harsh. Maybe try using a reflector or take the shot outside in the morning or early evening sun. The wrist guards are hard to make out with the chest guard since they''re so close in colour. Good idea for a team sport though.</td>', 'The lighting in this seems a bit too harsh. Maybe try using a reflector or take the shot outside in the morning or early evening sun. The wrist guards are hard to make out with the chest guard since they''re so close in colour. Good idea for a team sport though.', '2004-06-03 15:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(748942, 80205, 15207, '<td valign="top">Finally.. a close up shot of a blal that''s well executed This one is interesting. I love the texture. Good luck - 9</td>', 'Finally.. a close up shot of a blal that''s well executed This one is interesting. I love the texture. Good luck - 9', '2004-06-03 15:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(748944, 80849, 15207, '<td valign="top">Love that you used good sunlight to capture this. However, would maybe have been better in full colour than black and white. I think a shot with the balls exactly as they are, but shot vertical - with a bit more negative space, might have made this more interesting. Good luck.</td>', 'Love that you used good sunlight to capture this. However, would maybe have been better in full colour than black and white. I think a shot with the balls exactly as they are, but shot vertical - with a bit more negative space, might have made this more interesting. Good luck.', '2004-06-03 15:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(748945, 80607, 15207, '<td valign="top">This shot isn''t very captivating to me. It''s well composed, but the mud and the subject don''t grab attention. 6</td>', 'This shot isn''t very captivating to me. It''s well composed, but the mud and the subject don''t grab attention. 6', '2004-06-03 15:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(748947, 80820, 15207, '<td valign="top">Good idea fo rthis challenge. My only suggestion is to tshoot n better sunlight. There seems to be too many harsh light reflections in this image.</td>', 'Good idea fo rthis challenge. My only suggestion is to tshoot n better sunlight. There seems to be too many harsh light reflections in this image.', '2004-06-03 16:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(748949, 80897, 15207, '<td valign="top">This seems very faded adn the saturation isn''t that striking (even with teh trees in behind). I''m wondering if maybe your software program is drawing colours away from your image when you resize. The muted colours in the sign may have looked really cool if the background trees were really bright and rich in colours. It''s well cmoposed though. -6</td>', 'This seems very faded adn the saturation isn''t that striking (even with teh trees in behind). I''m wondering if maybe your software program is drawing colours away from your image when you resize. The muted colours in the sign may have looked really cool if the background trees were really bright and rich in colours. It''s well cmoposed though. -6', '2004-06-03 16:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(748950, 80834, 15207, '<td valign="top">A very well composed and simple shot. Lovely rich colours. Great lighting. -7</td>', 'A very well composed and simple shot. Lovely rich colours. Great lighting. -7', '2004-06-03 16:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(748953, 80839, 15207, '<td valign="top">This one is lovely. I''m glad you decided to focus on the leaves. It adds something interesting and unique to the omposition. There seems to be a lot of grian in this one. I realize ISO settings on many cameras allow you to shoot above 200, but the grain is always an issue with the point and shoot variety (I think DSLRs are okay with grain at higher ISOs). You may want to push it a bit in the future and use a lower ISO with this particular camera.</td>', 'This one is lovely. I''m glad you decided to focus on the leaves. It adds something interesting and unique to the omposition. There seems to be a lot of grian in this one. I realize ISO settings on many cameras allow you to shoot above 200, but the grain is always an issue with the point and shoot variety (I think DSLRs are okay with grain at higher ISOs). You may want to push it a bit in the future and use a lower ISO with this particular camera.', '2004-06-03 16:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(748954, 80279, 15207, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry. I can''t tell what this is.</td>', 'I''m sorry. I can''t tell what this is.', '2004-06-03 16:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(748956, 80443, 15207, '<td valign="top">Great idea for this challenge. Maybe would have been even more interesting if shot with a narrow depth of field and if the cmaera was placed directly on one of the lines - allowing the lines to move either more to the left or to the right - and allowing you to really see the texture of the lines.</td>', 'Great idea for this challenge. Maybe would have been even more interesting if shot with a narrow depth of field and if the cmaera was placed directly on one of the lines - allowing the lines to move either more to the left or to the right - and allowing you to really see the texture of the lines.', '2004-06-03 16:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(748957, 80860, 15207, '<td valign="top">Oh... this is awesome. THis is the best of its kind in this challenge. Good luck - love the lighting. -10</td>', 'Oh... this is awesome. THis is the best of its kind in this challenge. Good luck - love the lighting. -10', '2004-06-03 16:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(748958, 79697, 15207, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, colours, etc. Maybe would have been an even better composition if you allowed some more negative space to the right hand side. I know the tendency is to center things (esp. after the last centered challenge) but this one in particular may have benefited from the rule of thirds. good luck -8</td>', 'Great lighting, colours, etc. Maybe would have been an even better composition if you allowed some more negative space to the right hand side. I know the tendency is to center things (esp. after the last centered challenge) but this one in particular may have benefited from the rule of thirds. good luck -8', '2004-06-03 16:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(748959, 80841, 15207, '<td valign="top">Really cool shot. Lovely composition. Great use of colour. Great saturation. Good luck 10</td>', 'Really cool shot. Lovely composition. Great use of colour. Great saturation. Good luck 10', '2004-06-03 16:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(748960, 80528, 6130, '<td valign="top">I like this.</td>', 'I like this.', '2004-06-03 16:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(748961, 80120, 15207, '<td valign="top">There shoudl be something directly in front of the camera (almost like a macro shot) to add a bit more interst. The yellow pole is interesting, but it''s too centered. This image would have done well with some thought about rule of thirds and negative space.</td>', 'There shoudl be something directly in front of the camera (almost like a macro shot) to add a bit more interst. The yellow pole is interesting, but it''s too centered. This image would have done well with some thought about rule of thirds and negative space.', '2004-06-03 16:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(748962, 80859, 15207, '<td valign="top">Really like that you added some interest with the angle and the composition. THe lighting seems slightly muted. Maybe a rich colourful sunset or sunrise would have improved it slightly. THe saturation of colour in the grass doesn''t really stand out. -7</td>', 'Really like that you added some interest with the angle and the composition. THe lighting seems slightly muted. Maybe a rich colourful sunset or sunrise would have improved it slightly. THe saturation of colour in the grass doesn''t really stand out. -7', '2004-06-03 16:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(748964, 80685, 15207, '<td valign="top">This seems a bit pixelated. I''m wonderin gif your software program is doing something to your image when you resize. Also, the mountain may have loked more interesting if shot with less sky. Like the image overall, but the compression is slightly distracting.</td>', 'This seems a bit pixelated. I''m wonderin gif your software program is doing something to your image when you resize. Also, the mountain may have loked more interesting if shot with less sky. Like the image overall, but the compression is slightly distracting.', '2004-06-03 16:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(748965, 80442, 15207, '<td valign="top">Awesome! I really like this -9</td>', 'Awesome! I really like this -9', '2004-06-03 16:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(748966, 80763, 6130, '<td valign="top">I like it.</td>', 'I like it.', '2004-06-03 16:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(748968, 80888, 15207, '<td valign="top">Really good composition. I think the saturation should b eincreased slightly and the lighting may have been improved if you used a reflector.</td>', 'Really good composition. I think the saturation should b eincreased slightly and the lighting may have been improved if you used a reflector.', '2004-06-03 16:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(748969, 80664, 15207, '<td valign="top">Really good cmposition. Unlike the other rain shots, the reflections in the puddle really add a lot to the composition. GOod luck -9</td>', 'Really good cmposition. Unlike the other rain shots, the reflections in the puddle really add a lot to the composition. GOod luck -9', '2004-06-03 16:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(748970, 80588, 15207, '<td valign="top">Really lovely shot. I love this one. 10</td>', 'Really lovely shot. I love this one. 10', '2004-06-03 16:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(748973, 80829, 15207, '<td valign="top">This image would have been improved with the rule of thirds in mind (I know rule of thirds does''t always enhance an image, but it woudl have enhanced this one). Also, the colours seem muted - maybe increasing saturation in your software or taking an image at sunset or sunrise may have helped.</td>', 'This image would have been improved with the rule of thirds in mind (I know rule of thirds does''t always enhance an image, but it woudl have enhanced this one). Also, the colours seem muted - maybe increasing saturation in your software or taking an image at sunset or sunrise may have helped.', '2004-06-03 16:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(748975, 80515, 15207, '<td valign="top">Really interesting. Would have liked to see the entire shadow. NEver be afraid of negative space. This is really well lit. I lke it a lot. 8</td>', 'Really interesting. Would have liked to see the entire shadow. NEver be afraid of negative space. This is really well lit. I lke it a lot. 8', '2004-06-03 16:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(748978, 80822, 15207, '<td valign="top">This looks very pixelated in places. I''m wondering ifyour software program does somethign when you resize the image. It''s a good idea to capture your ball in flight, but the compsition may have been more interestig if you incorporated the rule of thirds (ROT). WHile ROT doesn''t always apply, it probably would have enhanced this image. The viewer needs to have something starting from teh right or left corner to draw the eye into the movement.</td>', 'This looks very pixelated in places. I''m wondering ifyour software program does somethign when you resize the image. It''s a good idea to capture your ball in flight, but the compsition may have been more interestig if you incorporated the rule of thirds (ROT). WHile ROT doesn''t always apply, it probably would have enhanced this image. The viewer needs to have something starting from teh right or left corner to draw the eye into the movement.', '2004-06-03 16:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(748980, 80894, 15207, '<td valign="top">Really cool shot. Love that you shot it through the fence. 10</td>', 'Really cool shot. Love that you shot it through the fence. 10', '2004-06-03 16:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(748983, 80776, 15207, '<td valign="top">Ths looks very comrpessed - very pixelated. I''m wondering if your software program is doing something to decrease saturation as well. I think this would have been a good image, but the compression is very distracting.</td>', 'Ths looks very comrpessed - very pixelated. I''m wondering if your software program is doing something to decrease saturation as well. I think this would have been a good image, but the compression is very distracting.', '2004-06-03 16:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(748984, 80516, 15207, '<td valign="top">Really beautiful. Lovely use of negative space. 9</td>', 'Really beautiful. Lovely use of negative space. 9', '2004-06-03 16:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(748985, 80764, 15207, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, rich colours, interesting angle. Maybe would have liked to see rule of thirds applied here (I know it isn''t always necessary, but it may have improved this one). Love the dark sky - 8</td>', 'Lovely shot, rich colours, interesting angle. Maybe would have liked to see rule of thirds applied here (I know it isn''t always necessary, but it may have improved this one). Love the dark sky - 8', '2004-06-03 16:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(748986, 80271, 15207, '<td valign="top">Really interesting angle. I like that the colours are rich enough - even the far away seats - that your eye is drawn where it should be drawn. I like the buildlings peeking over the top. I realize logistically it may have been trouble, but may have been an even better shot if shot at sunrise or sunset. good luck 8</td>', 'Really interesting angle. I like that the colours are rich enough - even the far away seats - that your eye is drawn where it should be drawn. I like the buildlings peeking over the top. I realize logistically it may have been trouble, but may have been an even better shot if shot at sunrise or sunset. good luck 8', '2004-06-03 16:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(748987, 80862, 15207, '<td valign="top">Love this one. 9</td>', 'Love this one. 9', '2004-06-03 16:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
