(748989, 80525, 15207, '<td valign="top">Really interesting photo. It''s too bad the life saver thingy is in behind the screen. The image seems slightly pixelated (may have happened when you resampled). However, it''s a very good idea. Love the colours. - 9</td>', 'Really interesting photo. It''s too bad the life saver thingy is in behind the screen. The image seems slightly pixelated (may have happened when you resampled). However, it''s a very good idea. Love the colours. - 9', '2004-06-03 16:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(748990, 80833, 15207, '<td valign="top">I think this is really good - but may have been even betterif shot from a slightly different angle - maybe more to the right or the left. While not every picture is enhanced by a rule of thirds, this one may have been ehnanced by using that principal. Love the buildlings in behind. This image really captures a mood. Good luck -7</td>', 'I think this is really good - but may have been even betterif shot from a slightly different angle - maybe more to the right or the left. While not every picture is enhanced by a rule of thirds, this one may have been ehnanced by using that principal. Love the buildlings in behind. This image really captures a mood. Good luck -7', '2004-06-03 16:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(748991, 80850, 15207, '<td valign="top">There''s something that just doesn''t feel very compelling about this image. it also seems very pixelated and compressed (maybe when you resized your software program did something). The lighting seems a bit muted. The grass is a nice rich colour, but there isn''t anything to draw the eye in and encourage movement. Maybe think abou tnegative space.</td>', 'There''s something that just doesn''t feel very compelling about this image. it also seems very pixelated and compressed (maybe when you resized your software program did something). The lighting seems a bit muted. The grass is a nice rich colour, but there isn''t anything to draw the eye in and encourage movement. Maybe think abou tnegative space.', '2004-06-03 16:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(748994, 79407, 15207, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colours. I relaly like this one. it''s very compelling. 9</td>', 'Beautiful colours. I relaly like this one. it''s very compelling. 9', '2004-06-03 16:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(748995, 80167, 15207, '<td valign="top">Really cool shot. TOo bad th elighting is a bit harsh, but it''s really cool nonetheless - 9</td>', 'Really cool shot. TOo bad th elighting is a bit harsh, but it''s really cool nonetheless - 9', '2004-06-03 16:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(748997, 80871, 15207, '<td valign="top">This has a lot of compression that is a bit distracting (maybe when you resaved it your softwre program did something to it). IT''s also hard to tell what it is, which could work as an abstract, but there aren''t any compelling things to look at to draw the eye in - something with richer colours may have worked better. This is a bit creamy and needs something punchy to attract the eye.</td>', 'This has a lot of compression that is a bit distracting (maybe when you resaved it your softwre program did something to it). IT''s also hard to tell what it is, which could work as an abstract, but there aren''t any compelling things to look at to draw the eye in - something with richer colours may have worked better. This is a bit creamy and needs something punchy to attract the eye.', '2004-06-03 16:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(749000, 80869, 15207, '<td valign="top">Try to think about negative space and rule of thirds. This is a good idea, but it''s very distracting in the negative space - the pipes in behind. Also, the lighting is okay, but the colours need to be more saturated.</td>', 'Try to think about negative space and rule of thirds. This is a good idea, but it''s very distracting in the negative space - the pipes in behind. Also, the lighting is okay, but the colours need to be more saturated.', '2004-06-03 16:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
