(749003, 79837, 15207, '<td valign="top">This could have ben really good, but I need something to draw my eye in - something really prominent right in the right or left would have worked (by taking almost a macro close up of one of the paddles looking into a narrow depth of field may have worked. I''m not sure where to look first because there''s nothign to draw my eye into the image.</td>', 'This could have ben really good, but I need something to draw my eye in - something really prominent right in the right or left would have worked (by taking almost a macro close up of one of the paddles looking into a narrow depth of field may have worked. I''m not sure where to look first because there''s nothign to draw my eye into the image.', '2004-06-03 16:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
