(749065, 80815, 3102, '<td valign="top">Other than not being a team sport, and the fact that it shows the "players," you followed the challenge well!  :)  Sorry about the sarcasm; it''s hard to resist sometimes...  otherwise, it is seriously a nice action shot :)</td>', 'Other than not being a team sport, and the fact that it shows the "players," you followed the challenge well!  :)  Sorry about the sarcasm; it''s hard to resist sometimes...  otherwise, it is seriously a nice action shot :)', '2004-06-03 17:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
