(749080, 79875, 15207, '<td valign="top">Very intersting idea. Maybe it could have been even better if you shot it looking straight up at the light - almost to make it look like a diagonal. An effective idea for this challenge though.</td>', 'Very intersting idea. Maybe it could have been even better if you shot it looking straight up at the light - almost to make it look like a diagonal. An effective idea for this challenge though.', '2004-06-03 17:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(749082, 80590, 15207, '<td valign="top">Really cool idea. I like that there''s something in the forefront that draws the viewer''s eyes into what teh guys inthe shop are doing. I even like the tires on the left side. Good luck 8</td>', 'Really cool idea. I like that there''s something in the forefront that draws the viewer''s eyes into what teh guys inthe shop are doing. I even like the tires on the left side. Good luck 8', '2004-06-03 17:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(749084, 80819, 15207, '<td valign="top">This is a good composition, but the colours are so muted and not very saturated that it appears kind of dull. I realize you''re probably trying to create a mood with this one - with teh dead grass, etc., but it''s not as compelling because of that.</td>', 'This is a good composition, but the colours are so muted and not very saturated that it appears kind of dull. I realize you''re probably trying to create a mood with this one - with teh dead grass, etc., but it''s not as compelling because of that.', '2004-06-03 17:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(749088, 80598, 12962, '<td valign="top">Pretty good representation ... thinking outside the box but still it illustrates the spirit of the challenge.  Black and white treatment harkens for times gone by ...</td>', 'Pretty good representation ... thinking outside the box but still it illustrates the spirit of the challenge.  Black and white treatment harkens for times gone by ...', '2004-06-03 17:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(749090, 80281, 12962, '<td valign="top">Nice ... one of those well planned, well executed shots ... colors are great.</td>', 'Nice ... one of those well planned, well executed shots ... colors are great.', '2004-06-03 17:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(749091, 80899, 15207, '<td valign="top">Love that you put something in the forefront to draw the eye into the image. Really excellent idea for this particular composition. The composition works really well but the saturation seems a bit dull. I can tell it was probably a very colourful scene. Maybe you can do something in your software program to increase the saturation or hues slightly. -7</td>', 'Love that you put something in the forefront to draw the eye into the image. Really excellent idea for this particular composition. The composition works really well but the saturation seems a bit dull. I can tell it was probably a very colourful scene. Maybe you can do something in your software program to increase the saturation or hues slightly. -7', '2004-06-03 17:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(749092, 80896, 15207, '<td valign="top">Really really awesome shot. Very unique and interesting - 9</td>', 'Really really awesome shot. Very unique and interesting - 9', '2004-06-03 17:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(749093, 80860, 12962, '<td valign="top">Very well thought of ...</td>', 'Very well thought of ...', '2004-06-03 17:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(749095, 80463, 15207, '<td valign="top">A very good idea for this challenge. Because there is so much going on in the background, it may have been a better composition if you put something into the forefront to draw the reader''s eye into the rest o the scene. Maybe something to explain teh event, like a track outfit, a programme, etc. not sure. I can''t tell what people are waiting to see, but that''s okay too. Just needs something int he forefront - maybe even to create some drama with DOF. Good luck with this though. it''s a good idea.</td>', 'A very good idea for this challenge. Because there is so much going on in the background, it may have been a better composition if you put something into the forefront to draw the reader''s eye into the rest o the scene. Maybe something to explain teh event, like a track outfit, a programme, etc. not sure. I can''t tell what people are waiting to see, but that''s okay too. Just needs something int he forefront - maybe even to create some drama with DOF. Good luck with this though. it''s a good idea.', '2004-06-03 17:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(749096, 79982, 15207, '<td valign="top">Absolutely love this one. It''s interesting, has breat contrast and composition. Good luck 10</td>', 'Absolutely love this one. It''s interesting, has breat contrast and composition. Good luck 10', '2004-06-03 17:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(749097, 80665, 15207, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been really good if the lighting was a bit better, the grain/noise/jpeg compression wasn''t so high (even in low lighting, try to use a low ISO - digital cameras tend to create too much noise with high ISOs). Also, it always adds something if one thing is in motion (or has motion blur) to have the rest of the image dead sharp adn in complete focus. I''m not sure if it''s the grain or the saturation bleeding, but the mit doesn''t look sharp and in focus.</td>', 'I think this would have been really good if the lighting was a bit better, the grain/noise/jpeg compression wasn''t so high (even in low lighting, try to use a low ISO - digital cameras tend to create too much noise with high ISOs). Also, it always adds something if one thing is in motion (or has motion blur) to have the rest of the image dead sharp adn in complete focus. I''m not sure if it''s the grain or the saturation bleeding, but the mit doesn''t look sharp and in focus.', '2004-06-03 17:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(749098, 80451, 15207, '<td valign="top">Oh man... I love this one. It''s my favorite in this entire challenge. 10 I hope this wins!!!</td>', 'Oh man... I love this one. It''s my favorite in this entire challenge. 10 I hope this wins!!!', '2004-06-03 17:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(749099, 80604, 15207, '<td valign="top">Really cool idea. Lots of drama here. Interesting composition - really like the dark smudges on the wall even. Good luck 10</td>', 'Really cool idea. Lots of drama here. Interesting composition - really like the dark smudges on the wall even. Good luck 10', '2004-06-03 17:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(749101, 80524, 15207, '<td valign="top">This may have been a really awesome shot. I''m wondering why you submitted something so small. It''s hard to really examine the photo with the small pixel size. In the future, you''ll probalby get better marks if you take advatage of the 640 x 480 pixel size. I''m sure if you took a poll, many of us are using larger monitors so this appears very very small and hard to see. i can tell the colours are rich, there''s enough action, interesting things in the forefront, etc.... just needs to be bigger.</td>', 'This may have been a really awesome shot. I''m wondering why you submitted something so small. It''s hard to really examine the photo with the small pixel size. In the future, you''ll probalby get better marks if you take advatage of the 640 x 480 pixel size. I''m sure if you took a poll, many of us are using larger monitors so this appears very very small and hard to see. i can tell the colours are rich, there''s enough action, interesting things in the forefront, etc.... just needs to be bigger.', '2004-06-03 17:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(749103, 80158, 15207, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely beautiful. I love that you really captured the rained out feel with an interesting composition - really interesting lighting, etc. 10</td>', 'This is absolutely beautiful. I love that you really captured the rained out feel with an interesting composition - really interesting lighting, etc. 10', '2004-06-03 17:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(749104, 80239, 15207, '<td valign="top">This is the best polo shot  by far. Rich colour saturation. Interesting detail, sharp and in focus - best of all it''s compelling. 10</td>', 'This is the best polo shot  by far. Rich colour saturation. Interesting detail, sharp and in focus - best of all it''s compelling. 10', '2004-06-03 17:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(749106, 80679, 15207, '<td valign="top">This is a really good composition but it''s just too grainy and has too high of JPEG compression. I''m not sure if its your camera or if maybe you are using a software program that is resizing things funny. I''d try to shoot at the highest resolution possible, increase colour saturation wherever possible, and resize so that you don''t lose a lot of image details.</td>', 'This is a really good composition but it''s just too grainy and has too high of JPEG compression. I''m not sure if its your camera or if maybe you are using a software program that is resizing things funny. I''d try to shoot at the highest resolution possible, increase colour saturation wherever possible, and resize so that you don''t lose a lot of image details.', '2004-06-03 17:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(749107, 80461, 18820, '<td valign="top">Would have been cooler with a real background -- sky, sun etc...the back drop is distracting</td>', 'Would have been cooler with a real background -- sky, sun etc...the back drop is distracting', '2004-06-03 17:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(749108, 80806, 15207, '<td valign="top">This is a good composition. The lighting is okay, the noise and pixelization is a bit distracting (try using under 100 ISO whenever possible) - but the image isn''t compelling to me. It may have been better with the scores actually showing up - maybe the bright colours would have added to the composition.</td>', 'This is a good composition. The lighting is okay, the noise and pixelization is a bit distracting (try using under 100 ISO whenever possible) - but the image isn''t compelling to me. It may have been better with the scores actually showing up - maybe the bright colours would have added to the composition.', '2004-06-03 17:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(749110, 80818, 15207, '<td valign="top">The harsh light in this is very distracting and doesn''t add anything to the composition. The colours are a bit off - almost like the white balance wasn''t metering things properly. Also, taking a photo like this dead-on and centered doesn''t add a lot of drama to the composition. Think of things like depth of field, rule of thirds and using negative space.</td>', 'The harsh light in this is very distracting and doesn''t add anything to the composition. The colours are a bit off - almost like the white balance wasn''t metering things properly. Also, taking a photo like this dead-on and centered doesn''t add a lot of drama to the composition. Think of things like depth of field, rule of thirds and using negative space.', '2004-06-03 17:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(749111, 80186, 18820, '<td valign="top">Lighting a little "washed out" looking...I love the composition though... -6</td>', 'Lighting a little "washed out" looking...I love the composition though... -6', '2004-06-03 17:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(749112, 79880, 15207, '<td valign="top">This is really really cool. I wish I could see more detail on the glove, but that''s minor. Also, wish the glove was a bit less in the centre, but that''s minor. Good luck - 9</td>', 'This is really really cool. I wish I could see more detail on the glove, but that''s minor. Also, wish the glove was a bit less in the centre, but that''s minor. Good luck - 9', '2004-06-03 17:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(749113, 80209, 15207, '<td valign="top">This is very very grainy adn pixelated. The saturation is really dead in this - it needs to be punched with richer colours -maybe shot at sunrise or sunset. The idea behind this is very good though and the composition is interesting -5</td>', 'This is very very grainy adn pixelated. The saturation is really dead in this - it needs to be punched with richer colours -maybe shot at sunrise or sunset. The idea behind this is very good though and the composition is interesting -5', '2004-06-03 17:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
