(749116, 80279, 17505, '<td valign="top">Too dark to tell what it is, and from what I can see it''s really out of focus. <br/>I don''t get it.</td>', 'Too dark to tell what it is, and from what I can see it''s really out of focus. I don''t get it.', '2004-06-03 17:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(749118, 80490, 15207, '<td valign="top">I realize this is supposed to look like the bat is hitting the ball, but it looks like it''s glued onto the bat and that''s a bit distracting. I like the angle of the shot though and I''m glad you chose a bat with rich colours - although the light reflecting into the bat is a bit harsh. Good composition overall though 6</td>', 'I realize this is supposed to look like the bat is hitting the ball, but it looks like it''s glued onto the bat and that''s a bit distracting. I like the angle of the shot though and I''m glad you chose a bat with rich colours - although the light reflecting into the bat is a bit harsh. Good composition overall though 6', '2004-06-03 17:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(749121, 79799, 15207, '<td valign="top">This is well composed, but I don''t find pictures of toys to be as interesting as real people (just a personal preference). However, compared to many of the others in this challenge you did a very good job - 7</td>', 'This is well composed, but I don''t find pictures of toys to be as interesting as real people (just a personal preference). However, compared to many of the others in this challenge you did a very good job - 7', '2004-06-03 17:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(749122, 80871, 17505, '<td valign="top">Too close to tell what this object is. I also find the flare distacting.</td>', 'Too close to tell what this object is. I also find the flare distacting.', '2004-06-03 17:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(749123, 79525, 15207, '<td valign="top">Good idea for this challenge. I almost wish you''d shot a bit of the golf ball because that would have made this a 10. 9</td>', 'Good idea for this challenge. I almost wish you''d shot a bit of the golf ball because that would have made this a 10. 9', '2004-06-03 17:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(749126, 80784, 15207, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent subject but I almost wish it was shot frmo a different angle - there''s some drama missing here. You can create drama in several ways in your composition - shooting really close to something and creating a narrow DOF, using lots of negative space to enhance the subject, etc. This one looks more like a snapshot than a photograph. The lighting is extrmely harsh - should try to take more pictures in the early morning or at sunset. 5</td>', 'This is an excellent subject but I almost wish it was shot frmo a different angle - there''s some drama missing here. You can create drama in several ways in your composition - shooting really close to something and creating a narrow DOF, using lots of negative space to enhance the subject, etc. This one looks more like a snapshot than a photograph. The lighting is extrmely harsh - should try to take more pictures in the early morning or at sunset. 5', '2004-06-03 17:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(749127, 79580, 15207, '<td valign="top">I thought I commented on this earlier. It looks as though nothing is actually in focus in this one. The colours are cool and the angle is cool, but you need to have something in focus. Maybe try to create some drama with a narrow DOF.</td>', 'I thought I commented on this earlier. It looks as though nothing is actually in focus in this one. The colours are cool and the angle is cool, but you need to have something in focus. Maybe try to create some drama with a narrow DOF.', '2004-06-03 17:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(749128, 80322, 15207, '<td valign="top">This is awesome. One fo the few detailed shots taht is actually dramatic and compelling. Good luck 10</td>', 'This is awesome. One fo the few detailed shots taht is actually dramatic and compelling. Good luck 10', '2004-06-03 18:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(749129, 80727, 17505, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand why this is a sport, sorry.</td>', 'I don''t understand why this is a sport, sorry.', '2004-06-03 18:01:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(749130, 80530, 16648, '<td valign="top">not keen on the coloring. the backgound furniture looks like a large butt crack to me. Sorry, but that''s what it reminds me of.</td>', 'not keen on the coloring. the backgound furniture looks like a large butt crack to me. Sorry, but that''s what it reminds me of.', '2004-06-03 18:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(749131, 80529, 15207, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how this fits with the theme. It''s a good image though. I almost would like to see this shot from under the grass looking out though - I think putting somethign i the forefront with a narrow DOF would help this image a bit. I love the colours in the grass though. Good luck - you may find your marks suffer because it isn''t obvious what kind of a sport this image is depicting.</td>', 'I''m not sure how this fits with the theme. It''s a good image though. I almost would like to see this shot from under the grass looking out though - I think putting somethign i the forefront with a narrow DOF would help this image a bit. I love the colours in the grass though. Good luck - you may find your marks suffer because it isn''t obvious what kind of a sport this image is depicting.', '2004-06-03 18:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(749132, 80673, 15207, '<td valign="top">This is nice and crisp adn sharp. I like the lighting in this as well adn I really like it in black and white. I almost wonder if it may be even better if shot from a different angle - maybe with a narrow DOF, but I''m not sure&gt; it''s a minor point.</td>', 'This is nice and crisp adn sharp. I like the lighting in this as well adn I really like it in black and white. I almost wonder if it may be even better if shot from a different angle - maybe with a narrow DOF, but I''m not sure> it''s a minor point.', '2004-06-03 18:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(749133, 80857, 15207, '<td valign="top">I like that you put something inthe forefront to make this scene have some drama. a good shot overall. 8</td>', 'I like that you put something inthe forefront to make this scene have some drama. a good shot overall. 8', '2004-06-03 18:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(749134, 80738, 15207, '<td valign="top">This image begs for more negative space. It''s well lit, but there is a bit of a contrasty bright light reflection at the CH in Champro. I realize we just had a centred composition challenge and centering an image for effect is sometimes really effective. For this one though - I think the rule of thirds would have worked much better to add some drama and interest. 5</td>', 'This image begs for more negative space. It''s well lit, but there is a bit of a contrasty bright light reflection at the CH in Champro. I realize we just had a centred composition challenge and centering an image for effect is sometimes really effective. For this one though - I think the rule of thirds would have worked much better to add some drama and interest. 5', '2004-06-03 18:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(749137, 80103, 15207, '<td valign="top">Really interestng and funny too. Love the colours of the tacks. Thanks! - 8</td>', 'Really interestng and funny too. Love the colours of the tacks. Thanks! - 8', '2004-06-03 18:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(749140, 80524, 16648, '<td valign="top">pic is way too small - the long side should be 600 to 640 pixels.</td>', 'pic is way too small - the long side should be 600 to 640 pixels.', '2004-06-03 18:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(749141, 80530, 17505, '<td valign="top">Interesting setup and I like the sepia tones, but the background is very amaturish (for lack of a better word.) The couch makes it look like a quick snapshot rather than a serious photograph. I have bought a length of black velvet to use for photo''s that require a neutral background. In a pinch a tablecloth will usually work as well. I this case I would have brought the objects outside (better lighting) and used a white or wooden background. That''s my opinion, for what it''s worth.</td>', 'Interesting setup and I like the sepia tones, but the background is very amaturish (for lack of a better word.) The couch makes it look like a quick snapshot rather than a serious photograph. I have bought a length of black velvet to use for photo''s that require a neutral background. In a pinch a tablecloth will usually work as well. I this case I would have brought the objects outside (better lighting) and used a white or wooden background. That''s my opinion, for what it''s worth.', '2004-06-03 18:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(749142, 80256, 15207, '<td valign="top">Really intersting idea and effective way to put something into the forefront,</td>', 'Really intersting idea and effective way to put something into the forefront,', '2004-06-03 18:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(749144, 80680, 16648, '<td valign="top">pic is too small - should be 600 to 640 pixels on the longest side.</td>', 'pic is too small - should be 600 to 640 pixels on the longest side.', '2004-06-03 18:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(749146, 80384, 16648, '<td valign="top">kinda flat coloring, low on contrst. Lighting issues?</td>', 'kinda flat coloring, low on contrst. Lighting issues?', '2004-06-03 18:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(749147, 80839, 16648, '<td valign="top">why is the field out of focus?</td>', 'why is the field out of focus?', '2004-06-03 18:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(749152, 80020, 16648, '<td valign="top">underexposed.</td>', 'underexposed.', '2004-06-03 18:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(749155, 80755, 16648, '<td valign="top">could be bit bigger...</td>', 'could be bit bigger...', '2004-06-03 18:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(749156, 80109, 15207, '<td valign="top">Really interesting angle to shoot this. Wonderful composition. would have been that much better if you caught some silhouettes of some other heads looking out in front of you - and some drama with a narrow DOF.  Also, seems slightly over-sharpened so the details, esp. inteh stands seem very weird.</td>', 'Really interesting angle to shoot this. Wonderful composition. would have been that much better if you caught some silhouettes of some other heads looking out in front of you - and some drama with a narrow DOF.  Also, seems slightly over-sharpened so the details, esp. inteh stands seem very weird.', '2004-06-03 18:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(749157, 80600, 15207, '<td valign="top">I like that you created some drama with DOF. I would have liked just a bit more negative space. Good job though 7</td>', 'I like that you created some drama with DOF. I would have liked just a bit more negative space. Good job though 7', '2004-06-03 18:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(749159, 80582, 15207, '<td valign="top">I think if this was shot just a little lower, looking into one of the seats or something, with a narrow DOF and somethign really strong and in your face in the forefront, it would have added a bit more drama. It''s a good idea for this challenge, but it needs a bit more drama. The saturation seems a bit off as well - I''m wondering if it would have looked better if shot early early in the morning or at dusk. 7</td>', 'I think if this was shot just a little lower, looking into one of the seats or something, with a narrow DOF and somethign really strong and in your face in the forefront, it would have added a bit more drama. It''s a good idea for this challenge, but it needs a bit more drama. The saturation seems a bit off as well - I''m wondering if it would have looked better if shot early early in the morning or at dusk. 7', '2004-06-03 18:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(749160, 79433, 15207, '<td valign="top">This is a good idea, but the lighting is extremely harsh. It''s well composed. maybe next time you shoot outdoors, try dusk or dawn for better lighting.</td>', 'This is a good idea, but the lighting is extremely harsh. It''s well composed. maybe next time you shoot outdoors, try dusk or dawn for better lighting.', '2004-06-03 18:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(749162, 79777, 15207, '<td valign="top">This needs something in the immediate forefront (maybe even on a macro seeting) that really adds some drama. This is a good idea - a city baseball field with all those great buildlings - wonderful contrast in behind. However, it feels like it''s missing soemthing. Overall, it''s well composed and the colours are very rich -7</td>', 'This needs something in the immediate forefront (maybe even on a macro seeting) that really adds some drama. This is a good idea - a city baseball field with all those great buildlings - wonderful contrast in behind. However, it feels like it''s missing soemthing. Overall, it''s well composed and the colours are very rich -7', '2004-06-03 18:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(749164, 80006, 15207, '<td valign="top">I like that you used something really strong in the forefront to add some drama. The stuff going on in the background isn''t that interesting though. I realize some of our locations make shooting areas a bit more limitied. Overall a good job though 7</td>', 'I like that you used something really strong in the forefront to add some drama. The stuff going on in the background isn''t that interesting though. I realize some of our locations make shooting areas a bit more limitied. Overall a good job though 7', '2004-06-03 18:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(749166, 80763, 15207, '<td valign="top">Instead of putting your subject in the dead centre, this one would have benefited from a few things - more negative space, a composition using the rule of thirds (doesn''t always work, but would have in this case), and maybe somethin gin the forefront set with a narrow DOF (like even a ship''s mast or something) to add drama. It''s not bad, but it could use some more drama to make it compelling - to turn it from a snapshot into a photograph.</td>', 'Instead of putting your subject in the dead centre, this one would have benefited from a few things - more negative space, a composition using the rule of thirds (doesn''t always work, but would have in this case), and maybe somethin gin the forefront set with a narrow DOF (like even a ship''s mast or something) to add drama. It''s not bad, but it could use some more drama to make it compelling - to turn it from a snapshot into a photograph.', '2004-06-03 18:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(749167, 79559, 15207, '<td valign="top">Really love the angle in this. There''s definitely drama here, even with the empty playing area! good luck!</td>', 'Really love the angle in this. There''s definitely drama here, even with the empty playing area! good luck!', '2004-06-03 18:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(749168, 80852, 15207, '<td valign="top">Love the overall composition and rich colours. 7</td>', 'Love the overall composition and rich colours. 7', '2004-06-03 18:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(749172, 80279, 21183, '<td valign="top">I don''t see any image here.</td>', 'I don''t see any image here.', '2004-06-03 18:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(749184, 80815, 21183, '<td valign="top">Oops - the players managed to sneak into this one?</td>', 'Oops - the players managed to sneak into this one?', '2004-06-03 18:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(749249, 80414, 16126, '<td valign="top">Without the title, this would have nothing to do with team sports. I think the title should be supplemental to the picture, not being the only thing that ties it to the challenge.</td>', 'Without the title, this would have nothing to do with team sports. I think the title should be supplemental to the picture, not being the only thing that ties it to the challenge.', '2004-06-03 18:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(749279, 80207, 18191, '<td valign="top">I love the photo...i guess you JUST convinced me after a lot of thought that it is a team sport.</td>', 'I love the photo...i guess you JUST convinced me after a lot of thought that it is a team sport.', '2004-06-03 19:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(749283, 80725, 18191, '<td valign="top">If a little more of the bottom grass was cropped out, the effect would have been better.</td>', 'If a little more of the bottom grass was cropped out, the effect would have been better.', '2004-06-03 19:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(749286, 80738, 18191, '<td valign="top">Great form.</td>', 'Great form.', '2004-06-03 19:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(749314, 79559, 12857, '<td valign="top">This is one of the best of the bunch.  The angle is simply perfection!!!!  The exposure is professional.  Great DOF.  Would have been great for that challenge as well.  I love that you can see the old paint pealing.  I think that I have to give you a 10.<br/> <br/>Next day now.  I alwasy revisit the photos the second day.  I like it even better the second time.  I would give it an 11 if I could.</td>', 'This is one of the best of the bunch.  The angle is simply perfection!!!!  The exposure is professional.  Great DOF.  Would have been great for that challenge as well.  I love that you can see the old paint pealing.  I think that I have to give you a 10. Next day now.  I alwasy revisit the photos the second day.  I like it even better the second time.  I would give it an 11 if I could.', '2004-06-03 19:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(749325, 80485, 21440, '<td valign="top">my kind of style-really like the effect. well done. take an 8</td>', 'my kind of style-really like the effect. well done. take an 8', '2004-06-03 20:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(749328, 80682, 21440, '<td valign="top">if  you say so</td>', 'if  you say so', '2004-06-03 20:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(749329, 80240, 21440, '<td valign="top">good use of angles. great that you got the 3 thing right.take 7</td>', 'good use of angles. great that you got the 3 thing right.take 7', '2004-06-03 20:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(749330, 80871, 21440, '<td valign="top">too abstract for me.</td>', 'too abstract for me.', '2004-06-03 20:11:48.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(749331, 80131, 21440, '<td valign="top">enjoy the idea and composition. in the running for a ribbon - 8</td>', 'enjoy the idea and composition. in the running for a ribbon - 8', '2004-06-03 20:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(749332, 80604, 21440, '<td valign="top">is this back row at the cinema?</td>', 'is this back row at the cinema?', '2004-06-03 20:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(749333, 80878, 13085, '<td valign="top">i love this picture</td>', 'i love this picture', '2004-06-03 20:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(749336, 79518, 21440, '<td valign="top">Great shot! Colours and numbers does it for me. 10 you''re a ribbon!</td>', 'Great shot! Colours and numbers does it for me. 10 you''re a ribbon!', '2004-06-03 20:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(749337, 80839, 21440, '<td valign="top">clever one. great use of foreground.</td>', 'clever one. great use of foreground.', '2004-06-03 20:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(749339, 80681, 21440, '<td valign="top">nice one. composition,lighting and cropping. 8</td>', 'nice one. composition,lighting and cropping. 8', '2004-06-03 20:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(749341, 80607, 21440, '<td valign="top">great idea and the composition works well with me.I also did a polo one, seems like i might get the boot though. This could be a ribbon from me- 8</td>', 'great idea and the composition works well with me.I also did a polo one, seems like i might get the boot though. This could be a ribbon from me- 8', '2004-06-03 20:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(749343, 80758, 21440, '<td valign="top">good cropping,but i am sure the players are still visible to some extent.</td>', 'good cropping,but i am sure the players are still visible to some extent.', '2004-06-03 20:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(749443, 79809, 22011, '<td valign="top">Nice use of depth of field, and nice depth of field..  I wonder how many folks wont get the joke?</td>', 'Nice use of depth of field, and nice depth of field..  I wonder how many folks wont get the joke?', '2004-06-03 22:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(749444, 80899, 22011, '<td valign="top">Great choice of jersey....  Erricson Stadium?</td>', 'Great choice of jersey....  Erricson Stadium?', '2004-06-03 22:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(749448, 79580, 22011, '<td valign="top">The focus seems a bit off with this shot?  Nice composition.</td>', 'The focus seems a bit off with this shot?  Nice composition.', '2004-06-03 22:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(749449, 80529, 22011, '<td valign="top">Is the shed out of bounds?  I like the creative interpretation...</td>', 'Is the shed out of bounds?  I like the creative interpretation...', '2004-06-03 22:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(749452, 80720, 22011, '<td valign="top">Neat composition.  Having the image smaller than allowed lets it down a bit I think..</td>', 'Neat composition.  Having the image smaller than allowed lets it down a bit I think..', '2004-06-03 22:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(749456, 80658, 22011, '<td valign="top">Your, er, balls appear to be a bit overexposed.</td>', 'Your, er, balls appear to be a bit overexposed.', '2004-06-03 22:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(749460, 80803, 20210, '<td valign="top">great idea, too washed out for my taste, and too noisy, like it was shot at ISO 800 or so.</td>', 'great idea, too washed out for my taste, and too noisy, like it was shot at ISO 800 or so.', '2004-06-03 22:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(749462, 80680, 20210, '<td valign="top">why so tiny?  that''s a real disappointment for this entry. :(</td>', 'why so tiny?  that''s a real disappointment for this entry. :(', '2004-06-03 22:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(749465, 79837, 19952, '<td valign="top">What a great photo and an excellent choice to desaturate. Really nice job!</td>', 'What a great photo and an excellent choice to desaturate. Really nice job!', '2004-06-03 22:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(749471, 80261, 19952, '<td valign="top">Really excellent shot - one of the best of the challenge. The only distraction for me is the light at the top left. I''d be tempted to crop the left 20% of the photo or just clone the white patch out. Once you''ve done that, this photo belongs on a poster in Cooperstown!</td>', 'Really excellent shot - one of the best of the challenge. The only distraction for me is the light at the top left. I''d be tempted to crop the left 20% of the photo or just clone the white patch out. Once you''ve done that, this photo belongs on a poster in Cooperstown!', '2004-06-03 22:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(749476, 80020, 22011, '<td valign="top">The the riders not the players?</td>', 'The the riders not the players?', '2004-06-03 22:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(749482, 80588, 7322, '<td valign="top">I love this.  I love the color and clarity of the umbrella and the placement of the figure off in the distance. It tells a simple story, evokes a mood, and is beautiful to look at. This is my top pick.</td>', 'I love this.  I love the color and clarity of the umbrella and the placement of the figure off in the distance. It tells a simple story, evokes a mood, and is beautiful to look at. This is my top pick.', '2004-06-03 22:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(749483, 80167, 19952, '<td valign="top">i sure hope you don''t get dinged for having that boot in this picture. It''s a really nice action shot that meets the challenge and deserves an excellent score. Great job!</td>', 'i sure hope you don''t get dinged for having that boot in this picture. It''s a really nice action shot that meets the challenge and deserves an excellent score. Great job!', '2004-06-03 22:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(749487, 80849, 19952, '<td valign="top">Really excellent textures in this picture, which are highlighted nicely by desaturating it. A bit of a glare on the right two balls, but overall an excellent shot. Nice job!</td>', 'Really excellent textures in this picture, which are highlighted nicely by desaturating it. A bit of a glare on the right two balls, but overall an excellent shot. Nice job!', '2004-06-03 22:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(749490, 79518, 19952, '<td valign="top">Really excellent, colorful shot - one of the best in the challenge. I wish I could take a shot like this, but I just don''t have the balls. ;-)</td>', 'Really excellent, colorful shot - one of the best in the challenge. I wish I could take a shot like this, but I just don''t have the balls. ;-)', '2004-06-03 22:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(749492, 80604, 7322, '<td valign="top">I really liked this shot although it took me awhile to really decide that. I kept trying to figure out what about the composition appealed to me. It shouldn''t work really because the chairs are leading the eye to an empty wall. But then I thought about all those dirty smudges on the wall and decided they tell a story about the players and the game. It''s an unusual composition and I have a feeling I''m going to be in the minority (grain is practically taboo here) but I hope this does well for you. It''s in my top three.</td>', 'I really liked this shot although it took me awhile to really decide that. I kept trying to figure out what about the composition appealed to me. It shouldn''t work really because the chairs are leading the eye to an empty wall. But then I thought about all those dirty smudges on the wall and decided they tell a story about the players and the game. It''s an unusual composition and I have a feeling I''m going to be in the minority (grain is practically taboo here) but I hope this does well for you. It''s in my top three.', '2004-06-03 22:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(749494, 80604, 19952, '<td valign="top">Really excellent shot. I love all the grain and dirt - it looks like it could have been taken yesterday or 50 years ago. The right wall does have a bit of a glare, but I still love this picture. Very nice job!</td>', 'Really excellent shot. I love all the grain and dirt - it looks like it could have been taken yesterday or 50 years ago. The right wall does have a bit of a glare, but I still love this picture. Very nice job!', '2004-06-03 22:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(749495, 80681, 19952, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a nice photo. Even if these gloves weren''t used on the 1952 Olympic team, it sure looks like they could have been. Excellent job.</td>', 'Wow, what a nice photo. Even if these gloves weren''t used on the 1952 Olympic team, it sure looks like they could have been. Excellent job.', '2004-06-03 22:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(749499, 80833, 19952, '<td valign="top">Really nice shot. I would probably clone out the leaves in the upper left, but this photo looks great with or without them Great job!</td>', 'Really nice shot. I would probably clone out the leaves in the upper left, but this photo looks great with or without them Great job!', '2004-06-03 22:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(749501, 79777, 19952, '<td valign="top">Great shot with nice bright colors. You captured this challenge theme perfectly. Nice job!</td>', 'Great shot with nice bright colors. You captured this challenge theme perfectly. Nice job!', '2004-06-03 22:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(749503, 80680, 19952, '<td valign="top">If the people weren''t such a significant element in this photo (and if it were a bit larger), it would probably get a ribbon. This is an excellent idea for this contest and you captured the shot beautifully. Nice job!</td>', 'If the people weren''t such a significant element in this photo (and if it were a bit larger), it would probably get a ribbon. This is an excellent idea for this contest and you captured the shot beautifully. Nice job!', '2004-06-03 22:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(749505, 80724, 22125, '<td valign="top">is this a team sport, not in aust, love the pic.</td>', 'is this a team sport, not in aust, love the pic.', '2004-06-03 22:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(749507, 79880, 19952, '<td valign="top">Really nice shot. I think it would be better with more light on the glove, but that would be pretty hard to accomplish in this setting. Still, I like the photo as it is. Good job.</td>', 'Really nice shot. I think it would be better with more light on the glove, but that would be pretty hard to accomplish in this setting. Still, I like the photo as it is. Good job.', '2004-06-03 22:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
