(750047, 80857, 15920, '<td valign="top">I like everything about this except the distracting lights.reflections in the trees behind the net.  Color choice and contrast are excellent, composition and DOF choices are good (a slight increase on DOF so that the net was just  alittle more in focus might work as well, not sure.)  Your choice of a ball that is somewhat experienced is also perfect for the shot.</td>', 'I like everything about this except the distracting lights.reflections in the trees behind the net.  Color choice and contrast are excellent, composition and DOF choices are good (a slight increase on DOF so that the net was just  alittle more in focus might work as well, not sure.)  Your choice of a ball that is somewhat experienced is also perfect for the shot.', '2004-06-04 10:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(750048, 80524, 15920, '<td valign="top">Too small to judge.</td>', 'Too small to judge.', '2004-06-04 10:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(750051, 80682, 15920, '<td valign="top">If you are a parent with kids that play football (soccer) you have got to love this shot.  Excellent take on the challenge.  Oranges could be just a touch more in focus. -8</td>', 'If you are a parent with kids that play football (soccer) you have got to love this shot.  Excellent take on the challenge.  Oranges could be just a touch more in focus. -8', '2004-06-04 10:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
