(750061, 80414, 15920, '<td valign="top">Where was this in Centered Composition?  I like the composition, and scored this relatively highly.  A little improvement on your lighting to bring out the metal qualities in the blades shown, and this would be my top pick for its originality.</td>', 'Where was this in Centered Composition?  I like the composition, and scored this relatively highly.  A little improvement on your lighting to bring out the metal qualities in the blades shown, and this would be my top pick for its originality.', '2004-06-04 11:00:08.000000', NULL, 1),
