(750390, 79804, 10959, '<td valign="top">Pretty good lighting and a nice, sharp shot, but I think it would have been a more interesting photo if you had backed off a bit and put some context around the ball--maybe some baseball cards, tickets, etc. to make a complete still life.</td>', 'Pretty good lighting and a nice, sharp shot, but I think it would have been a more interesting photo if you had backed off a bit and put some context around the ball--maybe some baseball cards, tickets, etc. to make a complete still life.', '2004-06-04 16:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(750393, 80281, 10959, '<td valign="top">Good minimalist composition--I like it.  You''ve successfully captured the game in a series of lines and shapes.</td>', 'Good minimalist composition--I like it.  You''ve successfully captured the game in a series of lines and shapes.', '2004-06-04 16:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(750397, 80758, 10959, '<td valign="top">Cool photo, but I see A LOT of players--Yes, you didn''t include the TOPS of their bodies, but this IS still a photo of the players.</td>', 'Cool photo, but I see A LOT of players--Yes, you didn''t include the TOPS of their bodies, but this IS still a photo of the players.', '2004-06-04 16:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(750399, 80682, 10959, '<td valign="top">Neat photo--great color and composition, but this doesn''t say "Team Sports" to me.</td>', 'Neat photo--great color and composition, but this doesn''t say "Team Sports" to me.', '2004-06-04 16:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(750400, 80851, 10959, '<td valign="top">Good use of shallow DOF.  Nice photo.</td>', 'Good use of shallow DOF.  Nice photo.', '2004-06-04 16:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(750408, 80205, 10959, '<td valign="top">Wow, now here''s one for "Unusual Viewpoint".  I first thought this was a set of nasty teeth and gums!</td>', 'Wow, now here''s one for "Unusual Viewpoint".  I first thought this was a set of nasty teeth and gums!', '2004-06-04 16:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(750409, 80525, 10959, '<td valign="top">Great composition--the net could be a bit sharper, but I like it.</td>', 'Great composition--the net could be a bit sharper, but I like it.', '2004-06-04 16:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(750410, 80020, 10959, '<td valign="top">Did you miss the "Without Players" part fo the challenge title?</td>', 'Did you miss the "Without Players" part fo the challenge title?', '2004-06-04 16:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(750412, 80103, 10959, '<td valign="top">Yes, this IS creative!  Hopefully people really LOOK at this photo, because it is very well done.  You''ve got the pushpins in at various levels, and have a perfect tilt on both the Kicker and the Keeper.  Very well done!</td>', 'Yes, this IS creative!  Hopefully people really LOOK at this photo, because it is very well done.  You''ve got the pushpins in at various levels, and have a perfect tilt on both the Kicker and the Keeper.  Very well done!', '2004-06-04 16:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(750413, 80815, 10959, '<td valign="top">Wow...excellent.  The slight bit of motion blur is perfect to capture the feeling of speed.  I''m not sure Track qualifies as a "team sport", but it IS a great photo.  Unfortunately, you missed the part about "...Without Players".</td>', 'Wow...excellent.  The slight bit of motion blur is perfect to capture the feeling of speed.  I''m not sure Track qualifies as a "team sport", but it IS a great photo.  Unfortunately, you missed the part about "...Without Players".', '2004-06-04 16:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(750414, 80131, 10959, '<td valign="top">Wow, great relfexes on that shutter button finger!  This successfully captures the FEELING of the sport, which is difficult to do.  9</td>', 'Wow, great relfexes on that shutter button finger!  This successfully captures the FEELING of the sport, which is difficult to do.  9', '2004-06-04 16:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(750423, 80681, 10959, '<td valign="top">Great toning..very evocative photo, and a good fit for the challenge.  <br/> <br/>Upon review of all the other entries, I''ve revisited this one, and I am giving it a 10.  I think this is the best photo in this challenge, becuase you have succesfully captured the FEELING of the sport.  Worn, beat up and scarred gloves.  The black and white/toned photo and overall dark tones and subdued lighting gives a feeling of tiredness.  Very well done!<br/> <br/>You might get some opinions that boxing isn''t a team sport.  Well, I kind of agree, but I''m giving you the benefit of the doubt and including the various trainers, doctors, coaches, etc. that are all behind the fighter.</td>', 'Great toning..very evocative photo, and a good fit for the challenge.   Upon review of all the other entries, I''ve revisited this one, and I am giving it a 10.  I think this is the best photo in this challenge, becuase you have succesfully captured the FEELING of the sport.  Worn, beat up and scarred gloves.  The black and white/toned photo and overall dark tones and subdued lighting gives a feeling of tiredness.  Very well done! You might get some opinions that boxing isn''t a team sport.  Well, I kind of agree, but I''m giving you the benefit of the doubt and including the various trainers, doctors, coaches, etc. that are all behind the fighter.', '2004-06-04 16:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(750491, 80676, 20779, '<td valign="top">There were many similar shots, but for me, this one really makes an impact and is very interesting to look at. Should score very high!!</td>', 'There were many similar shots, but for me, this one really makes an impact and is very interesting to look at. Should score very high!!', '2004-06-04 17:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(750492, 80020, 20779, '<td valign="top">Great movement to this.</td>', 'Great movement to this.', '2004-06-04 17:51:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(750493, 80516, 20779, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene; terrific, soft light and color.</td>', 'Beautiful scene; terrific, soft light and color.', '2004-06-04 17:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(750497, 80131, 20779, '<td valign="top">Love the movement and perspective here! Very clear. Just noticed you even got a couple of seagulls in the shot!</td>', 'Love the movement and perspective here! Very clear. Just noticed you even got a couple of seagulls in the shot!', '2004-06-04 17:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(750498, 80851, 20779, '<td valign="top">Perhaps the most original perspective in the challenge. Just the right focus, lighting and crop IMO.</td>', 'Perhaps the most original perspective in the challenge. Just the right focus, lighting and crop IMO.', '2004-06-04 17:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(750500, 80582, 20779, '<td valign="top">Love the colors. I don''t see one particular subject of focus, but I am not missing one in this. Great shot!!!</td>', 'Love the colors. I don''t see one particular subject of focus, but I am not missing one in this. Great shot!!!', '2004-06-04 17:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(750501, 80720, 20779, '<td valign="top">Beautiful interpretation. Think the balance really makes it.</td>', 'Beautiful interpretation. Think the balance really makes it.', '2004-06-04 17:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(750503, 80873, 20779, '<td valign="top">You captured this at just the right time/light! I am really drawn into this one; very much invokes the sport for me.</td>', 'You captured this at just the right time/light! I am really drawn into this one; very much invokes the sport for me.', '2004-06-04 17:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
