(750583, 80685, 20779, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scenery, but a little muted (maybe my monitor?). It is so dark, I can''t see any skiing equipment or sites, so I scored a little lower. The horizon looks tilted, but again, the darkness is preventing a clear view.</td>', 'Beautiful scenery, but a little muted (maybe my monitor?). It is so dark, I can''t see any skiing equipment or sites, so I scored a little lower. The horizon looks tilted, but again, the darkness is preventing a clear view.', '2004-06-04 19:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
