(751092, 80490, 8891, '<td valign="top">I think a good wooden bat (sorry I''m a purist) would have been a better choice here. The green color is very distracting as is the graphic lettering. Great idea and nicely shot.</td>', 'I think a good wooden bat (sorry I''m a purist) would have been a better choice here. The green color is very distracting as is the graphic lettering. Great idea and nicely shot.', '2004-06-05 01:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
