(751149, 80525, 19608, '<td valign="top">OK.  Read everything before reacting.  <br/>1) The border is way too heavy for this image.  I really don''t think you need one.<br/>2) I would like a "tiny" bit more space between the net and the edge on the right,<br/>3) More detail in the sand would help immensely.<br/>4) Try the same scene with better lighting.<br/> <br/>Having said all that - it is a SUPERB composition - just the perfect amount of blue sky, black sea and golden sand.  The net is positioned in a very intriguing spot.  Great use of the negative space.     The slim Jim presentation is absolutely right on.<br/> <br/>I guess what I''m saying is that this is a GREAT submission, one of my favorites, but I want to reach out and shake you for not taking it the rest of the way!  <br/> <br/> <br/></td>', 'OK.  Read everything before reacting.  1) The border is way too heavy for this image.  I really don''t think you need one.2) I would like a "tiny" bit more space between the net and the edge on the right,3) More detail in the sand would help immensely.4) Try the same scene with better lighting. Having said all that - it is a SUPERB composition - just the perfect amount of blue sky, black sea and golden sand.  The net is positioned in a very intriguing spot.  Great use of the negative space.     The slim Jim presentation is absolutely right on. I guess what I''m saying is that this is a GREAT submission, one of my favorites, but I want to reach out and shake you for not taking it the rest of the way!    ', '2004-06-05 02:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(751161, 80485, 10268, '<td valign="top">I don''t like your choice of making everything green at all.</td>', 'I don''t like your choice of making everything green at all.', '2004-06-05 03:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(751163, 80525, 10268, '<td valign="top">I think there is too much sand.  So I think this would have been stronger if the sand/water horizon line was centered.  And maybe if the had walked a couple feet and removed the lifeguard station out of the way.<br/> <br/>Anyway, this is my favorite so far (I''ve gone through about 50 really boring entries so far.  And this is my first score above a 6).  7.</td>', 'I think there is too much sand.  So I think this would have been stronger if the sand/water horizon line was centered.  And maybe if the had walked a couple feet and removed the lifeguard station out of the way. Anyway, this is my favorite so far (I''ve gone through about 50 really boring entries so far.  And this is my first score above a 6).  7.', '2004-06-05 03:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
