(751777, 80815, 15920, '<td valign="top">Great picture, a little faster shutter speed would have really stopped the motion cleanly.  I also might have laid the rake down before the race.<br/> <br/>Also, I am assuming that this is a picture of the team shot put competition, since this would be a 1 if I didn''t make that assumption.</td>', 'Great picture, a little faster shutter speed would have really stopped the motion cleanly.  I also might have laid the rake down before the race. Also, I am assuming that this is a picture of the team shot put competition, since this would be a 1 if I didn''t make that assumption.', '2004-06-05 20:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
