(751784, 80875, 15920, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but this isn''t the strongest effort of the competition.  The highlights on the ball, truck, and rug/towel are overblown.  The composition lacks interest, with just too many places to put my eye, and a vacuum would help overall.</td>', 'Sorry, but this isn''t the strongest effort of the competition.  The highlights on the ball, truck, and rug/towel are overblown.  The composition lacks interest, with just too many places to put my eye, and a vacuum would help overall.', '2004-06-05 21:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(751785, 80239, 15920, '<td valign="top">One of the best in the competition.  Nice crop (given the subject of th echallenge) and great stop action.</td>', 'One of the best in the competition.  Nice crop (given the subject of th echallenge) and great stop action.', '2004-06-05 21:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(751797, 80681, 18197, '<td valign="top">In my view, the only 10 in the submissions for this challengs. This is beautifully evocative. The worn gloves seem symbolic of the way boxing wears out the boxer. The old gloves seem nostalgicly out of step with the slick, monied sport boxing has become. The black and white works very well and seems to symbolize the black and white of olymics competition. Well titled. The the levels are perfect. The composition is perfect. The focus is nearly perfect.  If you don''t ribbon, no one deserves to! Good luck.</td>', 'In my view, the only 10 in the submissions for this challengs. This is beautifully evocative. The worn gloves seem symbolic of the way boxing wears out the boxer. The old gloves seem nostalgicly out of step with the slick, monied sport boxing has become. The black and white works very well and seems to symbolize the black and white of olymics competition. Well titled. The the levels are perfect. The composition is perfect. The focus is nearly perfect.  If you don''t ribbon, no one deserves to! Good luck.', '2004-06-05 21:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(751799, 80210, 18197, '<td valign="top">A nicely composed photo. Good levels and contrast. Color of the lawn is a bit washed out. Focus is a bit off but capturing the motion was worth it. I would have rated this a 4 or 5 except Bacci is a game where individuals compete and therefore not a team sport: doesn''t meet the challengs. (1)</td>', 'A nicely composed photo. Good levels and contrast. Color of the lawn is a bit washed out. Focus is a bit off but capturing the motion was worth it. I would have rated this a 4 or 5 except Bacci is a game where individuals compete and therefore not a team sport: doesn''t meet the challengs. (1)', '2004-06-05 21:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(751800, 80841, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice Macro. Very good focus. Good levels.  Focus seems just a bit off but it may be depth of field limits. Somehow, I don''t think of darts as a team sport, however, so I bumped the score down from a 5-6. (2)</td>', 'Nice Macro. Very good focus. Good levels.  Focus seems just a bit off but it may be depth of field limits. Somehow, I don''t think of darts as a team sport, however, so I bumped the score down from a 5-6. (2)', '2004-06-05 21:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(751802, 80516, 18197, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition, color and focus. Outer limits of levels are a bit too saturated. I would have rated it a 6-7 ... but I can''t imagine canoeing as a team sport. Doesn''t meet challenge. (2).</td>', 'I really like the composition, color and focus. Outer limits of levels are a bit too saturated. I would have rated it a 6-7 ... but I can''t imagine canoeing as a team sport. Doesn''t meet challenge. (2).', '2004-06-05 21:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(751804, 80692, 18197, '<td valign="top">This is actually quite a nice picture. I like the composition, focus, DOF and levels. Very nice capture of the reflection. You might have used PS to remove dust and scratches. So all that said, I bumped the score down from 5-6 because I can''t for the life of me think what team sport this is, team slinky? Therefore, doesn''t meet the challenge. (2)</td>', 'This is actually quite a nice picture. I like the composition, focus, DOF and levels. Very nice capture of the reflection. You might have used PS to remove dust and scratches. So all that said, I bumped the score down from 5-6 because I can''t for the life of me think what team sport this is, team slinky? Therefore, doesn''t meet the challenge. (2)', '2004-06-05 21:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(751808, 80758, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. I like the aspect ratio which works nicely with the subject matter. Very dynamic. Good levels. Contrast could be a bit sharper if you wanted the photo to pop a bit more. I bumped this down, however, from 4-5 because the players are in the photo and therefore doesn''t meet challenge. (1)</td>', 'Nice photo. I like the aspect ratio which works nicely with the subject matter. Very dynamic. Good levels. Contrast could be a bit sharper if you wanted the photo to pop a bit more. I bumped this down, however, from 4-5 because the players are in the photo and therefore doesn''t meet challenge. (1)', '2004-06-05 21:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(751812, 80717, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like the abstract nature of this photo. Levels, focus, and contrast are nearly perfect. Black and white works well. Portrait orientation works well. Very little to criticize. The highlights on the rightmost oar are lost on the others. I bit stronger highlights would have improved it in my opinion. I suspect it may score a bit below what it deserves because it''s not very dynamic. Good luck. (8)</td>', 'I like the abstract nature of this photo. Levels, focus, and contrast are nearly perfect. Black and white works well. Portrait orientation works well. Very little to criticize. The highlights on the rightmost oar are lost on the others. I bit stronger highlights would have improved it in my opinion. I suspect it may score a bit below what it deserves because it''s not very dynamic. Good luck. (8)', '2004-06-05 21:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(751814, 80822, 18197, '<td valign="top">Lots of hoop shots make this a bit of a cliche (not your fault). Best of this genre.</td>', 'Lots of hoop shots make this a bit of a cliche (not your fault). Best of this genre.', '2004-06-05 21:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(751817, 80682, 18197, '<td valign="top">My son played soccer from age 5 to 18. This photo lit me up remembering the games and the oranges at half time for energy. Thanks! I worry that it will not score well because a lot of folks may not understand the relationship to youth soccer. Glad you took the risk, however.  Good luck! (6)</td>', 'My son played soccer from age 5 to 18. This photo lit me up remembering the games and the oranges at half time for energy. Thanks! I worry that it will not score well because a lot of folks may not understand the relationship to youth soccer. Glad you took the risk, however.  Good luck! (6)', '2004-06-05 21:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(751821, 80485, 18197, '<td valign="top">Each time I go back to review my scores, I bump this photo up one. Well composed. Levels are good. Color is great. Reminds me of a cool summer evening after a hot day in my home town! Hope you do well in the scoring. (7)</td>', 'Each time I go back to review my scores, I bump this photo up one. Well composed. Levels are good. Color is great. Reminds me of a cool summer evening after a hot day in my home town! Hope you do well in the scoring. (7)', '2004-06-05 21:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(751827, 80815, 15767, '<td valign="top">Team sports without players?</td>', 'Team sports without players?', '2004-06-05 22:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(751828, 80158, 19952, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice photo. For some reason, my gut reaction is that I want to see a little more dirt and mud along with the water, so I think this photo might be better from a slightly wider angle. But I do like the reflections you were able to get in the water. Either way, this is a good shot. Nice job!</td>', 'This is a really nice photo. For some reason, my gut reaction is that I want to see a little more dirt and mud along with the water, so I think this photo might be better from a slightly wider angle. But I do like the reflections you were able to get in the water. Either way, this is a good shot. Nice job!', '2004-06-05 22:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(751862, 80758, 19952, '<td valign="top">I hope you don''t get dinged for showing the legs and feet. This is a nice shot that meets the challenge well. The focus is a bit soft and the colors could be brighter, but I really like the angle and the composition. Good job!</td>', 'I hope you don''t get dinged for showing the legs and feet. This is a nice shot that meets the challenge well. The focus is a bit soft and the colors could be brighter, but I really like the angle and the composition. Good job!', '2004-06-05 23:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(751865, 80528, 19952, '<td valign="top">I really love this shot. The colors and tone are excellent. Great job!</td>', 'I really love this shot. The colors and tone are excellent. Great job!', '2004-06-05 23:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(751883, 80261, 8891, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed and very well shot. Like the sepia toning to give it a sort of an old time look.</td>', 'Nicely composed and very well shot. Like the sepia toning to give it a sort of an old time look.', '2004-06-05 23:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(751888, 80598, 8891, '<td valign="top">Nice collection, a triple threat..  Nice lighting and tones. I think that if you were not completely showing the taller of the trophies that you might have removed them. Otherwise quite nice.</td>', 'Nice collection, a triple threat..  Nice lighting and tones. I think that if you were not completely showing the taller of the trophies that you might have removed them. Otherwise quite nice.', '2004-06-06 00:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
