(751963, 80762, 19608, '<td valign="top">There were many many basketball hoop shots - but your may be the winner.  It''s taken with perfect lighting, has great exposure and loads of interest.  The fact that the net is missing adds another unique twist.  I would, however, suggest you retire that garish orange border into the land of OZ.</td>', 'There were many many basketball hoop shots - but your may be the winner.  It''s taken with perfect lighting, has great exposure and loads of interest.  The fact that the net is missing adds another unique twist.  I would, however, suggest you retire that garish orange border into the land of OZ.', '2004-06-06 02:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(751968, 80725, 19608, '<td valign="top">I love foogy day images such as this.  Yours has perfect exposure along with a great composition.</td>', 'I love foogy day images such as this.  Yours has perfect exposure along with a great composition.', '2004-06-06 03:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(751969, 80758, 19608, '<td valign="top">Unusual - but I really liket the slim Jim presentation.  Exposure right on - loads of interest.  I hope you had a tripod and took a really slow exposure as well.</td>', 'Unusual - but I really liket the slim Jim presentation.  Exposure right on - loads of interest.  I hope you had a tripod and took a really slow exposure as well.', '2004-06-06 03:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
