(751974, 80717, 19608, '<td valign="top">It''s really a nice black and white image depicting a difficult team sport.  I must say however that your title, although catchy, makes one moan and groan.</td>', 'It''s really a nice black and white image depicting a difficult team sport.  I must say however that your title, although catchy, makes one moan and groan.', '2004-06-06 03:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(751979, 80279, 16965, '<td valign="top">Maybe it is different on your monitor, but all I see are two very faint poles.  I have no real idea what is going on here.</td>', 'Maybe it is different on your monitor, but all I see are two very faint poles.  I have no real idea what is going on here.', '2004-06-06 03:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(751981, 80692, 16965, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, I just don''t understand what is going on in this image...</td>', 'I''m sorry, I just don''t understand what is going on in this image...', '2004-06-06 03:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(751982, 80451, 16965, '<td valign="top">Low light focusing is difficult, but it really detracts this image.</td>', 'Low light focusing is difficult, but it really detracts this image.', '2004-06-06 03:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(751983, 80103, 16965, '<td valign="top">Nice image, but not to my liking for an image of team sports.</td>', 'Nice image, but not to my liking for an image of team sports.', '2004-06-06 04:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(751984, 80839, 16965, '<td valign="top">Very little focus in this image, even the leaves in the foreground are out of focus.  it leads to an uninteresting image.</td>', 'Very little focus in this image, even the leaves in the foreground are out of focus.  it leads to an uninteresting image.', '2004-06-06 04:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(751988, 80815, 16965, '<td valign="top">I know that Track and Field is indeed a team sport, but you have players in your ''Team Sports Without Players'' picture.  Great picture, though....</td>', 'I know that Track and Field is indeed a team sport, but you have players in your ''Team Sports Without Players'' picture.  Great picture, though....', '2004-06-06 04:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(751990, 80818, 16965, '<td valign="top">a bit boring, and the flash bounce-back is very distracting...  maybe taking the image from more an angle would benefit the image.</td>', 'a bit boring, and the flash bounce-back is very distracting...  maybe taking the image from more an angle would benefit the image.', '2004-06-06 04:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(751991, 79799, 16965, '<td valign="top">Sorry to say, even though they aren''t the real thing, you still have players in your ''Team Sports Without Players'' submission...  the focus could be a bit tighter, and the background a bit less distracting</td>', 'Sorry to say, even though they aren''t the real thing, you still have players in your ''Team Sports Without Players'' submission...  the focus could be a bit tighter, and the background a bit less distracting', '2004-06-06 04:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(751992, 80727, 16965, '<td valign="top">I dont'' know if I would ever consider homework a team ''sport''</td>', 'I dont'' know if I would ever consider homework a team ''sport''', '2004-06-06 04:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(752007, 79407, 9809, '<td valign="top">Nice concept and nice angle -- all except the tilt to the right. People generally like to see that horizon running straight across, or really skewed, like you meant it. the cleat marks are a definite bonus that makes this look more like a moment in time in the game rather than an empty field.</td>', 'Nice concept and nice angle -- all except the tilt to the right. People generally like to see that horizon running straight across, or really skewed, like you meant it. the cleat marks are a definite bonus that makes this look more like a moment in time in the game rather than an empty field.', '2004-06-06 06:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(752008, 80279, 9809, '<td valign="top">What am I looking at?</td>', 'What am I looking at?', '2004-06-06 06:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(752013, 80590, 9809, '<td valign="top">My first impulse was "racing isn''t a team sport -- it''s one individual against another." But then I thought, "no way -- racing IS a team sport." Sure, you only have one driver, just as in football you have only one quarterback. Still football requires more than just a quarterback as racing does need more than just a driver -- the driver has a whole team behind him (or her). That being said, the person IN this photo WOULD BE one of that team, thus this photo doesn''t meet the challenge -- you are showing one of the players. Dang... I liked this photo too (it beats looking at yet another photo of a basketball hoop by a long shot). I''d say you definitely have a keeper here, it just doesn''t fit the challenge.</td>', 'My first impulse was "racing isn''t a team sport -- it''s one individual against another." But then I thought, "no way -- racing IS a team sport." Sure, you only have one driver, just as in football you have only one quarterback. Still football requires more than just a quarterback as racing does need more than just a driver -- the driver has a whole team behind him (or her). That being said, the person IN this photo WOULD BE one of that team, thus this photo doesn''t meet the challenge -- you are showing one of the players. Dang... I liked this photo too (it beats looking at yet another photo of a basketball hoop by a long shot). I''d say you definitely have a keeper here, it just doesn''t fit the challenge.', '2004-06-06 06:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(752014, 80209, 9809, '<td valign="top">Love the shot and the title is great. The faded threads on the ball work great -- I just wish the grass wasn''t so light -- it should be rich green.</td>', 'Love the shot and the title is great. The faded threads on the ball work great -- I just wish the grass wasn''t so light -- it should be rich green.', '2004-06-06 06:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(752017, 80516, 15920, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, with a strong competition, but the connection to the challenge is a little tenuous (though I didn''t penalize you for that.)</td>', 'Nice photo, with a strong competition, but the connection to the challenge is a little tenuous (though I didn''t penalize you for that.)', '2004-06-06 06:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(752020, 80851, 3032, '<td valign="top">The raindrops, not only on the chair but also in the air, makes this photo special. Good composition/dof/color.</td>', 'The raindrops, not only on the chair but also in the air, makes this photo special. Good composition/dof/color.', '2004-06-06 07:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(752021, 80854, 3032, '<td valign="top">The "Ryder cup" image on the ball adds that little bit of extra feeling of quality / pro event, even if it was shot at the local golfcourse. Like the composition and choice of aperture. I think golf is a teamsport, because for many players the caddy gives advice etc.</td>', 'The "Ryder cup" image on the ball adds that little bit of extra feeling of quality / pro event, even if it was shot at the local golfcourse. Like the composition and choice of aperture. I think golf is a teamsport, because for many players the caddy gives advice etc.', '2004-06-06 07:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(752022, 79777, 3032, '<td valign="top">It is a shame that the challenge required ''without players'', but I get that feeling with a lot of entries. It is good, but players would make it better. :)<br/></td>', 'It is a shame that the challenge required ''without players'', but I get that feeling with a lot of entries. It is good, but players would make it better. :)', '2004-06-06 07:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(752024, 80525, 3032, '<td valign="top">Clean and simple. Technically good, ok composition. I think that a bright (fluor/neon) colored ball in the foreground would give that extra touch to make it perfect.</td>', 'Clean and simple. Technically good, ok composition. I think that a bright (fluor/neon) colored ball in the foreground would give that extra touch to make it perfect.', '2004-06-06 07:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(752031, 80727, 16488, '<td valign="top">On it''s own this is an interesting photo--conveys frustration well with the broken pencil.  Compositionis nice, like the color and placement of the pencil.   With the title this represents more of a team "effort" than a team "sport", without the title it is an interesting picture that could be applied to many situations....</td>', 'On it''s own this is an interesting photo--conveys frustration well with the broken pencil.  Compositionis nice, like the color and placement of the pencil.   With the title this represents more of a team "effort" than a team "sport", without the title it is an interesting picture that could be applied to many situations....', '2004-06-06 08:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(752039, 79777, 16488, '<td valign="top">What a beautifully composed cityscape!  It could be me, but it seems like the landscape is off level.  Like the clean, noon-time shadows--very crisp shot.</td>', 'What a beautifully composed cityscape!  It could be me, but it seems like the landscape is off level.  Like the clean, noon-time shadows--very crisp shot.', '2004-06-06 08:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(752042, 80186, 16488, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  Love the lines of the oars, they pull the composition together so well!  A little over-bright on my monitor--would like more contrast overall, but especially in the background trees in the middle of the frame.  Well chosen subject!  Good luck!</td>', 'Very nice!  Love the lines of the oars, they pull the composition together so well!  A little over-bright on my monitor--would like more contrast overall, but especially in the background trees in the middle of the frame.  Well chosen subject!  Good luck!', '2004-06-06 08:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(752043, 79956, 16488, '<td valign="top">Sweet!  Team colors on a lovely model, well posed and composed to make the most of the subject...... ah, words will fail.</td>', 'Sweet!  Team colors on a lovely model, well posed and composed to make the most of the subject...... ah, words will fail.', '2004-06-06 08:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(752044, 80899, 15920, '<td valign="top">If there is ONE American that knows what you are showing (besides me) and comments, please send me a PM.  <br/> <br/>Second, I thought that "Ole'', Ole''...." was a football (soccer in the States) song, and the All Blacks only play union (and a bit of Sevens...)  Shows you what I know as a Yank.<br/> <br/>Anyway, back to your photo: Black shirt could be much darker and a little more focused, minus a couple of points.  Composition is very solid (though I might suggest a stadium full of Wallabie fans wanting secretly to be you to add a bit of realism.) Saturation on the grass could be a little better, minus a couple of points.  <br/> <br/>Putting an All Blacks logo in your photo, plus as many points as necessary to get to 9.  So, 9 for you.<br/> <br/>Please ignore the light nature of this comment, can''t help myself.  We visited NZ a few years ago, were treated very well by you kiwis, and have been committed All Blacks fans since.  I really do like the composition, and am giving you a 9.</td>', 'If there is ONE American that knows what you are showing (besides me) and comments, please send me a PM.   Second, I thought that "Ole'', Ole''...." was a football (soccer in the States) song, and the All Blacks only play union (and a bit of Sevens...)  Shows you what I know as a Yank. Anyway, back to your photo: Black shirt could be much darker and a little more focused, minus a couple of points.  Composition is very solid (though I might suggest a stadium full of Wallabie fans wanting secretly to be you to add a bit of realism.) Saturation on the grass could be a little better, minus a couple of points.   Putting an All Blacks logo in your photo, plus as many points as necessary to get to 9.  So, 9 for you. Please ignore the light nature of this comment, can''t help myself.  We visited NZ a few years ago, were treated very well by you kiwis, and have been committed All Blacks fans since.  I really do like the composition, and am giving you a 9.', '2004-06-06 09:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(752065, 80186, 22166, '<td valign="top">this would also do for the "waiting" challenge</td>', 'this would also do for the "waiting" challenge', '2004-06-06 10:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(752079, 80483, 14614, '<td valign="top">the dust swirls make this shot.</td>', 'the dust swirls make this shot.', '2004-06-06 10:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(752082, 80815, 14614, '<td valign="top">I know you''re getting killed in the scoring because of the players :(.  Thought I''d let you know you have a fine capture.  Background is a bit distracting as is the head of the person on the grass.</td>', 'I know you''re getting killed in the scoring because of the players :(.  Thought I''d let you know you have a fine capture.  Background is a bit distracting as is the head of the person on the grass.', '2004-06-06 10:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(752083, 80899, 14614, '<td valign="top">oy, oy, oy  ;)<br/></td>', 'oy, oy, oy  ;)', '2004-06-06 10:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(752084, 79433, 14614, '<td valign="top">would like this crisper and a little less washed out.</td>', 'would like this crisper and a little less washed out.', '2004-06-06 10:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(752086, 80490, 14614, '<td valign="top">Ball glued to bat??  I like your idea here - I think a plainer bat (wood) would have worked better - less distraction from your excellent composition</td>', 'Ball glued to bat??  I like your idea here - I think a plainer bat (wood) would have worked better - less distraction from your excellent composition', '2004-06-06 10:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(752095, 80808, 22166, '<td valign="top">I like action...</td>', 'I like action...', '2004-06-06 11:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(752096, 79488, 22166, '<td valign="top">wait, don''t they call the fans "the tenth man?"</td>', 'wait, don''t they call the fans "the tenth man?"', '2004-06-06 11:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(752140, 80384, 22166, '<td valign="top">very nice still life... maybe some more contrast</td>', 'very nice still life... maybe some more contrast', '2004-06-06 12:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(752142, 79445, 22166, '<td valign="top">is this Mom''s chair? and where''s junior?</td>', 'is this Mom''s chair? and where''s junior?', '2004-06-06 12:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(752144, 80261, 16488, '<td valign="top">Clean lines.  Crisp!  I like the geometry of the pattern in this picture.  The duo-tone adds a nice twist to the modern setting.  Well done!  Good luck!</td>', 'Clean lines.  Crisp!  I like the geometry of the pattern in this picture.  The duo-tone adds a nice twist to the modern setting.  Well done!  Good luck!', '2004-06-06 12:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(752147, 80384, 16488, '<td valign="top">This pic has a nice feel to it--almost nostagic.  You''ve made an interesting composition from these items--love the worn out / well-used quality of the subjects.  Good luck with the challenge!</td>', 'This pic has a nice feel to it--almost nostagic.  You''ve made an interesting composition from these items--love the worn out / well-used quality of the subjects.  Good luck with the challenge!', '2004-06-06 12:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(752148, 80528, 16488, '<td valign="top">What wonderful color and texture this image has!  The only (minor) drawback is the mysterious black rubber-like thing at the bottom.  On the other hand, I do like that the twigs cross the basketball in the composition.  Good luck!</td>', 'What wonderful color and texture this image has!  The only (minor) drawback is the mysterious black rubber-like thing at the bottom.  On the other hand, I do like that the twigs cross the basketball in the composition.  Good luck!', '2004-06-06 12:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(752150, 80754, 16488, '<td valign="top">The lighting is interesting and I like the reflections on the ball.  The composition seems tipped a bit.  Interesting idea, but I don''t think the pin supposedly being knocked down actually works in this--not evident enough, I guess.</td>', 'The lighting is interesting and I like the reflections on the ball.  The composition seems tipped a bit.  Interesting idea, but I don''t think the pin supposedly being knocked down actually works in this--not evident enough, I guess.', '2004-06-06 12:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(752207, 80815, 21713, '<td valign="top">There''s players........</td>', 'There''s players........', '2004-06-06 14:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(752216, 80239, 9780, '<td valign="top">Nice franing and stop motion 9</td>', 'Nice franing and stop motion 9', '2004-06-06 14:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(752227, 80207, 16965, '<td valign="top">How about this: your image has a soft feeling to it, but does not have any real focal point to it.  The large dark area to the bottom left is distracting, as are the dust specs from the window of the plane.  The far distance has a lot of noise in it, and might benefit from some neatimage.  The overall feeling of the image is that of peace and solitude, but the image itself is bland and uninspired.  As for Skydiving being a team sport, in my opinion, it is not, so your image does not meet the challenge.</td>', 'How about this: your image has a soft feeling to it, but does not have any real focal point to it.  The large dark area to the bottom left is distracting, as are the dust specs from the window of the plane.  The far distance has a lot of noise in it, and might benefit from some neatimage.  The overall feeling of the image is that of peace and solitude, but the image itself is bland and uninspired.  As for Skydiving being a team sport, in my opinion, it is not, so your image does not meet the challenge.', '2004-06-06 14:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(752262, 80638, 22385, '<td valign="top">The "caging" is extremely distracting.  While the title is catchy, the photo doesn''t really have any appeal.  Less fencing, and more of the car itself would have resulted in a better photograph, in my opinon.</td>', 'The "caging" is extremely distracting.  While the title is catchy, the photo doesn''t really have any appeal.  Less fencing, and more of the car itself would have resulted in a better photograph, in my opinon.', '2004-06-06 16:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(752264, 80109, 22385, '<td valign="top">A good shot overall, but the resolution is not quite clear enough.  If you look at the field itself, there is some pixelation.  I wish it was sharper closer to the bases on the field.</td>', 'A good shot overall, but the resolution is not quite clear enough.  If you look at the field itself, there is some pixelation.  I wish it was sharper closer to the bases on the field.', '2004-06-06 16:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(752266, 80461, 22385, '<td valign="top">The jerseys are in great focus, but it would be nice to see more of the jerseys on either side of the center jersey.  The background could be more appealing.</td>', 'The jerseys are in great focus, but it would be nice to see more of the jerseys on either side of the center jersey.  The background could be more appealing.', '2004-06-06 16:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(752270, 80854, 22385, '<td valign="top">A beautifully done photograph.  The ball and the hole are in perfect focus.  This is one of my favorites in this challenge.</td>', 'A beautifully done photograph.  The ball and the hole are in perfect focus.  This is one of my favorites in this challenge.', '2004-06-06 16:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(752276, 79488, 22385, '<td valign="top">The lights along with much of the right hand side of this photo are blurry.  If that was in sharper focus, it might be a better photo overall!  Resolution is a bit low on the upper ends of the photo - some jagged edges.</td>', 'The lights along with much of the right hand side of this photo are blurry.  If that was in sharper focus, it might be a better photo overall!  Resolution is a bit low on the upper ends of the photo - some jagged edges.', '2004-06-06 16:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(752281, 80665, 22385, '<td valign="top">This one doesn''t do that much for me.  Looks like the glove is just sitting on the ground while someone throws a ball into it.  Too much noise, and I wish there was a bit more color.</td>', 'This one doesn''t do that much for me.  Looks like the glove is just sitting on the ground while someone throws a ball into it.  Too much noise, and I wish there was a bit more color.', '2004-06-06 16:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(752282, 80600, 22385, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot of the ball... it has a reflective shine that attracts my attention!  Was the ball in mid-air when you took the photo?  One of my faves in this challenge!</td>', 'Beautiful shot of the ball... it has a reflective shine that attracts my attention!  Was the ball in mid-air when you took the photo?  One of my faves in this challenge!', '2004-06-06 16:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(752284, 80822, 22385, '<td valign="top">I like this photo quite a bit... I just wish the basket and ball were in sharper focus.  The background takes a little too much attention from the focus on the shot.</td>', 'I like this photo quite a bit... I just wish the basket and ball were in sharper focus.  The background takes a little too much attention from the focus on the shot.', '2004-06-06 16:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(752286, 80521, 22385, '<td valign="top">A creative photo, but it doesn''t have much appeal... the average person would probably not find much to appreciate here.  Perhaps a hockey guru might, though!</td>', 'A creative photo, but it doesn''t have much appeal... the average person would probably not find much to appreciate here.  Perhaps a hockey guru might, though!', '2004-06-06 16:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(752287, 80261, 22385, '<td valign="top">I like the color tone in this shot.  Everything is beautifully in focus.  The border does the photo some justice, too.  Nice!</td>', 'I like the color tone in this shot.  Everything is beautifully in focus.  The border does the photo some justice, too.  Nice!', '2004-06-06 16:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(752289, 80205, 22385, '<td valign="top">Incredible detail!  The red color in the stitches is powerful, almost in a morbid sense.  Reminds me of stitches in things other than a baseball.   It has more artistic value than anything else, I think.</td>', 'Incredible detail!  The red color in the stitches is powerful, almost in a morbid sense.  Reminds me of stitches in things other than a baseball.   It has more artistic value than anything else, I think.', '2004-06-06 16:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(752290, 80207, 22385, '<td valign="top">I think this photo is a bit of a stretch... the quality of the shot is pretty good, though.</td>', 'I think this photo is a bit of a stretch... the quality of the shot is pretty good, though.', '2004-06-06 16:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(752291, 80815, 22385, '<td valign="top">This photo, while INCREDIBLE and beautifully shot, doesn''t really meet the challenge''s requirements since it has players in it!</td>', 'This photo, while INCREDIBLE and beautifully shot, doesn''t really meet the challenge''s requirements since it has players in it!', '2004-06-06 16:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(752292, 80685, 22385, '<td valign="top">A stretch... I would like to at least see some skiis or something.  For the shot itself, the focus on the mountains is pretty good, but it needs more brightness and color.</td>', 'A stretch... I would like to at least see some skiis or something.  For the shot itself, the focus on the mountains is pretty good, but it needs more brightness and color.', '2004-06-06 16:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(752293, 80515, 22385, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot!  Good close-up.  I really like the colors, too.  This tennis ball got some serious misuse, I imagine though!  Nice!</td>', 'Very interesting shot!  Good close-up.  I really like the colors, too.  This tennis ball got some serious misuse, I imagine though!  Nice!', '2004-06-06 16:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(752294, 79525, 22385, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot... it has an artistic touch to it.  Without the title, I wouldn''t think of golf, though.  Doesn''t really match the requirements of the challenge, in my opinion.</td>', 'Beautiful shot... it has an artistic touch to it.  Without the title, I wouldn''t think of golf, though.  Doesn''t really match the requirements of the challenge, in my opinion.', '2004-06-06 16:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(752295, 79875, 22385, '<td valign="top">Somewhat imaginative!  But the clouds take too much away from this shot.  More blue sky might have made this shot more appealing.  Could have cropped it so less height, too.</td>', 'Somewhat imaginative!  But the clouds take too much away from this shot.  More blue sky might have made this shot more appealing.  Could have cropped it so less height, too.', '2004-06-06 16:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(752300, 80896, 22385, '<td valign="top">Too dark... I like how the nets are photographed, though.</td>', 'Too dark... I like how the nets are photographed, though.', '2004-06-06 16:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(752301, 80158, 22385, '<td valign="top">Very interesting photo!  I like how the water reflects, except for the one shadow going over the plate in the center.  Imaginative shot, though.  I like it overall!</td>', 'Very interesting photo!  I like how the water reflects, except for the one shadow going over the plate in the center.  Imaginative shot, though.  I like it overall!', '2004-06-06 16:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(752303, 79809, 22385, '<td valign="top">The greens combined with the soccer ball has a very strange feel to it.  I like this shot, but wish the ball had more focus rather than the grass.</td>', 'The greens combined with the soccer ball has a very strange feel to it.  I like this shot, but wish the ball had more focus rather than the grass.', '2004-06-06 16:43:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(752304, 80443, 22385, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot... could have been cropped more on the left hand side.  Though it is very simple, I like it!</td>', 'Interesting shot... could have been cropped more on the left hand side.  Though it is very simple, I like it!', '2004-06-06 16:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(752305, 80682, 22385, '<td valign="top">Without the title, I wouldn''t think of team sports.  A beautiful and well-focused shot.  If this was a challenge about oranges, maybe I''d rate it much higher!</td>', 'Without the title, I wouldn''t think of team sports.  A beautiful and well-focused shot.  If this was a challenge about oranges, maybe I''d rate it much higher!', '2004-06-06 16:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(752306, 79407, 22385, '<td valign="top">Was this very saturated red part of the original shot?  It is an interesting picture and I really like it... but wish it had more natural colors.  Some sky or more of the green could have made it more appealing.</td>', 'Was this very saturated red part of the original shot?  It is an interesting picture and I really like it... but wish it had more natural colors.  Some sky or more of the green could have made it more appealing.', '2004-06-06 16:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(752309, 79580, 22385, '<td valign="top">I kinda like this photo.  Did you saturate the green in the grass?  The green seems to be running into the mud a bit.  Still it is a beautiful shot, overall.</td>', 'I kinda like this photo.  Did you saturate the green in the grass?  The green seems to be running into the mud a bit.  Still it is a beautiful shot, overall.', '2004-06-06 16:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(752310, 80451, 22385, '<td valign="top">Way too much blurriness.  Hard to tell what the shot is of.  More focus and greater emphasis on the net itself would have been nice.</td>', 'Way too much blurriness.  Hard to tell what the shot is of.  More focus and greater emphasis on the net itself would have been nice.', '2004-06-06 16:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(752312, 80806, 22385, '<td valign="top">Good focus... however, I think a shot with a score would have been more appealing.</td>', 'Good focus... however, I think a shot with a score would have been more appealing.', '2004-06-06 16:51:45.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(752313, 80876, 22385, '<td valign="top">Really cool shot!  Focus is great... good color, too.</td>', 'Really cool shot!  Focus is great... good color, too.', '2004-06-06 16:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(752314, 80186, 22385, '<td valign="top">Too dark in the foreground, and too bright on the skyline and water.  Not much color.  I think this shot would have more potential with that corrected.</td>', 'Too dark in the foreground, and too bright on the skyline and water.  Not much color.  I think this shot would have more potential with that corrected.', '2004-06-06 16:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(752316, 80210, 22385, '<td valign="top">Not quite sure what is going on in this shot.  Not much color, and I wish the ball in mid-air had more focus.  The shade toward the top of the photo takes too much away from the overall shot, too.</td>', 'Not quite sure what is going on in this shot.  Not much color, and I wish the ball in mid-air had more focus.  The shade toward the top of the photo takes too much away from the overall shot, too.', '2004-06-06 16:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(752317, 80893, 22385, '<td valign="top">With more brightness on the bottom of the shot and some more saturation in the sky and green, I think this photo would have a lot more potential!</td>', 'With more brightness on the bottom of the shot and some more saturation in the sky and green, I think this photo would have a lot more potential!', '2004-06-06 16:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(752318, 80208, 22385, '<td valign="top">The detail in the green is good... but it also takes away from the shot.  The green needs more saturation... seems like you were shooting into the sun, which took away the colors.</td>', 'The detail in the green is good... but it also takes away from the shot.  The green needs more saturation... seems like you were shooting into the sun, which took away the colors.', '2004-06-06 16:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(752319, 80784, 22385, '<td valign="top">Very dark on the top of the photo.  I like how you have divided the photo into three, but would have liked to see the middle boat/canoe more centered.</td>', 'Very dark on the top of the photo.  I like how you have divided the photo into three, but would have liked to see the middle boat/canoe more centered.', '2004-06-06 16:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(752321, 80870, 22385, '<td valign="top">Focus is good, and the border contributes to the shot.  This photo would do well in a frame on someone''s desk, but it does not really capture my attention.  A great picture, but not enough to win this challenge, I''m guessing.</td>', 'Focus is good, and the border contributes to the shot.  This photo would do well in a frame on someone''s desk, but it does not really capture my attention.  A great picture, but not enough to win this challenge, I''m guessing.', '2004-06-06 17:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(752322, 80857, 22385, '<td valign="top">Wow... I like the color tones.  Ball is in superb focus.  It looks like you edited the shot around the ball itself, though - a slight change in sharpness or brightness can be seen around it.  Very nice picture, though!</td>', 'Wow... I like the color tones.  Ball is in superb focus.  It looks like you edited the shot around the ball itself, though - a slight change in sharpness or brightness can be seen around it.  Very nice picture, though!', '2004-06-06 17:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(752324, 80463, 22385, '<td valign="top">I''m not sensing much anticipation or excitement in this shot, despite the title.  The lines on the track are a bit jagged, and I think the picture would have been better with less of the crowd... just too dark up there to contribute the shot.</td>', 'I''m not sensing much anticipation or excitement in this shot, despite the title.  The lines on the track are a bit jagged, and I think the picture would have been better with less of the crowd... just too dark up there to contribute the shot.', '2004-06-06 17:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(752325, 80839, 22385, '<td valign="top">Something about this shot is appealing to me... but overall, I wish the field was in more focus than the leaves in the foreground.  With that, I think I would have rated this shot much more highly.</td>', 'Something about this shot is appealing to me... but overall, I wish the field was in more focus than the leaves in the foreground.  With that, I think I would have rated this shot much more highly.', '2004-06-06 17:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(752327, 80490, 22385, '<td valign="top">Was the ball or bat in motion on this shot?  If so, this is an amazing photo.  I am very impressed.  Incredible focus... the "blurry" background actually makes the shot even more impactful, too!</td>', 'Was the ball or bat in motion on this shot?  If so, this is an amazing photo.  I am very impressed.  Incredible focus... the "blurry" background actually makes the shot even more impactful, too!', '2004-06-06 17:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(752328, 80831, 22385, '<td valign="top">Too blurry in the foreground - a faster shot would have been better.  Not really a fan of the background.</td>', 'Too blurry in the foreground - a faster shot would have been better.  Not really a fan of the background.', '2004-06-06 17:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(752330, 80679, 22385, '<td valign="top">Nothing great in this picture... too blurry, too dark, resolution too low.</td>', 'Nothing great in this picture... too blurry, too dark, resolution too low.', '2004-06-06 17:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(752332, 80860, 22385, '<td valign="top">Good focus on the drawing... but is that netting in the picture?  This picture really doesn''t do anything for me.</td>', 'Good focus on the drawing... but is that netting in the picture?  This picture really doesn''t do anything for me.', '2004-06-06 17:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(752334, 79880, 22385, '<td valign="top">WOW!  The darkness of the glove, crisp focus on the ball, and background sky is incredible.  This shot is very surreal looking.  If you didn''t do much editing to this shot, I bow down to your skills!</td>', 'WOW!  The darkness of the glove, crisp focus on the ball, and background sky is incredible.  This shot is very surreal looking.  If you didn''t do much editing to this shot, I bow down to your skills!', '2004-06-06 17:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(752335, 80658, 22385, '<td valign="top">I like the soft touch to the photo.  Pretty good focus on the ball in the foreground.  Not really a fan of the border, though; that border manipulates the sides of the ball so much that it is distracting.</td>', 'I like the soft touch to the photo.  Pretty good focus on the ball in the foreground.  Not really a fan of the border, though; that border manipulates the sides of the ball so much that it is distracting.', '2004-06-06 17:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(752351, 80803, 16912, '<td valign="top">hmm, is Bridge  really a sport?</td>', 'hmm, is Bridge  really a sport?', '2004-06-06 17:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(752352, 80604, 16912, '<td valign="top">UK guy here but I guess its Baseball? I like it and think B&amp;W was a wise choice. the wall on the front right seems a little overexposed to me (7)</td>', 'UK guy here but I guess its Baseball? I like it and think B&W was a wise choice. the wall on the front right seems a little overexposed to me (7)', '2004-06-06 17:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(752356, 80815, 16912, '<td valign="top">Great shot, if you had got the front guy''s hand and foot in the shot it would have been even better,  but ''Team Sports Without Players''? I think not!</td>', 'Great shot, if you had got the front guy''s hand and foot in the shot it would have been even better,  but ''Team Sports Without Players''? I think not!', '2004-06-06 17:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(752361, 80854, 16912, '<td valign="top">I was wondering how many golf shots would be here. <br/>I like the use of the Ryder Cup ball (team) but think you shold have realigned  the image to straighten the pin and  removed the brown grass?<br/>I''d love to give this shot a ''four'' but I can''t (6)</td>', 'I was wondering how many golf shots would be here. I like the use of the Ryder Cup ball (team) but think you shold have realigned  the image to straighten the pin and  removed the brown grass?I''d love to give this shot a ''four'' but I can''t (6)', '2004-06-06 18:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(752363, 80679, 16912, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, would love to know how many takes this took you? Maybe have blurred the background a little more and cropped it to remove the black thing (tree?)  on the right</td>', 'Nice shot, would love to know how many takes this took you? Maybe have blurred the background a little more and cropped it to remove the black thing (tree?)  on the right', '2004-06-06 18:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(752365, 80831, 16912, '<td valign="top">Am suprised I didn''t see (many) more of this kind of shot. I like it and the ''touch'' of motion is much better than a ''frozen'' shot. Maybe better with a more blurred background?  (7)</td>', 'Am suprised I didn''t see (many) more of this kind of shot. I like it and the ''touch'' of motion is much better than a ''frozen'' shot. Maybe better with a more blurred background?  (7)', '2004-06-06 18:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(752367, 80131, 16912, '<td valign="top">Wow, I''d like to see a ''how did I do that'' at the end of the challenge. first thought was football (soccer) but maybe volleyball? I may be wrong but not sure the birds I''d have kept the birds in the shot (9)</td>', 'Wow, I''d like to see a ''how did I do that'' at the end of the challenge. first thought was football (soccer) but maybe volleyball? I may be wrong but not sure the birds I''d have kept the birds in the shot (9)', '2004-06-06 18:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(752369, 80658, 16912, '<td valign="top">Ooh, lose the border, highlights are a  little overexposed on my monitor</td>', 'Ooh, lose the border, highlights are a  little overexposed on my monitor', '2004-06-06 18:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(752372, 80281, 15645, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.<br/>T''is strange though, when I glance at the red net, my eyes hurt :)</td>', 'Nice photo.T''is strange though, when I glance at the red net, my eyes hurt :)', '2004-06-06 18:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(752379, 80384, 14805, '<td valign="top">you could have easily increased the contrast a bit to make this pic absolutely pop.  one of my favorites.</td>', 'you could have easily increased the contrast a bit to make this pic absolutely pop.  one of my favorites.', '2004-06-06 18:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
