(752392, 79450, 14614, '<td valign="top">like the b&amp;w and grainy feel, you''ve done a good job at telling a story.</td>', 'like the b&w and grainy feel, you''ve done a good job at telling a story.', '2004-06-06 19:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
