(752409, 80582, 3306, '<td valign="top">Very Colorful. I think it would have been even better if you cropped it just above the 5th or 6th Kayak. Very nice anyway.</td>', 'Very Colorful. I think it would have been even better if you cropped it just above the 5th or 6th Kayak. Very nice anyway.', '2004-06-06 19:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
