(753596, 80851, 7560, '<td valign="top">Excellent DOF for this image. The concept of a rain/weather delay is a universal one. The thing that makes this image more interesting than other rain delay images is the focus. It''s on the seat you sit in to watch the game. The focus is on the spectator, not the game. This is one of the few sports images in this challenge that trancends most, if not all sports internationally. Find me someone who has not been stuck at a game/match when it''s rained.  This is one of my top 2 images this challenge. Well done.  10</td>', 'Excellent DOF for this image. The concept of a rain/weather delay is a universal one. The thing that makes this image more interesting than other rain delay images is the focus. It''s on the seat you sit in to watch the game. The focus is on the spectator, not the game. This is one of the few sports images in this challenge that trancends most, if not all sports internationally. Find me someone who has not been stuck at a game/match when it''s rained.  This is one of my top 2 images this challenge. Well done.  10', '2004-06-07 16:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(753599, 80658, 22688, '<td valign="top">Nice comp. great color, DOF coulda been a little better, other than that very nice</td>', 'Nice comp. great color, DOF coulda been a little better, other than that very nice', '2004-06-07 16:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
