(753846, 80281, 16965, '<td valign="top">I just love how the net snaps out in contrast to the blue sky. Incredible image!  Great framing, greart exposure (although I''m sure you''ve gotten comments on the goal posts being overexposed...even though they are not), and great blue sky!</td>', 'I just love how the net snaps out in contrast to the blue sky. Incredible image!  Great framing, greart exposure (although I''m sure you''ve gotten comments on the goal posts being overexposed...even though they are not), and great blue sky!', '2004-06-07 18:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
