(753848, 80582, 16965, '<td valign="top">This image has some greate framing, and some great colors to it!  I hope it does well, as I''m sure you''ve gotten some messages that canoeing is not a team sport.</td>', 'This image has some greate framing, and some great colors to it!  I hope it does well, as I''m sure you''ve gotten some messages that canoeing is not a team sport.', '2004-06-07 18:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
