(754177, 80528, 19608, '<td valign="top">Thought that was golf!    Looks like this one has been out for some time.  Nice exposure and colors.  Not real excited ny the black rubber-looking thing in the foreground.</td>', 'Thought that was golf!    Looks like this one has been out for some time.  Nice exposure and colors.  Not real excited ny the black rubber-looking thing in the foreground.', '2004-06-07 22:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(754184, 80854, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice macro with your focal point set perfectly at the ball/hole/  Good composition and exposure - barely holding details in the highlights on the ball.</td>', 'Nice macro with your focal point set perfectly at the ball/hole/  Good composition and exposure - barely holding details in the highlights on the ball.', '2004-06-07 22:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(754191, 80724, 19608, '<td valign="top">I like the white and orange against the dark background.  The orage area takes several shapes if you look a while.  The image doesn;''t have much other impact and is not saying much about team sports.</td>', 'I like the white and orange against the dark background.  The orage area takes several shapes if you look a while.  The image doesn;''t have much other impact and is not saying much about team sports.', '2004-06-07 22:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(754197, 80208, 19608, '<td valign="top">It''s a decent golf picture without a lot of impact.</td>', 'It''s a decent golf picture without a lot of impact.', '2004-06-07 22:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(754202, 80803, 19608, '<td valign="top">YOUr composition is effective.  I think this is one time when color works better than B&amp;W.  It''s a really long stretch for me to conside bridge a tem sport.</td>', 'YOUr composition is effective.  I think this is one time when color works better than B&W.  It''s a really long stretch for me to conside bridge a tem sport.', '2004-06-07 22:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
