(754388, 80451, 15920, '<td valign="top">I really like the background colors, the crop and the selection of an experienced net.  It might be just  abit better with a little more light on the near subject.  I scored it an 8.</td>', 'I really like the background colors, the crop and the selection of an experienced net.  It might be just  abit better with a little more light on the near subject.  I scored it an 8.', '2004-06-08 00:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
