(754654, 80515, 3306, '<td valign="top">Looks like my dog got to that one! Clever.</td>', 'Looks like my dog got to that one! Clever.', '2004-06-08 06:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(754655, 80825, 3306, '<td valign="top">This picture has potential. I would have tried some different angles and different DOF for comparison.</td>', 'This picture has potential. I would have tried some different angles and different DOF for comparison.', '2004-06-08 06:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(754658, 80596, 3306, '<td valign="top">Just an interesting angle on the seats alone would have made a photographically interesting picture and would have allowed the viewer to imagine what sport was being played. For me, showing the field adds clutter to the picture and makes it just a snapshot.</td>', 'Just an interesting angle on the seats alone would have made a photographically interesting picture and would have allowed the viewer to imagine what sport was being played. For me, showing the field adds clutter to the picture and makes it just a snapshot.', '2004-06-08 06:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(754659, 80844, 3306, '<td valign="top">Good potential here but the lighting seems too harsh and the focus is off.</td>', 'Good potential here but the lighting seems too harsh and the focus is off.', '2004-06-08 07:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(754660, 80839, 3306, '<td valign="top">I would like to see this picture with the leaves out of focus and the field in focus.</td>', 'I would like to see this picture with the leaves out of focus and the field in focus.', '2004-06-08 07:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(754661, 80762, 3306, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.</td>', 'Nice colors.', '2004-06-08 07:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(754690, 80529, 4153, '<td valign="top">good example how the title of a photo can make all the difference :o)</td>', 'good example how the title of a photo can make all the difference :o)', '2004-06-08 07:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(754817, 80825, 18667, '<td valign="top">I like the concept this photo more than nearly every other in this challenge.  I think you are too far out of focus in the front edge of the image (out of focus is good, it is just too far out), and the focus point should be just at the place where the brush meets the surface, not just behind that spot.</td>', 'I like the concept this photo more than nearly every other in this challenge.  I think you are too far out of focus in the front edge of the image (out of focus is good, it is just too far out), and the focus point should be just at the place where the brush meets the surface, not just behind that spot.', '2004-06-08 11:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(754819, 80758, 18667, '<td valign="top">I cannot tell if this picture would be better if the action were completely stopped or blurred just a little more.  A fine picture, but the blur here doesn''t relay to me the motion properly, it just looks out of focus.</td>', 'I cannot tell if this picture would be better if the action were completely stopped or blurred just a little more.  A fine picture, but the blur here doesn''t relay to me the motion properly, it just looks out of focus.', '2004-06-08 11:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(754824, 80210, 18667, '<td valign="top">Hey! I thought you had to roll the balls in this game... I didn''t know you were allowed to throw them!  I will thrash my wifes uncle next time with this strategy.<br/> <br/>Nice shot but I think the background shadow diverts the eyes too much from the rest of the image.  A lighter shadow would have worked well.</td>', 'Hey! I thought you had to roll the balls in this game... I didn''t know you were allowed to throw them!  I will thrash my wifes uncle next time with this strategy. Nice shot but I think the background shadow diverts the eyes too much from the rest of the image.  A lighter shadow would have worked well.', '2004-06-08 11:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(754837, 80803, 20531, '<td valign="top">Kinda unimportant, but I woulda flipped the ace around.  Great picture.</td>', 'Kinda unimportant, but I woulda flipped the ace around.  Great picture.', '2004-06-08 11:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
