(755315, 80758, 21724, '<td valign="top">This photo is probably going to be hurt by a lot of things.  For starters, the vast majority of people don''t consider this a team sport.  Furthermore, there are a lot of legs in this picture, and a lot of people are going to constitute that was being with players, as opposed to without.  Finally, the picture is very blurry in several areas.  If you get a low score, don''t be down on yourself - TONS of potential here, but just not right for this challenge</td>', 'This photo is probably going to be hurt by a lot of things.  For starters, the vast majority of people don''t consider this a team sport.  Furthermore, there are a lot of legs in this picture, and a lot of people are going to constitute that was being with players, as opposed to without.  Finally, the picture is very blurry in several areas.  If you get a low score, don''t be down on yourself - TONS of potential here, but just not right for this challenge', '2004-06-08 17:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
