(755443, 80685, 18374, '<td valign="top">What a nice location for a photo shoot.  I think this is a stretch for capturing the notion of skiing, though.  In my opinion this shot suffers from harsh lighting.  The mountains are properly exposed, but the foreground is too dark.  Taking this shot more towards sunrise or sunset would probably yield much nicer results with some nice contrast between the sky and mountains.</td>', 'What a nice location for a photo shoot.  I think this is a stretch for capturing the notion of skiing, though.  In my opinion this shot suffers from harsh lighting.  The mountains are properly exposed, but the foreground is too dark.  Taking this shot more towards sunrise or sunset would probably yield much nicer results with some nice contrast between the sky and mountains.', '2004-06-08 19:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
