(755928, 80131, 16301, '<td valign="top">I thought this would finish in 4th or 5th place, so "Thank you very much" to everyone for their comments, votes, and for giving me my second ribbon. I guess the $30 I invested into executing this idea paid off! i''m glad you liked it. <br/> <br/>- Thamer</td>', 'I thought this would finish in 4th or 5th place, so "Thank you very much" to everyone for their comments, votes, and for giving me my second ribbon. I guess the $30 I invested into executing this idea paid off! i''m glad you liked it.  - Thamer', '2004-06-09 01:11:45.000000', NULL, 0),
