(755957, 79777, 12962, '<td valign="top">Wow, thanks to all ... especially those who took time to comment.  Didn''t expect this to be in the top ten.  I am humbled as usual.  Thanks again.</td>', 'Wow, thanks to all ... especially those who took time to comment.  Didn''t expect this to be in the top ten.  I am humbled as usual.  Thanks again.', '2004-06-09 01:17:22.000000', NULL, 0),
