(755987, 79559, 20889, '<td valign="top">I was just voting and had not got to this pic....ran out of time...I love this shot...I thought the title fit it real well also.<br/> <br/></td>', 'I was just voting and had not got to this pic....ran out of time...I love this shot...I thought the title fit it real well also. ', '2004-06-09 01:25:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(755995, 80851, 714, '<td valign="top">Wooohooo...Terry!  Way to go!  Congrats! Awesome photo. One of my fav''s of the challenge.</td>', 'Wooohooo...Terry!  Way to go!  Congrats! Awesome photo. One of my fav''s of the challenge.', '2004-06-09 01:28:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(756025, 80261, 714, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your first ribbon.  Very nice shot.</td>', 'Congrats on your first ribbon.  Very nice shot.', '2004-06-09 01:37:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(756029, 80876, 7152, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe 6 people gave this a 1 and two a 2. People .. use your brain for a second before you click, YES cycling is a team sport !! Just because it might not be obvious right away but if you think for a second you will realize this.<br/> <br/>This was my favorite shot, I wished it finished top 3.</td>', 'I can''t believe 6 people gave this a 1 and two a 2. People .. use your brain for a second before you click, YES cycling is a team sport !! Just because it might not be obvious right away but if you think for a second you will realize this. This was my favorite shot, I wished it finished top 3.', '2004-06-09 01:37:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(756055, 80261, 16479, '<td valign="top">I gave you 9 for this. Congrats!!</td>', 'I gave you 9 for this. Congrats!!', '2004-06-09 01:46:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(756065, 80131, 16479, '<td valign="top">Just what I''ve thought.....gave you 10 for this.... Congrats!!!</td>', 'Just what I''ve thought.....gave you 10 for this.... Congrats!!!', '2004-06-09 01:49:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(756100, 80490, 12962, '<td valign="top">It was clever though.</td>', 'It was clever though.', '2004-06-09 02:01:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(756130, 80588, 7322, '<td valign="top">I don''t know why a couple people saw a person in jeans as one of the soccer players...whatever. This should have done so much better. I gave it a 9; a very rare score from me. It seems like if I like a photo a lot it is doomed to place lower than it deserves.</td>', 'I don''t know why a couple people saw a person in jeans as one of the soccer players...whatever. This should have done so much better. I gave it a 9; a very rare score from me. It seems like if I like a photo a lot it is doomed to place lower than it deserves.', '2004-06-09 02:09:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(756138, 79956, 22392, '<td valign="top">agree with flip89. this was one of my two favs. Deserved a much higher place.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-06-09 01:12:28.</i></td>', 'agree with flip89. this was one of my two favs. Deserved a much higher place.', '2004-06-09 02:12:05.000000', '2004-06-09 02:12:28.000000', 0),
(756202, 80261, 10339, '<td valign="top">Harvey - Congrats! Very nicely done. I hope to see this printed out on your wall with a blue ribbon attached the next time I stop by your office!</td>', 'Harvey - Congrats! Very nicely done. I hope to see this printed out on your wall with a blue ribbon attached the next time I stop by your office!', '2004-06-09 02:46:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(756208, 80516, 18958, '<td valign="top">I cannot understand how you can finnish 27 with a picture like that.... it make my 57 position look not too bad.... you should have finish in the first 3.. better luck nest time</td>', 'I cannot understand how you can finnish 27 with a picture like that.... it make my 57 position look not too bad.... you should have finish in the first 3.. better luck nest time', '2004-06-09 02:49:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(756213, 80876, 12962, '<td valign="top">As I said, sleek.  Congratulations on finishing top ten.  I think the ones are uncalled for.  Really.</td>', 'As I said, sleek.  Congratulations on finishing top ten.  I think the ones are uncalled for.  Really.', '2004-06-09 02:54:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(756253, 80490, 20235, '<td valign="top">Haha, I didn''t realize the ball was glued! Had me fooled. I commented during the challenge that the bat and ball were laid over a pain of glass. Probably would have been easier that way? Again, nice shot!</td>', 'Haha, I didn''t realize the ball was glued! Had me fooled. I commented during the challenge that the bat and ball were laid over a pain of glass. Probably would have been easier that way? Again, nice shot!', '2004-06-09 03:10:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(756312, 80776, 1570, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bongo:</b></div><hr/><i> Wasn''t a Kennedy killed playing this game? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>yes.</td>', 'Originally posted by bongo: Wasn''t a Kennedy killed playing this game?   yes.', '2004-06-09 04:10:16.000000', NULL, 0),
