(756324, 80679, 22418, '<td valign="top">I would like to thank everyone for their comment it has hopefully helped (we will see) me with making adjustment for my next picture</td>', 'I would like to thank everyone for their comment it has hopefully helped (we will see) me with making adjustment for my next picture', '2004-06-09 04:31:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(756393, 80131, 1368, '<td valign="top">Woooha a red ribbon! Congratulations man very well deserved!!! :D</td>', 'Woooha a red ribbon! Congratulations man very well deserved!!! :D', '2004-06-09 05:06:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(756463, 80261, 16301, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the PM concerning the simplicity and story behind this shot, congrats on the ribbon.<br/> <br/>Good luck...</td>', 'Thanks for the PM concerning the simplicity and story behind this shot, congrats on the ribbon. Good luck...', '2004-06-09 06:50:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(756467, 80681, 21594, '<td valign="top">don''t get me wrong but i''m completley dissapointed with this ribborn...helloooo...boxing doesn''t have anything...but absolutely anything to do with a ''team spot''...guys...take a dictionary and check the meaning for ''team sport''...and please understand that is not only the photographer fault...he/she just take a photo and submit it to the challange...what is very concerning is that we...the voters give high scores for a picture that doesn''t meet the challange at all...i repeat...that''s bad...we don''t know what a team spot is...</td>', 'don''t get me wrong but i''m completley dissapointed with this ribborn...helloooo...boxing doesn''t have anything...but absolutely anything to do with a ''team spot''...guys...take a dictionary and check the meaning for ''team sport''...and please understand that is not only the photographer fault...he/she just take a photo and submit it to the challange...what is very concerning is that we...the voters give high scores for a picture that doesn''t meet the challange at all...i repeat...that''s bad...we don''t know what a team spot is...', '2004-06-09 06:53:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(756473, 80681, 19552, '<td valign="top">I think you''re getting a little too caught up in whole thing, boogie. Relax. We''re not here to bastardize eachother''s art based on a few nonsensical preliminary judgements. So what it doesn''t meet the challenge; the picture is flawless, and is deserving of its ribbon place.</td>', 'I think you''re getting a little too caught up in whole thing, boogie. Relax. We''re not here to bastardize eachother''s art based on a few nonsensical preliminary judgements. So what it doesn''t meet the challenge; the picture is flawless, and is deserving of its ribbon place.', '2004-06-09 07:07:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(756483, 80186, 13025, '<td valign="top">CONGRATULATIONS! Great shot! Well done and right on the subject! Michael</td>', 'CONGRATULATIONS! Great shot! Well done and right on the subject! Michael', '2004-06-09 07:29:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(756490, 80598, 19035, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the feedback on my shot, the color version of this photo was just way to busy, in hind site I should have taken some of the trophies out and made this shot less cluttered.  I do think this pic was one of the more original ones for the challenge.  Just my 2 cents.  Thanks!</td>', 'Thanks for the feedback on my shot, the color version of this photo was just way to busy, in hind site I should have taken some of the trophies out and made this shot less cluttered.  I do think this pic was one of the more original ones for the challenge.  Just my 2 cents.  Thanks!', '2004-06-09 07:45:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(756509, 79488, 18191, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the excellent comments and feedback (18! woohoo!)<br/> <br/>Yea Terry, it is Shea :) You have quite the eye.<br/> <br/>Thanks again,<br/>Lee</td>', 'Thanks for the excellent comments and feedback (18! woohoo!) Yea Terry, it is Shea :) You have quite the eye. Thanks again,Lee', '2004-06-09 08:04:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(756528, 80490, 16301, '<td valign="top">Hey, 5.6 isn''t bad! The composition and angle are great. I think it would have placed higher with some motion :) You might want to try it as an experiment.<br/> <br/>Good luck...</td>', 'Hey, 5.6 isn''t bad! The composition and angle are great. I think it would have placed higher with some motion :) You might want to try it as an experiment. Good luck...', '2004-06-09 08:17:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(756533, 80261, 14620, '<td valign="top">Great Shot! Looks like quite a step up from ol'' Jack Murphy, er.. Qualcomm stadium. :-) Thinking about maybe making it a print?</td>', 'Great Shot! Looks like quite a step up from ol'' Jack Murphy, er.. Qualcomm stadium. :-) Thinking about maybe making it a print?', '2004-06-09 08:20:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(756585, 80261, 806, '<td valign="top">congrats on a great blue!!!</td>', 'congrats on a great blue!!!', '2004-06-09 09:14:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(756601, 80724, 22677, '<td valign="top">Just a quick note - Ultimate is a team game played with a flying disc, there are tournements over here (in the UK) and the US.</td>', 'Just a quick note - Ultimate is a team game played with a flying disc, there are tournements over here (in the UK) and the US.', '2004-06-09 09:37:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(756620, 80103, 18080, '<td valign="top">37th place. You were robbed.<br/>I loved this shot. It is well taken, the lighting is spot on and it is a unique idea.<br/>Should have scored higher in my hummble opinion.<br/>Keep up the good work.<br/> <br/>Kev<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-06-09 09:00:35.</i></td>', '37th place. You were robbed.I loved this shot. It is well taken, the lighting is spot on and it is a unique idea.Should have scored higher in my hummble opinion.Keep up the good work. Kev', '2004-06-09 09:59:00.000000', '2004-06-09 10:00:35.000000', 0),
(756666, 80490, 19952, '<td valign="top">Ha! I thought that ball looked glued on! :-) Still, I can''t imagine why this photo didn''t place higher. I had picked it for a ribbon, but that''s not the firt time I''ve been wrong. Really great idea - hope to see lots more just like it in future contests.</td>', 'Ha! I thought that ball looked glued on! :-) Still, I can''t imagine why this photo didn''t place higher. I had picked it for a ribbon, but that''s not the firt time I''ve been wrong. Really great idea - hope to see lots more just like it in future contests.', '2004-06-09 10:20:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(756671, 80261, 12253, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote on this challenge, but if I had, I am sure I would have picked this for a winner!  Great take on the challenge and great shot.</td>', 'I didn''t vote on this challenge, but if I had, I am sure I would have picked this for a winner!  Great take on the challenge and great shot.', '2004-06-09 10:22:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(756732, 80681, 21611, '<td valign="top">I dont get it. I walk around for hours "looking" for a shot that will do justice to the challenge. Can someone tell me how boxing is a team sport? Please dont take this as sour grapes, I am just looking for a little guidance for future challenges. All in all however congrats on your ribbon</td>', 'I dont get it. I walk around for hours "looking" for a shot that will do justice to the challenge. Can someone tell me how boxing is a team sport? Please dont take this as sour grapes, I am just looking for a little guidance for future challenges. All in all however congrats on your ribbon', '2004-06-09 11:05:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(756739, 80895, 18525, '<td valign="top">WTG on your personal best. I liked this photo it was simple yet effective, clear and well focused.<br/> <br/>What it lacked for me was the Wow factor so it holds little interest <br/>I scored it a 7 as did 35 others :-)<br/> <br/>How to make this photo better... I dunno, cause if I did my scores would be higher too. ;-)<br/>But I might have been inclined to place a dusty footprint on the plate.<br/>or partially in the dirt an on the plate.</td>', 'WTG on your personal best. I liked this photo it was simple yet effective, clear and well focused. What it lacked for me was the Wow factor so it holds little interest I scored it a 7 as did 35 others :-) How to make this photo better... I dunno, cause if I did my scores would be higher too. ;-)But I might have been inclined to place a dusty footprint on the plate.or partially in the dirt an on the plate.', '2004-06-09 11:12:57.000000', NULL, 0),
