(757153, 80414, 19672, '<td valign="top">yes...this was originally intended for "threes" but I missed the submission time by 10 stinking minutes *argh*<br/> <br/>anyways, when I read the sports (which I originally wasn''t interested in submitting for) I realized it applied. As nothing said it had to be an ESPN sport.  And although mostly gone in today''s era there are several re-enactment groups that do in fact do this sport.<br/> <br/>As for it being a team sport. Perhaps one should check out the SCA...particularly Pennsic which pits the rival kingdoms of the East with the kingdoms of the Middle.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.pennsicwar.org/penn33/GENERAL/photos.html" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.pennsicwar.org/penn33/GENERAL/photos.html</a> <br/> <br/>(it seems once again my photo gets knocked and decried NOT on topic when it very much is...*sigh*...ignorance is the great killer of creativity)<br/> <br/>IF YOU STILL DON''T BELIEVE IT''S A TEAM SPORT...THAN HERE!!!!<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.tirydon.org/gallery/show.aspx?id=124'', strrpos(''//www.tirydon.org/gallery/show.aspx?id=124'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.tirydon.org/gallery/show.aspx?id=124"/></td>', 'yes...this was originally intended for "threes" but I missed the submission time by 10 stinking minutes *argh* anyways, when I read the sports (which I originally wasn''t interested in submitting for) I realized it applied. As nothing said it had to be an ESPN sport.  And although mostly gone in today''s era there are several re-enactment groups that do in fact do this sport. As for it being a team sport. Perhaps one should check out the SCA...particularly Pennsic which pits the rival kingdoms of the East with the kingdoms of the Middle. //www.pennsicwar.org/penn33/GENERAL/photos.html  (it seems once again my photo gets knocked and decried NOT on topic when it very much is...*sigh*...ignorance is the great killer of creativity) IF YOU STILL DON''T BELIEVE IT''S A TEAM SPORT...THAN HERE!!!! ', '2004-06-09 14:25:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(757196, 80158, 22387, '<td valign="top">I just wanted to say thanks for all the comments only thru feedback like this can I hope to improve upon my new found hobby. This was a spur of the moment shot and a little difficult to capture. Im quite please with the rating Ive received in light of the fact this is the first time Ive competed in anything like this. For some who has only owned a camera for a few weeks I would have to say Im impressed with what Ive accomplished with this one photo. I truly appreciate all the feedback there are some great photos on this site and I am pleased to see the whiners who won and I thank everyone for the opportunity to participate. I will continue to struggle as I learn to express myself in this media. Just smiling from ear to ear from all the great people on this site.</td>', 'I just wanted to say thanks for all the comments only thru feedback like this can I hope to improve upon my new found hobby. This was a spur of the moment shot and a little difficult to capture. Im quite please with the rating Ive received in light of the fact this is the first time Ive competed in anything like this. For some who has only owned a camera for a few weeks I would have to say Im impressed with what Ive accomplished with this one photo. I truly appreciate all the feedback there are some great photos on this site and I am pleased to see the whiners who won and I thank everyone for the opportunity to participate. I will continue to struggle as I learn to express myself in this media. Just smiling from ear to ear from all the great people on this site.', '2004-06-09 14:42:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(757228, 80825, 22387, '<td valign="top">I have to say this was my top pick I really didnt notice the focus thing but I can see where that would improve the shot main thing for me was the subject matter. I feel this is such a classic site when it comes to baseball but its also isnt a vision that is captured to often. Everyone puts such emphasis on throwing the first pitch and things like that but what about keeping the base clean so the pitcher can throw a good clean strike bravo and by the way technically the umpire isnt a player so this gets technical marks with me to quite cleaver.</td>', 'I have to say this was my top pick I really didnt notice the focus thing but I can see where that would improve the shot main thing for me was the subject matter. I feel this is such a classic site when it comes to baseball but its also isnt a vision that is captured to often. Everyone puts such emphasis on throwing the first pitch and things like that but what about keeping the base clean so the pitcher can throw a good clean strike bravo and by the way technically the umpire isnt a player so this gets technical marks with me to quite cleaver.', '2004-06-09 15:00:40.000000', NULL, 0),
