(758181, 80261, 22483, '<td valign="top">I''ll Start off with "I like it". And now the tough stuff :)<br/>This photo has the potential to be so much better. You were right to think this was a brilliant capsilation of team without players, but you declined to take any risk with the framing. As I look at the photo I can see three things I might have chosen to be focus on, to get closer. The Jersey''s, the gloves/shoes/equipment, and finally the name tags for each locker. As a viewer of the photo, I don''t want to be confused about what the most important part of the photo is, I want to be up close and personal with it. This to me is a blanket photo to scene you new was momerable, but lacks the articulation of someone who know''s exactly what''s special to him about it.</td>', 'I''ll Start off with "I like it". And now the tough stuff :)This photo has the potential to be so much better. You were right to think this was a brilliant capsilation of team without players, but you declined to take any risk with the framing. As I look at the photo I can see three things I might have chosen to be focus on, to get closer. The Jersey''s, the gloves/shoes/equipment, and finally the name tags for each locker. As a viewer of the photo, I don''t want to be confused about what the most important part of the photo is, I want to be up close and personal with it. This to me is a blanket photo to scene you new was momerable, but lacks the articulation of someone who know''s exactly what''s special to him about it.', '2004-06-10 02:43:13.000000', NULL, 0),
