(759218, 80724, 11832, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bongo:</b></div><hr/><i> Not hot enough. Sorry. Good try but not a team sport. I know...others will argue.<br/>My opinion only...two people playing catch is not a team sport either. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>ultimate frisbee IS a team sport. in my neighborhood its played with about 3-5 players per team.</td>', 'Originally posted by bongo: Not hot enough. Sorry. Good try but not a team sport. I know...others will argue.My opinion only...two people playing catch is not a team sport either.   ultimate frisbee IS a team sport. in my neighborhood its played with about 3-5 players per team.', '2004-06-11 00:06:17.000000', NULL, 0),
