(759626, 80279, 15486, '<td valign="top">Its a flower (clematis), sitting amongst other flowers, waiting for the shade to pass so that it too can bask in the sunshine. Better than some "artistic" shot of goalpoasts at night that nobody can see. Dont make smart coments without reading the title of my photographs first please.</td>', 'Its a flower (clematis), sitting amongst other flowers, waiting for the shade to pass so that it too can bask in the sunshine. Better than some "artistic" shot of goalpoasts at night that nobody can see. Dont make smart coments without reading the title of my photographs first please.', '2004-06-11 12:44:53.000000', NULL, 0),
