(762951, 80681, 11738, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by slingshot:</b></div><hr/><i> I dont get it. I walk around for hours "looking" for a shot that will do justice to the challenge. Can someone tell me how boxing is a team sport? Please dont take this as sour grapes, I am just looking for a little guidance for future challenges. All in all however congrats on your ribbon </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Umm... here''s your <a href="//boxing.about.com/library/bl_oly_2000.htm" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">answer</a>.</td>', 'Originally posted by slingshot: I dont get it. I walk around for hours "looking" for a shot that will do justice to the challenge. Can someone tell me how boxing is a team sport? Please dont take this as sour grapes, I am just looking for a little guidance for future challenges. All in all however congrats on your ribbon   Umm... here''s your answer.', '2004-06-14 15:57:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(763122, 80131, 7291, '<td valign="top">Congrats on a cool pic.  Really does give a sense of the sport.  But I have one question, how did you get so much motion blur at 1/320 sec?</td>', 'Congrats on a cool pic.  Really does give a sense of the sport.  But I have one question, how did you get so much motion blur at 1/320 sec?', '2004-06-14 18:31:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(763227, 80681, 10124, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Beagleboy:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by slingshot:</b></div><hr/><i> I dont get it. I walk around for hours "looking" for a shot that will do justice to the challenge. Can someone tell me how boxing is a team sport? Please dont take this as sour grapes, I am just looking for a little guidance for future challenges. All in all however congrats on your ribbon </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Umm... here''s your <a href="//boxing.about.com/library/bl_oly_2000.htm" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">answer</a>. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks for posting that bit of info.<br/></td>', 'Originally posted by Beagleboy: Originally posted by slingshot: I dont get it. I walk around for hours "looking" for a shot that will do justice to the challenge. Can someone tell me how boxing is a team sport? Please dont take this as sour grapes, I am just looking for a little guidance for future challenges. All in all however congrats on your ribbon   Umm... here''s your answer.   Thanks for posting that bit of info.', '2004-06-14 20:27:58.000000', NULL, 0),
