(825937, 80762, 13610, '<td valign="top">What kind of glue did you use??? Very good photo, very good idea. At first, I tought that shooting that photo at an other time of the day in order to get the sun in front would have been better, BUT, after looking  a little longer to it, I kind of liked the color the sun gave to the images at that specific moments. Maybe overexposing a little bit in order to get more contrast would have done the job well. Great photo anyway. Congratulations.</td>', 'What kind of glue did you use??? Very good photo, very good idea. At first, I tought that shooting that photo at an other time of the day in order to get the sun in front would have been better, BUT, after looking  a little longer to it, I kind of liked the color the sun gave to the images at that specific moments. Maybe overexposing a little bit in order to get more contrast would have done the job well. Great photo anyway. Congratulations.', '2004-07-26 11:36:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(924158, 80851, 22975, '<td valign="top">I''m taking an Intro to Photography class, and we just went over how to adjust our depth of field using a wide aperture and a fast shutter speed... and this is a fabulous example of this technique.  This also was an excellent representation of the challenge.  I really like this one.  (I wasn''t aware of this site when this challenge took place, but I would have scored it high.)  Anyway, good job.  :)  Thanks for helping me recognize the technique!</td>', 'I''m taking an Intro to Photography class, and we just went over how to adjust our depth of field using a wide aperture and a fast shutter speed... and this is a fabulous example of this technique.  This also was an excellent representation of the challenge.  I really like this one.  (I wasn''t aware of this site when this challenge took place, but I would have scored it high.)  Anyway, good job.  :)  Thanks for helping me recognize the technique!', '2004-09-23 22:59:16.000000', NULL, 0),
